Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}In the Still of the Night - The Five Satins
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? In the still of the night ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.84,0:01:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? I held you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? Held you tight ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.67,0:01:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? 'Cause I love ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.34,0:01:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? Love you so ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.84,0:01:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? Promise I'll never ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.92,0:01:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? Let you go ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.09,0:01:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? In the still of the night ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.05,0:01:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? In the still of the night ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? I remember ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.09,0:01:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? That night in May ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.42,0:01:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? The stars were bright above ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.00,0:01:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? I'll hope and I'll pray ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.13,0:01:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? To keep Your precious love... ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我年轻的时候  以为刷房子真就是刷房子\NWhen I was young, I thought house painters painted houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂什么\NWhat did I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.50,0:02:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时是个工人\NI was a working guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.88,0:02:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,南费城的卡车司机107号地方工会的工会代表\NA business agent for Teamster Local 107 out of South Philly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.88,0:02:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,千百个工人中的一员\NOne of a thousand working stiffs...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.96,0:02:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,直到我不再是了\Nuntil I wasn't no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.75,0:02:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,然后\NAnd then...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.96,0:02:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我开始刷房子\NI started painting houses...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.71,0:02:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,亲自\Nmyself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.21,0:02:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}他们女儿的婚礼\N格蕾丝·安妮·巴法利诺\N嫁给\N罗伯特·里特
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.00,0:02:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,在这件事情上\NIn this particular matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.38,0:02:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都是围绕着婚礼的\Nthe whole thing was built around the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.13,0:02:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔·巴法利诺的女儿在底特律结婚\NBill Bufalino's daughter was getting married in Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.55,0:03:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔是卡车司机工会的律师  但更重要的是\NBill was a Teamster lawyer, but more important,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.71,0:03:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他是罗素·巴法利诺的表亲\Nhe was Russell Bufalino's cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.00,0:03:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素不想坐飞机\NNow, Russell didn't want to fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.42,0:03:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我打算开车送他去参加婚礼\Nso I was gonna drive him to the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.30,0:03:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他想顺路处理一些生意上的事情\NHe wanted to take care of some business along the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.63,0:03:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,对罗素而言  这就意味着一件事\Nwhich in Russell's case meant only one thing:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.34,0:03:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,钱  收钱\NMoney... collecting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.21,0:03:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们开车去的\NSo we'd drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.71,0:03:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他和他老婆凯丽  以及我和我老婆艾琳\NHim and his wife Carrie and me and my wife Irene.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.96,0:03:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我喊她琳妮\NOr I call her Reenie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.34,0:03:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我想着我们走费城外的476号公路\NI figured we would take 476 out of Philly,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们到匹兹顿接上罗素\Nand then we go up to Pittston and pick up Russ,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.50,0:03:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一般都是这么走的\Nwhich is usually how we did it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.13,0:03:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,然后沿80号州际公路西段开过宾州\Nand then Interstate 80 West through the rest of Pennsylvania,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.25,0:03:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们横穿俄亥俄州到托莱多\Nand then we'd go across Ohio, all the way to Toledo,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.50,0:03:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,接着我们沿着75号公路北上底特律\Nand then we would go 75 North to Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.00,0:03:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,总共要花三天\NIt was gonna take about three days
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,算上所有谈生意以及抽烟的时间\Nwith all the business breaks and cigarette stops,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.59,0:04:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,因为罗素不允许任何人在车里面抽烟\Nsince Russell didn't allow nobody to smoke in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他说蓝眼睛吉米和迈尔·兰斯基\NHe says Jimmy Blue Eyes and Meyer Lansky
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,说服他戒了烟\Nconvinced him to stop smoking
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.46,0:04:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,当时他们从自己在古巴的赌场里被赶了出去\Nwhen they were getting kicked out of their casinos in Cuba
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.92,0:04:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,还被卡斯特罗开枪打了\Nand getting shot at by Castro.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我也说不清楚  也许是那种\NI don't know. It might have been one of those,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.09,0:04:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,"上帝啊如果我活着度过这一劫\N"Please-God-if-I-ever-get-out- of-this-fucking-thing-alive-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我就再也不抽烟了"的情况\NI'll-never-smoke-again things too."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.34,0:04:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,但我知道从卡斯特罗那件事开始\NBut I do know that from Castro on,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.71,0:04:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素就再也不许别人在车里抽烟了\NRuss wouldn't allow nobody to smoke in his car,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.25,0:04:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,就连凯丽也不行\Nnot even Carrie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.13,0:04:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}听说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.96,0:04:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}刷房子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.05,0:04:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,能尽快停车吗\NCan we stop soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.38,0:04:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚上车两分钟  亲爱的\NWe're only in the car two minutes, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.21,0:04:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至还没上公路呢\NWe're not even near the highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.67,0:04:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道  罗素  但你不喜欢在公路上停车\NI know, Russell. But you don't like to stop on the highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.09,0:04:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,也不能这么说\NWell, it's not that so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.34,0:05:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是他们不允许你在公路上停车\NThey don't let you stop on the highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.00,0:05:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  那我们就在车里抽吧\NOkay, so then we'll smoke in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.34,0:05:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我的白内障怎么办\NAnd what about my cataracts?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.96,0:05:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我会开窗的\NI'll crack the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.05,0:05:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,凯丽  我发过誓的  记得吗\NCarrie, I made a vow. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.46,0:05:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,记得我发过誓吗  凯丽\NRemember I made a vow, Carrie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  这下我不能在...\NYeah, now I can't smoke on...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.75,0:05:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,行吧  这下我不能抽烟了\NAll right, and now I can't smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.88,0:05:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,看见我们到哪了吗\NSee where we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.46,0:05:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那是...\NIs... Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.80,0:05:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,太巧了吧\NWhat are those odds?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.17,0:05:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}德士古石油
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.88,0:06:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,出什么问题了  小子\NWhat's the problem, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道  感觉车坏了\NI don't... I don't know. It sounds funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.30,0:07:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,车停了  再启动  就没动力了\NIt stops, it starts, it loses power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我看看能不能给你搭把手\NLet me see if I can give you a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我看看  检查一下这些塞子\NLet me see. Check all these plugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,火花塞没问题\NSpark plugs are okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.30,0:07:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,分电盘盖也没问题\NThe distributor cap's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.71,0:07:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\NGood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是这个...出问题了\NIt's gotta be something with... with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.71,0:07:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,定时链\NTiming chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.46,0:07:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这么回事  这上面有个塞子\NThis is what this is. There's a cap on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.00,0:07:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这个塞子松了  不应该松的\NThis cap is loose. It ain't supposed to be loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.63,0:07:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,所以这意味着它们已经老化了\NSo that means they're getting worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.55,0:07:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你得...\NYou just gotta...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.96,0:07:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,试试  拧紧它\NTry that now. Tighten it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.80,0:07:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我会开车  但不会修车\NI can drive 'em. I can't fix 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.42,0:07:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以重新上路了  小子\NYou're back in business, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.55,0:07:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了\NThanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.71,0:07:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-我怎么回报你呢  -不用\N- I owe you anything? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.30,0:07:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用回报我\NNo, you don't owe me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.71,0:07:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了\NThanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-我叫弗兰克  -你好  弗兰克\N- Frank. - Hey, Frank. How ya doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.92,0:08:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫什么\NWhat's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你是哪里人\NWhere you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.50,0:08:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-费城  -你是费城人啊\N- Philly. - Oh, you're from Philly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.30,0:08:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,在费城你一般去哪玩\NWhere you hang out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.55,0:08:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,卡拉汉\NCallahan's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.25,0:08:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,滚球俱乐部\NBocce Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.54,0:08:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但那是个酒吧  不是玩滚球的俱乐部\NBut it's a bar, it's not a bocce club.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.96,0:08:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是嘛  你玩滚球吗\NOh, yeah. You play bocce?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.92,0:08:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不玩\NNah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.13,0:08:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  弗兰克  把那玩意修好\NAll right, Frankie... get that fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.09,0:08:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,因为它肯定还会掉链子的  我告诉你\NBecause it'll go again on you, I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-谢谢  -好了\N- Thank you. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.59,0:08:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我会去修的  再次感谢\NI will. Thanks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.62,0:08:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运  小兄弟\NGood luck, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.42,0:08:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为他是加油站老板\NI mean, I thought maybe he owned the gas station.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.05,0:08:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他一定是个老板  看得出来\N'Cause he owned something, you could tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.46,0:08:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,结果发现整条路都是他的\NYeah, it turns out he owned the whole road.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.50,0:09:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}I Hear You Knockin' - Smiley Lewis
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.50,0:09:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? You went away and left me long time ago ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:08:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}牛排和猪排
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.10,0:09:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}友好酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.20,0:09:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? And now you're knocking on my door ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.38,0:09:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这只吗\NThis one?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.91,0:09:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? I hear you knocking ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.09,0:09:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,敬礼  干了  朋友们\NSalute! Drink up, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝保佑\NGod bless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.34,0:09:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,走着  走着  今天一起赚点钱\NLet's go. Let's go. Let's make some money today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.55,0:09:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是个酒吧\NIt's a bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.42,0:09:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,向你老婆问好\NSay hello to your wife, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.34,0:09:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个赚钱的法子  推销那些后腿肉\NI got a way you can earn, to push those hindquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.00,0:09:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有个人  他会为此出大价钱的\NThere's a guy in here, he'll pay a lot of money for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.67,0:09:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧  我们先干了再谈生意\NCome on, let's shoot this first and then we'll talk business.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.17,0:09:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,在酒吧的另一头  十二点钟方向...\NAt the other end of the bar, at twelve o'clock...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.13,0:09:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,看见他了吗  有点秃的那个\NYou see him? He's got a rescinding hairline.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.96,0:09:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  他能让你赚大钱\NYeah, you'll make a lot of money with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,看见他了吗  瘦剃刀  他是这地方的老板\NSee him there? Skinny Razor. He owns the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.46,0:09:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,剃刀\NRazor?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.55,0:09:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他放高利贷  还在酒吧开了个赌注站\NHe shylocks and runs a little book out of the joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.75,0:09:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他挺能耐的  人脉很广\NHe's got a lot of good action, good connections.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.55,0:09:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-他叫剃刀  -是的  他曾经在肉店工作\N- Razor's his name? - Yeah, he used to work at a butcher shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.09,0:09:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我朋友爱尔兰人弗兰克在这里\NMy friend Frank Irish is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.51,0:09:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我和你说过的那个\NThe one I told you about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-开卡车的  -对  运后腿肉\N- Oh, the truck. - Yeah, hindquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.50,0:09:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我是弗兰克·希兰\NFrank Sheeran.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.38,0:10:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢牛排吗\NYou like steak?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.63,0:10:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢\NI do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.80,0:10:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我送牛排\NI deliver steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.96,0:10:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\NDo ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,上好的牛排\NGood steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以给你送牛排\NI could deliver you steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-可以吗  -可以\N- Could ya? - I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.67,0:10:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,价格也公道  最低价\NGood price too. The best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.00,0:10:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们晚点再聊  -好的\N- We'll talk later. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.75,0:10:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了  瘦子\NThanks, Skinny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.38,0:10:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,外面冷死了\NIt's freezing out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.82,0:10:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我不介意\NI don't mind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.13,0:10:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我不行  我怕冷\NNot me. I hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我个忙  你出去的时候...\NHey, do me a favor. When you go outside...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.50,0:10:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我把封条装上\Nput the seal on for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.46,0:10:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-好吧  反正我得出去  -我欠你个人情\N- All right. I gotta go out anyway. - I owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.75,0:10:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? You'd better go back to your used-to-be ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.50,0:10:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? Because your love's no good to me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.46,0:10:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? I hear you knocking ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.09,0:10:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}友好酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.96,0:11:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? But you can't come in ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.09,0:11:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? I hear you knocking ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? Go back where you've been ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.21,0:11:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? They call, they call me the fat man ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.92,0:11:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? 'Cause I weigh two hundred pounds... ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.75,0:11:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}25块  A级后腿肉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.30,0:11:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,给  弗兰克\NThere you go, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.34,0:11:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-下次见  -好的  托尼  谢了\N- See you next time. - All right, Tony. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.88,0:11:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好多了  弗兰克\NMuch better, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.55,0:12:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我不碰特选级  只运极佳级\NI don't go near Choice. I only do Prime. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.55,0:12:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an3\pos(380,235)}美国牛肉分级制度中\N极佳级和特选级\N分别为最好的前两个等级
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.84,0:12:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,下周二能再给我搞一些来吗\NCan I get some more for next Tuesday?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.13,0:12:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要多少\NHow many you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.09,0:12:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,至少五块\NAt least five.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.05,0:12:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好的  给你五块\NOkay. Five, you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.67,0:12:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-阿门  -阿门\N- Amen. - Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.63,0:12:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,阿门\NAmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.34,0:12:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这他妈是怎么回事\NWhat the fuck is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼  我不...\NTony, I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这他妈是怎么回事  弗兰克\NWhat the fuck is this, Frank?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.14,0:12:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\NI don't... I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.42,0:12:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说...\NI mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.75,0:12:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,车不是我装的\NI don't load the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.63,0:12:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是装车的人装的车\NThe loaders are supposed to load the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.25,0:12:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他们没干好自己的活儿  我不知道\NMaybe they didn't do their work. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.55,0:12:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你没意识到车变轻了吗\NYou didn't realize you were driving a light horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.05,0:12:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没有  我只是...\NNo. I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.99,0:12:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,没意识到  感觉挺正常的\NNothing. It felt fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.13,0:12:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托  弗兰克  拜托\NOh, come on, Frank. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.17,0:12:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的是真的  我...\NI'm telling you. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.21,0:12:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,千真万确  我真不知道是怎么回事\NGod's truth. I just don't know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.38,0:12:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道  也许是...\NI don't know. Maybe some...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.75,0:13:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-车是空的  -我知道\N- It's empty. - I know it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.84,0:13:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\NI know it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你们看什么看  回去工作\NWhat are you guys looking at? Go back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.63,0:13:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人\NAll of youse!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.80,0:13:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么和老板交待\NWhat am I gonna tell the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.30,0:13:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了我真不知道是怎么回事\NWell, I'm telling you that I don't know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.25,0:13:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,别问我  因为我...\NJust don't look at me 'cause I, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.09,0:13:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那我还能去问谁\NWell, who else can I look at?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.38,0:13:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事可不能怪在我头上  弗兰克\NThis is not gonna be on me, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.00,0:13:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-我都说了  -也怪不到我头上\N- I'm telling you right now. - Not gonna be on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.13,0:13:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是开车的  别的什么都没干\NI just drive the truck. That's all I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.55,0:13:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  弗兰克·希兰  是叫这个吗\NOkay, Frank Sheeran. Am I saying that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.75,0:13:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}律师\N威廉·E·巴法利诺
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.34,0:13:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  就是这名字\NYeah, you said right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.00,0:13:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,根据合同  这得感谢吉米·霍法\NUnder the contract, thanks to Jimmy Hoffa...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.21,0:13:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,管理层只能在有非常具体的指控时才能开除司机\Nmanagement can only fire a driver on very specific charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.59,0:13:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-你上班迟到过吗  -没有\N- So, you ever show up late? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-有任何交通违规吗  -没有\N- Do you have any moving violations? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.63,0:13:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-你在工作期间喝酒吗  -不喝\N- Do you drink on the job? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.42,0:13:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你打过人吗\NYou ever hit anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.38,0:13:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-在工作期间吗  -对\N- On the job? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.55,0:13:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-那没有  -好的\N- No. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.75,0:13:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,偷窃不算吗\NWhat about stealing, that ain't grounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.30,0:13:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛\NWell...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.00,0:13:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他们能证明吗\Ncan they prove it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.21,0:13:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不能\NI don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.25,0:13:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那就没什么好担心的了\NAll right then, we don't have nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.25,0:14:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他们能证明\NIf they can prove it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.21,0:14:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也只是想让你供出其他同伙的名字\Nthey're just gonna want names from you. Accomplices.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,仅此而已  你交代几个名字就能回家了\NThat's all. You give them a couple of names, you go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,还能保住你的工作\NKeep your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.59,0:14:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样\NWhat do you think about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.50,0:14:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-你会交代名字吗  -不\N- Would you give them names? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.96,0:14:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没有名字\NNo names.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吧  我并不...\NYou know, I don't, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.13,0:14:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我并不关心你到底做没做\NI don't care whether you did it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.30,0:14:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说没有区别\NThat makes no difference to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.50,0:14:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-我知道  -我是来帮你辩护的  对吧\N- Yeah, I know. - I'm here to defend you. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.17,0:14:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,对\NRight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.09,0:14:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么  你想知道我到底做没做吗\NWhat, you want to know if I did it or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.67,0:14:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛\NWell...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎样我都会替你辩护\NI'm gonna defend you either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.25,0:14:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道  只是...\NYeah, all right, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.17,0:14:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我没偷他们东西时可是勤勤恳恳工作的\NI, I work hard for them when I ain't stealing from 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.21,0:14:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,法官大人  如果这是是非对错的问题\NYour Honor, if this was about right or wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.63,0:14:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,公司应该早就开除希兰先生了\Nthe company would have sought Mr. Sheeran's dismissal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.21,0:14:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,可他们没有\NThey didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.46,0:14:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他们指控希兰先生\NThey only accused Mr. Sheeran
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.21,0:14:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,只是因为公司希望他能指认同伙\Nbecause the company hoped he could name conspirators,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,而他没法指认  因为并不存在什么同伙\Nwhich he couldn't do because they don't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.92,0:15:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不存在同伙是因为他并没有偷东西\NThey don't exist because he didn't steal anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.71,0:15:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他没偷东西是因为他是个模范员工\NHe didn't steal anything because he's an exemplary employee,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.38,0:15:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,工作八年都没请过一天病假\Nwho in eight years has never taken a day of sick leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.38,0:15:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他唯一违反过的只有他自己工会的规矩\NThe only rule he ever broke is his own union's,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.46,0:15:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,在冷死人的大冬天  帮其他人把半扇半扇的牛肉\Nby helping others carry sides of beef from his truck
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.75,0:15:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,从他的卡车上搬进他们的冷藏库里\Nto their refrigerators in the dead of winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.42,0:15:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,全体起立\NAll rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.50,0:15:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,现在开庭\NCourt is in session.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我要驳回此案并给予警告\NI'm dismissing this case with a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.09,0:15:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好的  法官大人\NYes, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.09,0:15:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不  不是警告你  希兰先生\NNo, no, not you, Mr. Sheeran.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.05,0:15:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你们下次要是再把工人告上法庭\NYou bring another working man before this court
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.55,0:15:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,没有证据而只有威胁\Nwith threats instead of evidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.25,0:15:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我  你们会后悔的\Nbelieve me, you'll be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.92,0:15:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我持有这家公司的股份  我一定赶紧卖了\NIf I owned stock in this company, I would sell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.67,0:15:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道他怎么做到的  我也不会问\NI don't know how he did it, and I ain't gonna ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.05,0:15:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我只知道比尔·巴法利诺帮我摆脱了一件\NAll I know is that Bill Bufalino got me out of
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.09,0:15:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我原本绝无可能脱身的案子\Na case where I should never have gotten away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.75,0:15:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}罗马别墅餐厅酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.05,0:15:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我本该彻底败诉的\NI should've been down for the count.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.55,0:15:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,人们会感谢你今天的所作所为  弗兰克\NPeople are gonna appreciate what you did today, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.05,0:15:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他们有家人  有孩子\NYou know, they got families, they got kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.05,0:15:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他们需要这些工作\NThey need those jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.05,0:16:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,然而  我们却在外庆祝\NInstead, we went out celebrating...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.17,0:16:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素\NRussell!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.88,0:16:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,而我则就此走上了\N...and I met what was gonna turn out to be
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.59,0:16:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,余生的道路\Nthe rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.50,0:16:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我就觉得刚进来的人是你\NYou know, I thought that was you walking in outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.71,0:16:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了  这可是我们的地盘\NYeah, yeah, you know, this is our place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.55,0:16:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你介绍个叫弗兰克的新人吧\NCan I introduce you to this new guy Frank?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.92,0:16:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,当然  好的\NYeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.34,0:16:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克  来见见我的表兄罗素·巴法利诺\NFrank, I want you to meet my cousin Russell Bufalino.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.88,0:16:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-你好啊  -你好  幸会\N- How are ya? - Hi, nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.50,0:16:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,几个月前你帮我修过我的卡车\NYou helped me with my truck a couple of months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.75,0:16:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  想起来了  定时链坏了\NOh, yeah, yeah, that's right. The timing chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.09,0:16:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-对  -你找人修了吗\N- Yeah. - Did you get it fixed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.59,0:16:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-我第二天就找人修了  -好样的\N- I fixed it the next day, yeah. - Attaboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.75,0:16:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-再次感谢你  -不客气\N- Thanks again. - Oh, you're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.80,0:16:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我的荣幸  你修好了就好\NMy pleasure. I'm glad you fixed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.34,0:16:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好注意点\NYou better watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有很多不好惹的家伙  他跟你说了吗\NThere's a lot of tough guys around here. Did he tell ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.88,0:16:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你并不怕不好惹的家伙  是吧\NYou're not afraid of tough guys, are ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.30,0:16:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,对\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我想也是  回见\NI didn't think so. I'll see you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.34,0:16:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-好的  -谢了  罗素\N- Okay. - Thanks, Russell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.96,0:16:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你表兄之前帮了我大忙\NYour cousin saved my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.96,0:16:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我可能会损失一整车的货\NI could've lost the whole load.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.46,0:16:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  他非常了解卡车\NYeah, yeah. Well, he knows everything about trucks, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.21,0:16:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他在汽水公司干过很长时间\NYeah, he worked at Canada Dry for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.05,0:16:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-维托  你好吗  -幸会\N- Vito, how are you? - Pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.09,0:16:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去坐卡座吧\NI think, uh... Let's take the booth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.13,0:17:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧  你会喜欢这里的\NCome on. You're gonna love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.55,0:17:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我当时还不知道罗素·巴法利诺是谁\NMaybe I didn't know who Russell Bufalino was back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.75,0:17:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但我在报纸上看过无数照片和报道\Nbut I'd seen enough pictures and stories in the newspapers
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.59,0:17:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,足以知道当时跟他一起吃饭的是安吉洛·布鲁诺\Nto know he was eatin' with Angelo Bruno.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁诺当时刚成为\NI mean, Bruno, he... he was just made
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.38,0:17:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,费城的新任老大\Nthe new boss of Philadelphia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.34,0:17:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,从费城到大西洋城的一切都由他负责\NHe took care of everything from Philadelphia to Atlantic City.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.46,0:17:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这点我是知道的\NThat, I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.13,0:17:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}安吉洛·布鲁诺\N1980年在自家门外的自家车里\N头部中枪而亡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.09,0:17:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,而我当时只需知道这些\NAnd that was all I had to know
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.05,0:17:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,就能知道罗素·巴法利诺\Nto know that Russell Bufalino
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.80,0:17:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,绝不是汽水公司的卡车维修工\Nwas no truck mechanic from Canada Dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.59,0:17:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这面包真棒\NThis bread is very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.96,0:17:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-好吃吧  -好吃\N- Good, eh? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.92,0:17:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样的爱尔兰人是在哪学的意大利语\NWhere did an Irisher like you learn to speak Italian?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.67,0:17:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,在意大利  二战的时候\NIn Italy - the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.67,0:17:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,意大利哪里\NWhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.46,0:17:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,萨莱诺\NSalerno.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,安齐奥\NAnzio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.92,0:17:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,西西里岛\NSicily...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.30,0:17:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,卡塔尼亚附近\Naround Catania.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.46,0:18:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,卡塔尼亚  我就是卡塔尼亚人\NCatania? I'm from Catania.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.42,0:18:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗  我就觉得你有点卡塔尼亚口音\NYeah? I thought you had an accent like Catania.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.30,0:18:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你参战了多久\NHow long were you in the war?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.55,0:18:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,四年\NFour years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.21,0:18:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,411天在战场上\N411 days in combat...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.88,0:18:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,122天在安齐奥\N122 at Anzio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.55,0:18:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,45步兵团的\NForty-fifth Infantry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\NMinchia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.30,0:18:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-是啊  -天啊\N- Yeah. - Minchia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,对的\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.25,0:18:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你当时怕死吗\NWere you afraid of dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.55,0:18:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,一直很怕\NAlways afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.50,0:18:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,要是有人说他不怕可千万别信\NAnd don't let anybody tell you that they weren't afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.92,0:18:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-那纯属胡扯  知道吗  -是啊\N- That's a lot of bullshit. You know? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.21,0:18:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,人人都很害怕  而且会经常祈祷\NEverybody's afraid. And you pray a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.09,0:18:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我就经常祈祷\NI prayed a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.71,0:18:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我祈祷说  要是能活着离开\NI prayed that I'd never sin again as long as I live
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.34,0:18:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我这辈子一定再也不沾染罪恶\Nif I could just get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.50,0:18:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但紧接着战斗就开始了\NBut then the fighting starts
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.75,0:18:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你就把一切都忘了\Nand then you forget about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.21,0:18:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你只想活下来  保住小命\NYou're just trying to survive, stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.75,0:19:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,当我明白自己撑过了战争时\NOnce I saw that I was getting through the war,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.46,0:19:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我看了看自己的周围  说...\NI looked around me, I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.09,0:19:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我说  "从现在起  一切顺其自然"\NI said, "From now on, whatever happens, happens."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.46,0:19:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,听天由命  去他的\NChe successe successe. Fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.75,0:19:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂的  你接到命令就得奉命行事\NYou know, you got orders, you follow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.38,0:19:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们让你带几个俘虏去树林里\NThey tell you to bring some prisoners into... into the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.59,0:19:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他们并不会告诉你该怎么做\Nyou know, and they don't tell you what to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.59,0:19:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们只说  "动作快点"\NBut they just say, you know, "Hurry up."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.92,0:19:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,说来疯狂  但我一直不能理解\NIt's crazy, but I never understood
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.42,0:19:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他们怎么会乖乖听话\Nhow they would just keep digging
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.25,0:19:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,挖自己的坟墓\Ntheir own graves, you know. I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.71,0:19:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,停\NStop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.46,0:19:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,上来\NRaus!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.09,0:19:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,可能他们觉得如果干得好\NWell, I mean, maybe they thought if they did a good job,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.00,0:19:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那个拿枪的人\Nthe guy with the gun
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.05,0:19:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,就会改变主意\Nwould change his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.13,0:20:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素  他立刻就对我有了好感\NRussell, he... he took a shine to me right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.55,0:20:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不久之后\NAfter a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.42,0:20:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他就开始给我分派些小任务了\Nhe started giving me little things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.17,0:20:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不过那时候  安吉洛本人\NBut then Angelo himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.42,0:20:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,也开始交给我一些小任务了\Nhe started giving me little things to do too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.59,0:20:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素的老婆  凯丽\NRuss's wife, Carrie,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.59,0:20:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,她的家族很久很久以前\Nher family goes all the way back, way, way back
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.25,0:20:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,在西西里岛跟巴法利诺家族是一个镇上的\Nto the same town in Sicily as the Bufalinos.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.38,0:20:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他们总会谈论这事\NThey talked about it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.84,0:20:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,她来自黑帮中的皇室  可以这么说\NShe came from mob royalty, if you want to call it that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.25,0:20:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}希安德拉家族
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.30,0:20:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,希安德拉家族  对他们来说  就好像他们是早期\NThe Sciandras. To them, it was like they came over on the...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.13,0:20:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,乘坐意大利五月花号来到美国的\Nthe Italian Mayflower.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.15,0:20:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an3\pos(380,235)}五月花号是英国移民驶往北美的\N一艘最为著名的船只
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.55,0:21:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你上楼去吧  清洗一下\NWhy don't you go upstairs, wash up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.09,0:21:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,衣服给我  我去处理\NGive me those clothes. I'll get rid of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.13,0:21:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了脱鞋  罗素\NDon't forget your shoes, Russell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.17,0:21:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克\NHey, Frank,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.09,0:21:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,能尽快停车吗\Ncan we stop soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.67,0:21:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,问问你老公吧  罗素\NYeah, yeah, well, ask your husband. Russell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.96,0:21:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他都睡死了\NHe's out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.42,0:21:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不用  我能行\NNo, no, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.67,0:21:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-能行吗  -行\N- Sure? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.34,0:22:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到哪了\NWhere are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.50,0:22:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,快到路易斯堡了\NWe're close to Lewisburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.09,0:22:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,到了告诉我  提醒我一下\NLet me know when we get there. Remind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.80,0:22:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-我有几个地方要去  -好的\N- I got some stops to make. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.75,0:22:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素的生意无所不包\NRussell had a piece of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.30,0:22:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他在皮茨顿有家店叫佩恩布帘店\NHe had this store in Pittston called Penn Drape & Curtains.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.05,0:22:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他在那里经营着一切生意\NAnd he ran everything out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.75,0:22:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道都有些什么\NWho knew what it all was?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.59,0:22:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定有合伙人\NI mean, I'm sure the man had partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.42,0:22:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这种人总是有合伙人的\NThey always have partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.21,0:22:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没人能独占所有钱财\NNobody keeps all the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.34,0:22:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但人人都听罗素的  这点我能确定\NBut everybody listened to Russ. That I can tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.63,0:22:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你想贿赂一个法官  先问问罗素\NYou wanted to bribe a judge, you asked Russell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.34,0:22:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道该贿赂法官多少钱\NYou didn't know how much to bribe him,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.21,0:22:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素会告诉你\NRussell was gonna tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.71,0:22:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好  行  我马上就去\NAll right, all right. I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.25,0:22:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧  交给我就行  别担心\NCome on. I'll take care of it. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.21,0:22:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你想提拔一个手下\NYou want to promote one of your guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.88,0:23:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素会告诉你行或不行\NRuss would tell you you could or you could not.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.50,0:23:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我个忙\NDo me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.88,0:23:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,跟史蒂夫去他那  带上维托\NGo with Steve down to his place. Take Vito with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.50,0:23:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,在那边逗留一会\NAnd just hang around for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.75,0:23:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,有几个家伙一直来找麻烦  摆平他们\NThese guys keep coming around, so straighten them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.00,0:23:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-我会处理的  罗素  -好的\N- I'll take care of it, Russ. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.50,0:23:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-谢谢  -不客气\N- Thank you. - No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.71,0:23:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那谁...你在这里\NWhere's... Oh, here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里\NI'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.84,0:23:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让某人消失\NYou want to make somebody disappear,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.55,0:23:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你得争得罗素的同意\Nyou got to get Russell's permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.46,0:23:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,没有第二条路\NYou know, no two ways about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.21,0:23:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-不  我一点都不担心  -我想也是\N- No, I wasn't worried. - I didn't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.17,0:23:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-帮我给你父亲带个好  -我会的  谢谢\N- Tell your father I said "Hi." - I'll tell him. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.00,0:23:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么还在这里  我刚跟布鲁诺说了\NWhat are you doing here? I just told Bruno.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.67,0:23:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你得跟布鲁诺一起去\NYou gotta go with Bruno.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.75,0:23:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-好的  我马上去  -去吧  小心\N- Oh, yeah. Yeah, I'm on my way. - Yeah. Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.42,0:23:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,而当你为罗素办事时\NAnd when you did something for Russ,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.34,0:23:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你得亲力亲为\Nyou did it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.13,0:23:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,正如罗素常说的\NLike Russ used to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.00,0:23:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我让人替我去处理事情的时候\NWhen I ask somebody to take care of something for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.38,0:23:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望他们能亲自处理\NI expect them to take care of it themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.80,0:23:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要几个人处理同一件事\NI don't need two roads coming back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.85,0:24:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}佩恩布帘店
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.67,0:24:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an3\pos(380,235)}阿尔伯特·安纳斯塔夏\N黑手党"谋杀集团"首领\N1957年死于纽约一家理发店
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.67,0:24:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,安纳斯塔夏在理发店被杀时\NWhen Anastasia got killed in the barbershop,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.59,0:24:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素被请出来安定人心\Nit was Russell they brought in to calm things down,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.34,0:24:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好让大家不要大开杀戒\Nso that everybody wasn't just going around killing everybody
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.09,0:24:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,并把事情摆平\Nand it could all get straightened out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.67,0:25:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道出了什么事\NWe know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.38,0:25:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也无能为力  木已成舟\NWe can't change it. It is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.46,0:25:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,请转告我的朋友  我很乐意帮忙\NPlease tell my friend I'm happy to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.21,0:25:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,光看外表你永远猜不到他的身份\NYou'd never know it by looking at this guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.96,0:25:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但条条大路通罗素\Nbut all roads led back to Russ.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.75,0:25:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,钱在哪里\NWhere's the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.92,0:25:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-他没有  -他没有\N- He don't have it. - He don't have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.17,0:25:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他说了点他妈妈的事...\NHe said something about his mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.55,0:25:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,停  别跟我说\NStop. Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.63,0:25:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,让我猜猜\NLet me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.13,0:25:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈死了  然后葬礼花了他一大笔钱\NHis mother died and the funeral set him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.71,0:25:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-是不是  -对  完全正确\N- Yeah? - Yeah. Exactly. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.12,0:25:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他该死的老娘\NHis fucking mother's...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.75,0:25:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在过去十年死了又死\Nfucking dying over and over for the last ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.55,0:25:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我要怎么办\NWhat do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.51,0:25:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,留在这里\NDon't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.35,0:25:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着\NHere.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.38,0:25:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,给他看看  别用\NJust show it to him. Don't use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.24,0:26:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看\NLook.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.97,0:26:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克\NHey, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.92,0:26:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,瘦子想见你  上车\NSkinny wants to see you. You get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.29,0:26:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-我正要去见他  -快上车\N- I was just gonna go see him. - Get in the fucking car.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.61,0:26:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-我正要...  -上车\N- I was just gonna... - Get in the fucking car!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.99,0:26:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-我正要去见他  -别跟我耍滑头\N- I was just gonna go see him! - Yeah, don't get cute with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.05,0:26:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟我扯了那堆你妈死了的屁话\NYou give me that bullshit about your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.31,0:26:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧上车\NGet in the fucking car!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.57,0:26:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克  我对天发誓  我正要...\NFrank, I swear to God, I was just gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.87,0:26:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,给我上车\NGet in the fucking car!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.36,0:26:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,想跟我耍滑头\NYou want to get cute with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.70,0:26:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,扯了一堆你妈病了死了\NAll that fucking bullshit about your mother
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.44,0:26:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,之类的鬼话\Nand sick and all that and dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.45,0:26:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓我正要去见他\NI swear, I was just gonna go see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.74,0:26:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我对天发誓  我本来打算明天来见你的\NI swear to God, I was gonna come see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.33,0:26:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-明天  -明天  我对天发誓\N- Tomorrow? - Tomorrow. I swear to God.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.99,0:26:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,明天  来这里\NTomorrow. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.78,0:26:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么时间  -你要我什么时候来\N- What time? - What time do you want me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.05,0:26:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一点如何  我一点来\NOne o'clock? I'll be here at 1:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.09,0:26:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,一点  怎么  你还要睡懒觉吗\NOne o'clock? What, are you sleeping in?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.86,0:26:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你说个时间\NYou tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.69,0:26:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,十点  到这里\NTen o'clock. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.92,0:26:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-十点  -明天\N- Ten o'clock. - Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.77,0:27:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,明天\NTomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.40,0:27:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,用你妈发誓  用你妈发誓\NSwear on your mother. Swear on your mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.14,0:27:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-用你妈发誓  -我以我妈发誓\N- Swear on your mother! - I swear on my mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.14,0:27:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我以我妈发誓\NI swear on my mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.09,0:27:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你明天什么时间到这里\NWhat time you gonna be here tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.34,0:27:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-我十点就到  -十点\N- I'll be here at ten o'clock. - Ten o'clock?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.08,0:27:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-明天  -好\N- Tomorrow. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.02,0:27:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-到这里  -好的\N- Here. - Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.23,0:27:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我明天就把钱带来  一分不少\NI'll bring you the money tomorrow. The whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.53,0:27:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,把他丢出去\NGet him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.76,0:27:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,出去  出去\NGet out of here. Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.25,0:27:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-我对天发誓我会来的  -出去\N- I swear to God, I'll be here. - Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.31,0:27:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我要怎么回家\NHow am I supposed to get home?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.24,0:27:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-出去  -搭公交\N- Get out of here. - Take the fucking bus!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.06,0:27:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,让他妈来接他\NLet his mother pick him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.21,0:27:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,她怎么了\NWhat's the matter with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.30,0:27:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么  她在杂货店碰翻了点东西\NNothing. She knocked something over
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.57,0:27:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,把地上弄得一团糟\Nat the grocery store and made a mess,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.48,0:27:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-店主就吼了她  -吼了她\N- and the grocer yelled at her. - He yelled at her?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.40,0:27:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,对  然后推了她\NYeah, and he shoved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.80,0:27:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他推了她\NHe shoved her?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.23,0:27:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,对\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.29,0:27:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他推你了吗\NDid he shove you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.88,0:27:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫什么  杂货店的那个家伙\NWho was this? The guy at the store?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.03,0:27:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,拐角那个杂货店吗  乔吗\NThe grocery store on the corner? Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.73,0:27:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他推了吗\NDid he?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.46,0:28:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝  他推你了吗\NHoney, did he shove you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.89,0:28:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,回话  他推你了吗\NJust answer me. Did he push you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.64,0:28:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他推你了吗  不论如何  他推了吗\NDid he shove you? Whatever it is, did he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.72,0:28:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\NLet's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.68,0:28:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克\NFrank.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.83,0:28:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克  那人不是故意的  只是意外\NFrank, he didn't mean it, the man. It just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.46,0:28:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思  什么叫他不是故意的\NWhat do you mean, he didn't mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.25,0:28:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他碰了她  你在说笑吗\NHe touched her. What, are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.78,0:28:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他无权推她  碰她\NHe has no right to push her. Touch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.58,0:28:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,碰她一下都不行\NNot even put one pinky on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.50,0:28:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他吧\NThat's him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.24,0:28:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你留在这里  留在这里\NStay here. Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.21,0:28:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克  我很抱歉  但你女儿犯了错\NFrank, I'm sorry, but your kid was out of line.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.56,0:28:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-我只做了  -你碰了我女儿吗\N- I only did what... - You touched my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.19,0:28:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊  对不起\NGod, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.35,0:28:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不  求你  不  弗兰克\NNo. Please. No, no, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.69,0:28:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克  求你了  不\NFrank, please, please, please. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.22,0:29:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不  弗兰克  不\NNo, no, Frank! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.60,0:29:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-受着吧  你这混蛋  -不  别这样\N- Take that, you motherfucker! - No! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.75,0:29:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我的手  我的手\NOh, my fucking hand. My fucking hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.17,0:29:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,多洛莉丝\NDolores.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.29,0:29:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-阿门  -阿门\N- Amen. - Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.34,0:29:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素和凯丽为我们刚出生的女儿多洛莉丝施了洗礼\NRussell and Carrie baptized our new daughter, Dolores.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.82,0:29:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,场面很棒  我们都很荣幸\NIt was a wonderful occasion, and we were honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.11,0:29:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都来了\NEverybody showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.64,0:30:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-阿门  -阿门\N- Amen. - Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.09,0:30:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,阿门\NAmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.89,0:30:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-阿门  -阿门\N- Amen. - Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.87,0:30:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一的问题是\NThe only thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.00,0:30:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子多了  要赚的钱也多了\Nyou got more kids, you gotta earn more money.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.85,0:30:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你想赚一万块的快钱吗\NYou wanna make a quick ten grand?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.37,0:30:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,悄悄话迪图里奥  不是那个\NWhispers DiTullio. Not the Whispers
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.29,0:30:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多同一时间在车里被炸死的悄悄话\Nthey blew up in that car around the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.33,0:30:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这是另一个悄悄话\NThis was the other Whispers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.76,0:30:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这个会赚钱的好悄悄话\NThe good one who knew how to make money.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.57,0:30:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我把借钱借给了一家店\NI got this place I front money to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.32,0:30:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这家店生意很好  真的很好\NIt's a good business. Really good business.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.74,0:30:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是一家洗衣店\NIt's a laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.70,0:30:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的业务是从大西洋城的\NWhat they do is, they collect the linen, towels,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.21,0:30:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,各种大小酒店饭店\Nsheets and everything from
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.31,0:30:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,收布制品  毛巾床单之类的\Nall the hotels and restaurants in Atlantic City.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.06,0:30:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,清洗并熨烫\NThey wash it, they iron it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.35,0:30:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,正常情况下  赚钱就跟印钞一样容易\NNormally, it's like a license to print fucking money.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.12,0:30:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但最近情况有变\NUntil recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.70,0:31:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,特拉华出现了一家公司\NThere's this other company that opened up down in Delaware.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.82,0:31:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们想把我们挤走\NThey're trying to put us out of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.51,0:31:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}典范布品
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.07,0:31:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他们降价  恐吓我们的司机\NThey're cutting their prices. They're scaring our drivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.63,0:31:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,抢我们的客户\NThey're trying to take our customers from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.52,0:31:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话  我有点担忧\NTo tell you the truth, I'm a little concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.89,0:31:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,别人说他们有点担心\NWhenever anybody says they're a little concerned,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.74,0:31:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,说明他们特别担心\Nthey're very concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.33,0:31:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,其实\NAs a matter of fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.99,0:31:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我担心得不止一点\NI'm really more than a little concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.46,0:31:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说自己不止是一点点担心\NAnd when they say they're more than a little concerned,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.85,0:31:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,说明他们已经绝望了\Nthey're desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.97,0:31:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我想把他们的公司炸了\NI want this fucking place bombed,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.09,0:31:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,烧了  焚了  你怎么整都行\Nburnt, torched, whatever the fuck you have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.64,0:31:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你打过仗  你知道该怎么办\NYou were in the war. You know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.82,0:31:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么对柏林就怎么对那地方\NLeave that fucking place like you left Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.53,0:31:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,把那里夷为平地\NBurnt to the fucking ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.13,0:31:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我要让他们倒闭\NI want them out of fucking business.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.48,0:31:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是谁\NWho... who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.66,0:31:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,特拉华的典范布品服务公司\NIt's the Cadillac Linen Service in Delaware.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.72,0:31:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,一群犹太人开的\NIt's run by a bunch of Jews.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.91,0:31:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们拿他们的保险赔偿\NLet them collect their insurance,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.44,0:31:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他们肯定投了不少保险\Nwhich I'm sure they have plenty,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.16,0:31:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,然后滚出这里\Nand leave this fucking other place alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.42,0:31:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰我的地盘\Nthe one I'm involved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.61,0:31:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-这可不是一万  -这里有两千\N- This ain't ten grand. - It's two grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.46,0:32:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你让那些该死的犹太洗衣妇失业之后\NWhen you put these Jew fucking washerwomen out of business,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.74,0:32:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我就把剩下的钱给你\Nthen you get the rest of your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.14,0:32:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我之所以现在手头有点紧\NThe reason I'm a little short on the money right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.80,0:32:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为我不想找瘦子\NI don't wanna go to Skinny,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.96,0:32:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想找那些放高利贷的\NI don't wanna ask anybody when they're gonna charge me a vig,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.54,0:32:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那样我就得还一辈子债\Nand I'm gonna be paying them forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.39,0:32:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我要从别的地方弄钱\NI'm getting the money somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.03,0:32:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,别人不必知道\NAnd nobody has to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.40,0:32:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,特别是瘦子\NEspecially not Skinny
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.57,0:32:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我不找他借钱\Nbecause I'm not getting the money from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.30,0:32:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来有点犹豫\NAnd I see you look a little hesitant.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.19,0:32:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我  我知道你的能耐\NBelieve me, I know what you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.50,0:32:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我少付了你的钱\NIf I stiff you on the money,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.37,0:32:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定会让我没有好下场\Nyou're gonna do something terrible to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.61,0:32:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想要那样\NI do not want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.45,0:32:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我中彩票了\NI hit the number.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.06,0:32:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,奖金大概有一千五\NIt's about 1,500.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.04,0:32:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我几个小时后回来\NI'll see you in a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.81,0:33:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}典范布品
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.98,0:33:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}典范布品
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.02,0:34:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}炸药
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.33,0:34:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克\NFrank.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.62,0:34:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,安吉洛想见你\NAngelo wants to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.12,0:34:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-现在吗  -对  就现在\N- Now? - Yeah, now is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.11,0:34:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事\NWhat's it about?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.88,0:34:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道  来吧  我开车送你\NI don't know. Come on. I'll drive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.10,0:35:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}抱歉  打烊了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.05,0:35:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,坐吧  弗兰克\NSit down, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.74,0:35:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你去特拉华做什么\NWhat're you doing in Delaware?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.06,0:35:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,炸一家洗衣店\NBombing out a laundry place.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.67,0:35:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是赚点外快\NI was just doing a job to make some extra money.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.04,0:35:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,让那家店没法经营\NPutting this place out of action.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.17,0:36:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,让那家店倒闭\NPutting this... putting this place out of commission.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.46,0:36:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,谁让你干的\NFor who?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.60,0:36:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,现在可不是保持沉默的时候\NNow is not the time to not say.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.74,0:36:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,悄悄话\NWhispers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.12,0:36:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,另一个悄悄话\NThe other Whispers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.82,0:36:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道典范布品服务公司的老板是谁吗\NYou know who owns the Cadillac Linen Service?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.17,0:36:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,做洗衣行业的犹太人\NSome Jews in the laundry business.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.12,0:36:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-雇主是这么说的  -他们只占部分股份\N- That's what they told me. - They own a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.11,0:36:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,还有人是老板\NSomebody else got an interest in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.03,0:36:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-你知道是谁吗  -不\N- You know who? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.42,0:36:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an3\pos(380,235)}也可以理解为"是我"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.42,0:36:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\NI do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.88,0:36:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-是谁  -不  是我\N- Who? - No. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.76,0:36:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,其他的股份是我的\NI own the other part.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.23,0:36:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是我认识持有剩余股份的人\NNot I know somebody who owns the other part.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.95,0:36:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,安吉洛  我不知道你有这家公司的股份\NAngelo, I didn't know you had any part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.73,0:36:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我要是知道的话\NI would never have done what I did
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.52,0:36:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是绝对不会那么做的  我不知道\Nif I knew you were involved. I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.39,0:37:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不会对你做这种事\NI would never, never do that against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.90,0:37:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,悄悄话没说老板是犹太黑帮吗\NWhispers didn't tell you it was Jew mob?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.60,0:37:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没有  他说是犹太洗衣妇\NNo, he said Jew washerwomen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.59,0:37:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,犹太洗衣妇\NJew washerwomen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.45,0:37:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他还说了什么\NWhat else he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.52,0:37:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜他让你保密\NI bet he said keep it to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.67,0:37:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟城里其他人透露一个字\NDon't say nothing to nobody Downtown.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.00,0:37:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,的确\NHe did.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.69,0:37:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我没核实\NI didn't check.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.45,0:37:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起  我应该先核实一下的\NI'm sorry. I should've checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.21,0:37:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-我能把钱退给他吗  -他用不着了\N- Can I give him his money back? - He won't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.87,0:37:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你留着吧\NYou can keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.34,0:37:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想惹麻烦\NI... I don't want no trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.51,0:37:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我把钱退给他吧  我没关系\NI'll just give it back to him and I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.77,0:37:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他用不着了\NHe won't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.47,0:37:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  谢谢\NOkay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.95,0:37:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,谢罗素吧\NThank Russell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.87,0:37:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来不想浪费时间\NI wouldn't have wasted my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.93,0:37:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,打算让犹太黑帮找你算账\NI'd have let the Jew mob have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.92,0:37:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个朋友真没得说\NYou got a good friend here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.04,0:37:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道他多仗义\NYou don't know how good a friend you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.98,0:38:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-我知道  -不  你不知道\N- I... I know. - No, you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.86,0:38:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧台那等着吧\NWait by the bar, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.97,0:38:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,像这种情况\NIn a case like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.45,0:38:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,最好的办法就是用全新的家伙\Nthe best thing to do is you use something brand new.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.85,0:38:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,刚开箱的\NRight out of the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.32,0:38:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,否则  你不知道它在哪里被用过\NOtherwise, you don't know where it's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.37,0:38:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,或被谁用过\NYou don't know who's used it,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.19,0:38:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,跟什么案子有关联\Nwhat crime it was connected to.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.54,0:38:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那无异于找死\NThat's suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.20,0:38:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我推荐用全新的  刚开箱的\NSo I recommend something new, straight out of the... the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.30,0:38:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,冰冷  干净\NStone cold. Clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.01,0:38:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你来了\NThere you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.91,0:38:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你会从哪边过来\NI didn't know which way you were coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.92,0:38:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你从哪边...\NI didn't know which way you were...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.42,0:39:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,当然  下一步就是\NNaturally, the next thing you wanna do
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.89,0:39:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,把家伙扔掉  你得毁灭证据\Nis throw the thing away. You wanna get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.49,0:39:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都扔在斯古吉尔河的一个地方\NThere's a spot in the Schuylkill River everybody uses.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.83,0:39:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,如果派人潜到河底\NIf they ever send divers down there,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.08,0:39:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,找到的武器够武装一个小国家了\Nthey'd be able to arm a small country.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.98,0:39:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}一名男子在人行道上被枪杀
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.83,0:39:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说  杀死悄悄话后  一切都变了\NFor me, everything changed after Whispers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.16,0:39:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这就像在军队\NIt was like the army.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.95,0:39:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你服从命令\NYou followed orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.62,0:39:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,听吩咐做事\NYou did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.68,0:39:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,就会得到相应的奖赏\NYou got rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.74,0:39:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}罗马别墅餐厅酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.74,0:39:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我替罗素做事\NAnd when I handled things for Russell,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.70,0:40:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,从来都不是为钱\Nit was never for money,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.15,0:40:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,而是为了表达尊重\Nbut as a show of respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.21,0:40:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你给他跑跑腿  帮帮忙\NWhen you ran a little errand, you did a little favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.85,0:40:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,当你需要帮忙的时候  他也还你人情\Nyou got a little favor back if you ever needed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.73,0:40:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你总是会需要帮忙的\NAnd you always hurried back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.79,0:40:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-菲尔  你好啊  -你好\N- Phil, how you doing? - How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.57,0:40:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? See the pyramids along the Nile ?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.57,0:40:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}See the Pyramids Along the Nile - Patti Page
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.11,0:40:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2}菲尔·泰斯塔\N1981年3月15日于自家门廊被一枚钉子炸弹炸死
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.01,0:40:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你好  弗兰克\NHow you doing, Frank?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.72,0:40:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? Watch the sun rise on a tropic isle ?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.45,0:40:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2}弗兰克·辛德文\N1980年10月29日身中三枪死于巷子内
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.93,0:40:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? Just remember, darling, all the while ?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.36,0:40:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢  维托\NThank you, Vito.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.67,0:40:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? You belong to me... ?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.35,0:40:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-你好  弗兰克  -你好\N- Hi. Frank. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.95,0:40:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你要来点什么吗\NWhat can I get for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.88,0:40:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,先给我上杯酒吧\NI'm just gonna get the wine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.20,0:40:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.94,0:40:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有需要尽管叫我\NJust call me if you need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.24,0:40:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\NI will.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.25,0:40:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-慢用  弗兰克  -谢谢\N- Help yourself, Frank. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.34,0:40:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,情况变了\NThings change.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.91,0:41:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-她是新来的吧  -对\N- She's the new one, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.95,0:41:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,她是个好姑娘  好姑娘\NA nice kid. Nice kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.09,0:41:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.75,0:41:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? I'll be so alone without you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.50,0:41:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,什么时候都不应该离开你的妻子\NNo time is a good time to leave your wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.08,0:41:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}汽车旅馆
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.24,0:41:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但我就是那时候离开妻子的\Nbut that's when I left mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.58,0:41:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}阿德斯里埃克斯汽车旅馆\N授权人签字
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.29,0:41:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,埃拉  最近还好吗\NIra, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.55,0:41:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-挺好的  你呢  -我也是\N- Good. All well? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.40,0:41:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-有遇到什么麻烦吗  -没有  一切顺利\N- Any problems? - No. Everything's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.36,0:41:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.62,0:41:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,就停在这辆凯迪拉克后面\NRight after this Caddy, pull over.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.96,0:41:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,到了  美丽皮草店\NThere it is. Fair Furriers.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.19,0:41:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}美丽皮草店
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.68,0:41:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他在等你\NHe's expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.95,0:42:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}美丽皮草店
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.87,0:42:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,菲尔  你的店真不错\NPhil, you got a nice shop here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.06,0:42:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\NThanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.00,0:42:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,人们喜欢来这里逛\NPeople like to come to this store.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.08,0:42:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但你儿子真是个瘪三\NBut your kid is a real sfigato.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.47,0:42:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗  他很讨人厌\NYou understand? He's a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.32,0:42:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他太野了  你得管管他\NHe's a wild kid. You gotta learn to control him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.87,0:42:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不管\NAnd if you don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.87,0:42:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,就再也没人想来这里逛了\Nnobody's gonna want to shop here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.27,0:42:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你的生意不好  对我也没有好处\NIf it's not good for you, it's not good for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.02,0:42:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你明白我的意思吧\NYou understand what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.99,0:42:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素  他给你惹麻烦了  我向你道歉\NI want to apologize, Russell, for the aggravation.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.10,0:42:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这份是我和罗素送的  那份是你和弗兰克送的\NThis is from Russell and I. That's from you and Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.50,0:42:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是我们俩送的\NThis one'll be from you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.43,0:42:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,要不送把宝宝汤匙吧\NWell, what about a baby spoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.67,0:42:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,她要宝宝汤匙有什么用\NWhat's she gonna do with a baby spoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.19,0:42:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-他们还没结婚  -生个孩子就能用了\N- They're not even married. - Have a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.49,0:42:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都还没结婚呢\NThey're not even married yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.08,0:42:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你保证  罗素\NI give you my word, Russ.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.51,0:42:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-好的  你的话我信  菲尔  -谢谢\N- All right. Your word's good, Phil. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.99,0:42:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  我们走吧  女士们\NOkay, let's go, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.70,0:42:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-完事了  -是的  弄完了\N- Okay, we're done? - Yes, we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.32,0:43:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你在搞什么\NWhat are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.14,0:43:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-你什么时候才能机灵点  -什么\N- When the hell are you gonna wise up, huh? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.47,0:43:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好样的  不愧是我女儿\NThere we go. That's my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.16,0:43:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\NOh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.25,0:43:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了\NYes!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.47,0:43:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,佩琪\NPeggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.50,0:43:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,过来一下\NCome over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.92,0:43:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我说不好  我...\NI don't know. I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.46,0:43:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉她不喜欢我\NI get the feeling she don't like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.91,0:43:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-她好像有点怕我  -不  不是的\N- Like she's afraid of me. - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.44,0:43:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,她就是这样\NThat's the way she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.12,0:43:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,有时她也会怕我\NShe's afraid of me at times too.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.47,0:43:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,她就是有点敏感\NSo, uh, it's just she's a sensitive kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.94,0:43:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,敏感而已\Nbut that's all it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.94,0:43:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我能理解她怕我\NI can understand her being afraid of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.56,0:43:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但是她不应该怕你  弗兰克\Nbut she shouldn't be scared of you, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.18,0:43:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是\NNo, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.16,0:43:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有时她会在报纸上看到关于我的报道\NAnd then she hears about me in the papers sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.55,0:44:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-真的吗  -是啊\N- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.94,0:44:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你要跟自己的孩子亲一点  弗兰克\NYou gotta be close to your kids, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.21,0:44:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很亲近\NI am. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.41,0:44:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,有孩子是你的福分\NYou're blessed to have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.57,0:44:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,凯丽和我没有小孩  我跟你说过\NI mean, Carrie and I can't have kids. I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.76,0:44:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是有福气  有福气\NBut you're blessed. You're blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.79,0:44:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,叫她一下  叫她过来\NCall her. Call her. Tell her to come over.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.55,0:44:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,佩琪宝贝  过来\NSweetheart. Peggy. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.63,0:44:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,过来\NCome here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.14,0:44:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-过来  -到罗素伯伯这里来\N- Come here. - Come over by Uncle Russ.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.96,0:44:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-你好吗  -挺好的\N- How are you? - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.72,0:44:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道为什么上帝会把天空造这么高吗\NDo you know why God made the sky so high?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.06,0:44:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.59,0:44:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这样小鸟在天上飞的时候\NSo that the little birdies don't bunk their head on it
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.41,0:44:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,才不会碰到头啊\Nwhen they're flying around.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.38,0:44:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱吧\NIsn't that cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.62,0:44:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个小笑话\NA little joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.33,0:44:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不好笑吗\NIsn't that funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.74,0:44:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你要吃点糖果什么的吗\NYou want some candy or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.92,0:44:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.45,0:44:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不  你们不想吃糖\NNo, you guys don't want any candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.37,0:44:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,需要我为你做点什么吗\NThere's nothing I could do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.53,0:44:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.37,0:44:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,需要的话你要告诉罗素伯伯\NWell, if there is, you let Uncle Russell know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.02,0:44:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.21,0:44:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,回去玩吧\NGo back. Have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.41,0:45:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,知道我什么意思了吗\NYou see what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.89,0:45:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,明白我的感觉了吗\NYou see that feeling I get?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.40,0:45:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,她就是  腼腆而已\NShe's just... She's shy, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.49,0:45:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,她没有恶意\NShe... She don't mean nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.70,0:45:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候  父母离婚了\NSometimes, when the parents get divorced,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.13,0:45:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们就会迷茫  然后他们会充满恨意\Nthe kids get all confused, and then they get resentful
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.93,0:45:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道该向谁发泄\Nand they don't know who to take it out on,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.72,0:45:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,或是站哪边\Nor, you know, which side, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.48,0:45:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不  你说得对\NNo, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.53,0:45:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这一点我很幸运\NI'm lucky in that way because
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.57,0:45:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,因为琳妮和玛丽相处得很好\NReenie and Mary, they get along like gangbusters,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.93,0:45:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们轮流在两家住  没什么问题\Nso the kids go back and forth with no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.45,0:45:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,要把家人留在身边  留意这一点\NKeep your family close. Keep an eye on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.51,0:45:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是提醒你一下\NAnyway, I'm just telling you, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.31,0:45:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我就是运气好\NI mean, I'm... I'm just lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.68,0:45:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.32,0:45:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,工会的工作怎么样\NHow's it going with the union?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.57,0:45:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,工会是世界上最好的\NThe union's the best in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.04,0:45:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-你喜欢  -是啊  只是...\N- You like it, huh? - Yeah, well, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.88,0:45:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要找个稳定点的工作  不过\NI mean, I wish I had something more steady, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.00,0:45:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,就是有些\NYeah, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.33,0:45:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-管理怎么样  -好啊\N- How about organizing? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.65,0:45:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-我想干那个  可是  -怎么\N- I would like to do that. But... - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.47,0:45:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,很多人都等着呢\Nthere's a long line.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.17,0:45:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-换句话说  等候名单很长  -是\N- A long waiting list, if you will. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.25,0:45:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的一个朋友遇到了一点麻烦\NWell, a friend of ours is having a little trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.86,0:46:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-高层的朋友  -谁啊\N- Friend at the top. - Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.36,0:46:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,高层\NThe top.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.72,0:46:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,霍法\NHoffa?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.00,0:46:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.35,0:46:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,之前我听说\NI heard the other day
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.22,0:46:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,有人要用水管揍他\Nthat some guys tried to pipe him
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.35,0:46:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-因为一个工人的赔偿问题  -是的\N- because of a workman's comp case. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.58,0:46:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,听说他把他们打得落花流水\NYeah, I heard he beat the shit out of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.99,0:46:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是  可他那样能撑多久呢\NYeah, but how long is he gonna keep doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.10,0:46:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,总有这事儿那事儿\NThings are gonna keep happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.32,0:46:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他身边需要一个可靠的人\NHe needs somebody he can trust around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.42,0:46:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,一个可以一直跟着他的人\NSomebody to be with him all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.70,0:46:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.67,0:46:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我让麦基接电话\NLet me put McGee on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.99,0:46:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\NHello.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.00,0:46:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友  你好吗\NHiya, my friend. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.50,0:46:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我找来了我跟你说过的那个年轻人\NListen, I got that kid I was talking to you about here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.88,0:46:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我让他接电话  你跟他说  好吗\NI'm gonna put him on the phone, let you talk to him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.01,0:46:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\NAll right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.09,0:46:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\NHello.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.46,0:46:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-是弗兰克吧  -是我\N- Is that Frank? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.13,0:46:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克你好  我是吉米·霍法\NHiya, Frank. This is Jimmy Hoffa.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.30,0:46:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你好  很高兴认识你\NYeah, yeah. Glad to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.99,0:46:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我也很高兴认识你  虽然是在电话上\NWell, glad to meet you, too, even if it's over the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.79,0:46:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,听说你刷房子\NI heard you paint houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.27,0:47:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  先生  是的\NYes. Yes, sir, I... I do. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.61,0:47:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我还\NAnd I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.09,0:47:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,自己做木工\NI also do my own carpentry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.30,0:47:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴你这么说\NI'm glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.65,0:47:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,听说你是工会的兄弟\NI understand you're a brother of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.42,0:47:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  先生  从1947年就在107号地方工会了\NYes, sir. Local 107. Since 1947.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.77,0:47:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧\NYeah! You know, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.56,0:47:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的朋友对你评价非常高\Nour friend speaks very highly of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.89,0:47:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\NWell, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.53,0:47:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-他这个人要求可不低  -我尽力而为\N- He's not an easy man to please. - Well, I do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.36,0:47:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,有这么个情况\NWell, you know, there's a situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.96,0:47:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,如今  年轻人不知道吉米·霍法是谁\NNowadays, young people, they don't know who Jimmy Hoffa was.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.90,0:47:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}吉米·霍法
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.30,0:47:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们完全没概念\NThey don't have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.17,0:47:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可能知道他消失了什么的\NI mean, maybe they know that he disappeared or something,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.06,0:47:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但仅此而已\Nbut that's about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.92,0:47:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,可在当时  全国上下\NBut back then, there wasn't nobody in this country
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.20,0:47:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没人不知道吉米·霍法是谁\Nwho didn't know who Jimmy Hoffa was.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.17,0:47:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝保佑  吉米\NGod bless, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.68,0:47:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你做的一切  你是个真正的绅士\NEverything you've done, you're a real gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.70,0:47:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\NThat's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.64,0:47:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,50年代的时候  他和猫王一样受欢迎\NIn the '50s, he was as big as Elvis.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.36,0:47:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,60年代的时候  他和披头士一样受欢迎\NIn the '60s, he was like the Beatles.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.18,0:47:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,除了总统以外\NNext to the president,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.15,0:47:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他是国内最有权力的人  无人可及\Nhe was like the most powerful man in the country. Bar none.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.77,0:48:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}卡车司机工会
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.13,0:47:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你如果买东西\NIf you got it,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.18,0:47:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,卡车会把东西送过去\Na truck brought it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.97,0:48:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你买食物  衣服\NIf you got your food, your clothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.12,0:48:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,药物  家用燃料\Nyour medicine, if you got fuel for your homes,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.40,0:48:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,工业用燃料\Nfuel for your industries,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.13,0:48:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,卡车会把东西送去给他们\Na truck brought it to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.06,0:48:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们卡车停下的那天\NThe day our trucks stop,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.51,0:48:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,就是美国停下的那天\NAmerica stops!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.63,0:48:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,现在出了点状况  弗兰克\NWell, there's a situation going on now, Frank,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.22,0:48:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,需要处理\Nthat needs to be attended to.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.16,0:48:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他们想分裂工会\NYou know, they're trying to tear the union apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.92,0:48:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,大公司和政府联手\NBig business and the government working together,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.31,0:48:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,想要拉我们下马\Ntrying to pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.85,0:48:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,大公司在进攻\NBig business is on the attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.66,0:48:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他们来了  来势汹汹\NThey're coming! They're coming hard
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.70,0:48:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,长驱直入\Nand they're coming fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.16,0:48:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,大公司和政府\NBig business and the government
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.13,0:48:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,想要在我们的阶层里埋下异议的种子\Nare trying to sow the seeds of dissent among our ranks,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.18,0:48:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,而此时我们正需要联合\Nat a time when we need unity!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.72,0:48:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要团结\NWe need solidarity!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.49,0:48:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我想把这话写在空中\NI want to write it in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.05,0:48:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,团结\NSolidarity!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.77,0:48:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,团结\NSolidarity!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.45,0:49:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,团结\NSolidarity!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.30,0:49:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你想加入这场战斗吗\NYou wanna be a part of this fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.26,0:49:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  先生\NYes, I do, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.72,0:49:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你想成为这历史的一部分吗\NWould you like to be a part of this history?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.30,0:49:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  我想\NYes, I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.35,0:49:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,无论你需要我做什么  我都随叫随到\NWhatever you need me to do, I'm available.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.84,0:49:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你明天能来芝加哥吗\NCan you come to Chicago tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.67,0:49:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,可以  先生\NYes, I can, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.09,0:49:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那好  到时见\NAll right, then. See you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.11,0:49:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-他喜欢说话  对吗  -是的\N- He likes to talk, don't he? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.26,0:49:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,还以为我是在跟巴顿将军说话\NThought I was talking to General Patton.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.10,0:49:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克  你过来的唯一原因是\NYou know, Frank, the only reason why you're here,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.94,0:49:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,海员工会  他们想和我们一样\Nthe Seafarers Union, they're signing up
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.33,0:49:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,签约非工会的\Nthe same non-union cab drivers
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.33,0:49:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}俄罗斯人和土耳其人浴室
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.21,0:49:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,出租车司机\Nas we want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.01,0:49:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,没人知道你是谁\NNobody knows who you are
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.00,0:49:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没人知道你在这做什么  好吗\Nand nobody knows what the fuck you're doing here. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.20,0:49:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗯  -只有你我知道你为何来此\N- Yeah. - You and I know why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.22,0:49:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得签约这些司机\NWe gotta be able to sign these drivers up
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.01,0:49:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这样保罗·霍尔的工会就签约不了他们\Nso Paul Hall doesn't get 'em for his fucking union.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.12,0:49:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不知为何  女同性恋\NFor some reason, lesbians.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.62,0:50:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这些司机大多都是该死的女同性恋\NMost of these drivers are fucking lesbians.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.62,0:50:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么\NI have no reason why.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.67,0:50:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,保罗·霍尔四处宣传\NPaul Hall's running around
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.20,0:50:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,说他可以比我们的哥们吉米\Nsaying that he's gonna get a better contract
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.42,0:50:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,提供一份更好的合同\Nthan our boy fucking Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.32,0:50:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是个狗杂种\NHe's a cocksucker. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.64,0:50:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米收买了戴利市长\NJimmy has Mayor fucking Daley in his pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.69,0:50:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们做什么警察都不会管\NThe cops are okay with whatever the fuck we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.15,0:50:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不会帮我们把车推下水\NThey're not gonna help us push these cars in,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.48,0:50:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们也绝对不会让任何人阻止我们\Nbut they certainly are not gonna let anybody fucking stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.70,0:50:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,懂吗\NOkay?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.86,0:50:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,用力  大伙儿用力\NCome on! All of you guys. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.96,0:50:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,把车子推下去  小心点\NLet's get this fucking thing in there. Watch yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.14,0:50:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,太费劲了\NThis is a lot of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.67,0:50:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你有想过用糖果吗\NYeah, you ever think of using candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.44,0:50:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么  -糖果\N- What? - Candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.07,0:50:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,糖果是什么鬼\NWhat the fuck is candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.60,0:51:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}炸药  轻拿轻放
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.10,0:51:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,卢  把门打开\NHey, Lou, open the fucking gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.01,0:51:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,知道  知道\NI got it. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.76,0:51:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,来  你把汽油拿着\NHere, you take the gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.45,0:51:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克  吉米有个特点\NFrank, there's one thing about Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.46,0:51:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他不喜欢等人\NDon't ever make him wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.31,0:51:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你和他约好见面  你一定要准时到场\NIf you make a meeting with him, you get there on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.90,0:51:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,最好是提前到\NBetter yet, get there early.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.34,0:51:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须强调这一点\NI can't stress this enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.82,0:51:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他觉得时间很可贵\NHis problem is that time is of essence.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.18,0:51:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这是最重要的\NAnd that's the important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.12,0:51:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我还要跟你说件事  吉米不喝酒\NI gotta tell you one more thing. Jimmy doesn't drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.44,0:51:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  世界上最大的货运工会的老大\NYeah. The head of the largest trucking union in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.67,0:51:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他不喝酒\Nhe don't drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.60,0:51:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这事最糟的地方在于\NThe worst part about it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.04,0:51:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他不允许别人在他身边喝酒\Nhe doesn't allow anybody to drink around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.67,0:51:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,还有件事\NAnother thing about him,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.05,0:52:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米讨厌西瓜\NJimmy hates fucking watermelon.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.43,0:52:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们喜欢西瓜\NBut we're gonna like watermelon.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.90,0:52:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米  你当时真该去看看\NJimmy, you shoulda seen it,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.83,0:52:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢沉下水\Nsinking in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.44,0:52:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,一辆接一辆  我敢打赌  等他们隔天醒来\NOne by one. I bet you, when they woke up the next morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.69,0:52:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那些该死的出租车司机\Nthose fucking cab drivers,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.45,0:52:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他们去找自己的出租车\Nthey went to look for their cabs,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.03,0:52:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他们根本不知道发生了什么\Nthey didn't know what the fuck hit 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.12,0:52:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个好主意  乔伊\NThat's a great idea, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.18,0:52:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好主意\NGreat idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.40,0:52:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我想出来的\NWell, it wasn't my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.02,0:52:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我哥们弗兰克  是他的主意\NMy man Frank. It was his idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.76,0:52:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你说\NLet me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.11,0:52:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克去了码头  他接管了码头\NFrank hit that pier, he took over the pier.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.08,0:52:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不管他叫他们做什么  不管他说什么\NWhatever he told them to do, whatever he said,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.18,0:52:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都照做\Nthey did it, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.61,0:52:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没见过任何人像他那样穿过人群\NI never seen a guy walk through a crowd like he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.02,0:52:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他一个人都不碰\NHe doesn't touch a fucking person!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.40,0:52:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都自觉让路\NEverybody gets out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.15,0:52:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我没开玩笑  我发誓\NI'm not kidding you. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.62,0:52:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人和他素不相识  就像\NGuys he never met in his life. You know, it was like...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.94,0:52:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,就像摩西  记得摩西吗\Nlike Moses. Remember Moses?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.07,0:52:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他走进海洋还是大海\NWhen he walked into the ocean, the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.12,0:52:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是什么  水面就分开了\Nwhatever the fuck it was, and it opened up!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.49,0:52:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他  相信我  吉米  他有那能力\NThat's him. I'm telling you. Jimmy, he's got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.63,0:52:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得如何\NSo, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.61,0:52:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你还需要他在这待几天吗\NYou need him a couple of days more?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.87,0:53:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  我们还有一些零碎的事要处理\NYeah, we gotta clear up a few dribs and drabs.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.83,0:53:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你们真喜欢西瓜啊\NYou guys sure like watermelon.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.05,0:53:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,想吃一口吗\NWant a bite?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.95,0:53:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,决不\NNot on your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.46,0:53:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你当时在场  你亲眼看到了\NYou were there. You saw it firsthand.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.76,0:53:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人不是工会\NThose guys ain't union.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.99,0:53:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就像是纳粹同谋  在战场后方行动\NThey're like Nazi collaborators, operating behind the lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.96,0:53:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-你懂的  你打过仗  -没错\N- You know. You were in the war. - I sure do.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.23,0:53:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,在战争期间  你从一个地方转移到另一个地方\NIn a war, you go from point A to point B.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.80,0:53:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候\NSometimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.61,0:53:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你会在路上洒一些啤酒\Nyou spill a little beer along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.25,0:53:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得这哲学有道理吗\NThat philosophy make sense to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.05,0:53:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\NSure does.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.14,0:53:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\NGood.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.27,0:53:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米  他不是因为喜欢我\NJimmy, he didn't make me stay in his suite
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.21,0:54:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,而让我住他的套房\Nbecause he liked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.45,0:54:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他让我跟他一起住是因为他不想让我\NHe made me stay with him because he didn't want me
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.46,0:54:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,用我的名字在酒店登记\Nregistering in my name at the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.08,0:54:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这样  就没有证据证明我去过芝加哥\NThis way, there was no proof I was even in Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.79,0:54:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,加油  吉米  你落后好多\NCome on, Jimmy, you're way behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.54,0:54:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都阻止不了她\NNothing stops her.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.67,0:54:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,芝加哥那事之后  我和吉米走得更近了\NAfter Chicago, Jimmy and I got close.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.52,0:54:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,老婆们也相处得很融洽\NThe wives hit it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.24,0:54:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,因为吉米和约瑟芬的孩子\NAnd with Jimmy and Josephine's kids
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.94,0:54:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,大多已成年  离开了家\Nmostly grown up and out of the house,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.95,0:54:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他们从我们孩子身上也获得不少乐趣\Nthey got a kick out of our kids too.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.73,0:54:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米  佩琪  来拍张照\NJimmy, Peggy, let's get a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.47,0:54:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"约"·霍法
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.88,0:54:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好  快来\NOh. Yes. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.86,0:54:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是佩琪\NEspecially Peggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.50,0:54:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,她和吉米  他们一下就喜欢上了对方\NShe and Jimmy, they fell for each other right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.03,0:54:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道比起拍照我更喜欢什么吗\NYou know what I like even better than getting my picture took?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.86,0:54:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.90,0:54:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,惊喜吧\NSurprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.08,0:54:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,佩琪\NPeggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.81,0:54:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,对佩琪来说  吉米不像罗素\NTo Peggy, Jimmy wasn't like Russ,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.26,0:54:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}韦尔冰淇淋店
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.05,0:54:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不像瘦子也不像我\Nor Skinny or even me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.99,0:54:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉各位  这是买给我和佩琪的\NSorry, everybody. This is just for Peggy and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.27,0:55:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,一方面  吉米没有绰号\NFor one thing, Jimmy didn't have a nickname
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.47,0:55:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,比如"剃刀"或者"钟楼怪人"\Nlike "The Razor," Or "The Hunchback,"
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.40,0:55:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,或者"黄鼠狼"亦或者"悄悄话"\Nor "The Weasel," Or "Whispers."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.00,0:55:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么不说谢谢\NSo what happened to "Thank you"?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.05,0:55:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\NThank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.67,0:55:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,还有  对她来说  他是在帮助人\NAnd also, to her, he was helping people.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.27,0:55:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他在帮他们赚更多钱  过得更好\NHe was helping them make more money, live better lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.47,0:55:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他没有踩别人的手\NHe wasn't stomping on somebody's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.81,0:55:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"如果你买东西  卡车会把东西送过去"\N"'If you have it, a truck brought it to you."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.11,0:55:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这是霍法先生说的\NThis is what Mr. Hoffa says.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.56,0:55:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}职业介绍日  1960年
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.01,0:55:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他是卡车司机工会的主席\NHe's the president of the Teamsters Union
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.18,0:55:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,成员超过一百万\Nwith over a million members.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.43,0:55:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都支持他因为他们有稳定的工作\NThey all support him because they have steady jobs,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.18,0:55:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}我是吉米·霍法的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.33,0:55:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,丰厚的薪水以及退休后的养老金\Ngreat pay and a pension for when they retire.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.66,0:55:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,卡车司机养老基金\NThe Teamster Pension Fund
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.11,0:55:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,有八十亿美元\Nhad eight billion dollars in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.28,0:55:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,全部都由吉米控制\NAnd Jimmy had complete control over every bit of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.71,0:55:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}沙丘酒店
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.24,0:55:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这模型是不是很美\NIsn't this a beautiful presentation?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.01,0:55:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想要一笔过渡性贷款  吉米\NI mean, a bridge loan is really all I'm asking, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.83,0:55:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会把工会成员的养老金\NI'm not gonna piss away my members' pension dough
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.53,0:55:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,投资在风险过大的项目上\Non something too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.76,0:55:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这没有风险  吉米\NThis is not a risk, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.66,0:55:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,《明斯基的荒唐事》这个节目是我的\NI got Minsky's Follies.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.06,0:55:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,赌城大道第一个露乳舞女秀是我的\NI got the first topless act on the Strip.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.42,0:56:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我  我们在那的生意可好了\NI'm telling you, we're booming in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.90,0:56:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,酒都卖不过来...\NI can't get the drinks out...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.14,0:56:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我就想要建一个高尔夫球场\NJust asking for a golf course.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.71,0:56:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我从未让你损失一分钱\NYou know you never lost a dime with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.25,0:56:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米  我们会很感激\NJimmy, we'd really just appreciate
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.16,0:56:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你帮杰克做的事的\Nwhatever you could do to help Jake along here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.96,0:56:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我只需要150万的完工保证金\NOne-five is all I need for a completion bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.22,0:56:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  去拿钱吧\NOkay. Okay. Go to the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.44,0:56:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢  这个项目会大获成功的\NThank you. It's gonna be a big success.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.97,0:56:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你  吉米  你是王子\NThank you, Jimmy. You're a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.02,0:56:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-你是好人  -是的  我是好人\N- You're a mensch. - Yeah, I'm a mensch.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.51,0:56:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏了霍法先生\NAnd, because of Mr. Hoffa,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.76,0:56:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,工人生病时有医疗保险\Nworkers have medical insurance for when they get sick,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.85,0:56:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他们知道退休后  不会挨饿\Nand know when they retire, they're not going to go hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.96,0:56:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,当时有太多的文书工作\NThere was so much paperwork back then
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.13,0:56:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米只能用一个叫艾伦·多夫曼的年轻人开的\Nthat Jimmy had to use an insurance company
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.47,0:56:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,一家保险公司来处理贷款\Nthat was run by this kid, Allen Dorfman, to work out the loans.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.78,0:56:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不  一分钱都不借\NNo, no, nothing for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.23,0:56:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,下次  试试口气好一点\NNext time, try asking a little bit fucking nicer.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.61,0:56:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}艾伦·多夫曼  1979年\N在芝加哥的一处停车场头中八枪身亡
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.71,0:57:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢  进展如何\NAnd? And? How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.83,0:57:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,情况一度很危急\NIt was a little touch and go for a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.40,0:57:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-但是最后还是顺利达成了  -很好\N- But at the end, fine. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.20,0:57:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是罗素让吉米\NIt was Russ who got Jimmy
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.34,0:57:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,给戈特利布这样的人贷款\Nto give guys like Gottlieb the loans,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.41,0:57:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他能分到一成\Nand, you know, he would get like 10% of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.42,0:57:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道  也许更多\NOr whatever, you know. Maybe more.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.59,0:57:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  你告诉马尔特杜佐我很感激\NListen, you tell Marteduzzo from me that I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.99,0:57:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,人人都会感激\NAnd everybody's gonna appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.68,0:57:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这是好事\NIt's a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.60,0:57:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,行  我会的\NOkay. I'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.59,0:57:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那时  你不能去普通银行\NBack then, you couldn't go to regular banks
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.61,0:57:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,因为钱是用来赌博的\Nbecause the money was for gambling.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.41,0:57:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,千真万确  就是这样  我没开玩笑  不能去\NGod's truth, that's what it was. I'm serious. You couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.10,0:57:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,所以黑手党  他们怎么办呢\NSo the Mob, what did they do?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.91,0:57:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他们找卡车司机工会贷款\NThey went to the Teamsters for the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.84,0:57:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是卡车司机工会介入其中\NIt was the Teamsters that stepped in
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.69,0:57:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他们借出的钱打造了拉斯维加斯\Nand lent the money that built Las Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.96,0:57:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-这是红木  -别  比利\N- This is the mahogany... - Don't, Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.47,0:57:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-别碰  -我不碰\N- Don't touch the stuff. - I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.82,0:57:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-该上哪去上哪去  -好\N- Just go where you gotta go. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.11,0:57:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,当时的生意多得让人应接不暇\NThere was more business than anybody could handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.51,0:57:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,所以吉米把一些生意\NSo Jimmy had to shove some of the deals
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.26,0:57:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,塞给了他老婆约\Noff on to his wife Jo,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.01,0:57:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,她完全不知道\Nwho had no idea she had 22%
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.23,0:57:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,她拥有一个叫"太阳谷"的\Nof a Florida land deal
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.23,0:57:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,佛州土地交易公司22%的股份\Ncalled "Sun Valley,"
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.00,0:57:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,几艘包租渔船\Nsome charter fishing boats,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.73,0:57:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,以及一个带私家雪山的滑雪度假屋\Nand a ski lodge with its own mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.62,0:58:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米有个客户叫山姆·詹卡纳  绰号"莫莫"\NOne of Jimmy's clients was Sam "Momo" Giancana,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.71,0:58:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他和肯尼迪家族是世交\Nwho was friends with the Kennedys from back
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.37,0:58:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这两家自约翰·肯尼迪的父亲在禁酒令期间走私酒\Nwhen Jack's father made his fortune with the Italians
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.09,0:58:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,和意大利人一起赚大钱时就认识了\Nas a bootlegger during Prohibition.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.29,0:58:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}露希尔·亨特\N刘易斯·康宁汉姆\N玛丽昂·希克斯\N德妮思·鲍威尔\N艾米特·伍兹
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.60,0:58:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,莫莫和辛纳屈跟肯尼迪家族混\NMomo, Sinatra hung out together with the Kennedys.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.75,0:58:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}艾米特·伍兹
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.37,0:58:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,莫莫和肯尼迪\NMomo and Kennedy,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.22,0:58:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你信不信  甚至有同一个女友\Nbelieve it or not, even had the same girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.81,0:58:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,在同一时期\NTogether. At the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.51,0:58:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太疯狂了\NTalk about crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.39,0:58:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,所以对黑手党来说  帮助乔·肯尼迪\NSo it was easy for the Mob to help Joe Kennedy
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.53,0:58:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,让他儿子当选总统很容易  非常容易\Nget his son elected president. That was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.72,0:58:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他们操控了选票\NThey just punched up the vote a little
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.63,0:58:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,确保他在伊利诺伊州胜出\Nto make sure that he won in Illinois.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.66,0:58:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}雷蒙德·克拉克
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.17,0:58:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}艾米特·伍兹
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.74,0:58:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,作为交换\NIn exchange for that,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.45,0:58:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,新上台的总统要把卡斯特罗从古巴赶下台\Nthe new president was supposedly gonna get Castro out of Cuba
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.68,0:58:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我们的人就能拿回他们的赌场\Nso our guys could get their casinos back,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.45,0:58:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,赛马场  捕虾船\Nand race tracks, and shrimp boats,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.53,0:58:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,以及他们在哈瓦那\Nand everything else that they had,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.78,0:58:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,曾拥有的一切\Nand owned down there from Havana back.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.44,0:58:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不过那事没成\NBut that... that didn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.11,0:59:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}投民主党
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.70,0:59:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,意大利人想让爱尔兰人肯尼迪当总统\NThe Italians wanted Kennedy the Irishman for president,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.89,0:59:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他们如愿了\Nand that's what they got.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.39,0:59:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,习惯吧  因为以后我们每时每刻都得看到了\NGet used to it, because we're gonna be seeing it 24/7.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.47,0:59:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,狗娘养的\NSon of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.78,0:59:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的肯尼迪家族\NGoddamn Kennedys.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.04,0:59:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我在看该死的肯尼迪家族\NI'm looking at the goddamn Kennedys.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.48,0:59:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米  孩子们都在呢  注意言辞\NJimmy, the kids. Language.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.64,0:59:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么差别\NWhat difference does it make?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.64,0:59:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他们迟早都要学会的\NI mean, they gotta learn sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.15,0:59:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要和这些人开战\NWe're going to war with these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.45,0:59:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,开战\NWar!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.17,0:59:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经说了无数次了\NIf I said it once, I said it a thousand times,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.37,0:59:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在乎他们是不是爱尔兰人\NI don't care they're Irish.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.60,0:59:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在乎他们是不是天主教徒\NI don't care they're Catholic.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.15,0:59:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,如果要说这辈子有谁你不能信\NIf there's one person you can't trust in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.70,0:59:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是百万富翁的孩子\Nit's millionaires' kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.05,0:59:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你说得对  吉米\NYou're right, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.19,0:59:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是那个小杂种\NEspecially that little son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.90,0:59:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说你不记得\NAre you saying you don't remember
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.42,0:59:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你帮过约翰尼·迪奥吗\Ndoing any favors for Johnny Dio,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.50,0:59:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}罗伯特·肯尼迪
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.56,0:59:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,还是说你不记得你们的对话\Nor you don't remember the conversation?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.77,0:59:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说  我已经尽力回忆了\NI'm saying, to the best of my recollection,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.48,0:59:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,根据我的回忆\NI must recall on my memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.21,0:59:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我想不起来了\NI cannot remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.34,1:00:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那这两万块是哪来的\NThen where did this $20,000 come from?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.90,1:00:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,个人的\NIndividuals.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.22,1:00:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哪些个人  霍法先生\NWhich individuals, Mr. Hoffa?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.40,1:00:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,未经核查的情况下  这笔我借的钱\NOff hand, that particular amount of money I borrowed,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.37,1:00:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我目前也想不起是找谁借的\NI don't know at this particular moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.86,1:00:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但是根据我取得的贷款记录\NBut the record of my loans, which I requested, I have,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.76,1:00:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,在这段时间内\Nand out of all the moneys I loaned
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.02,1:00:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我贷款的所有钱  都投资给了这些企业\Nduring this period of time I went into these ventures.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.00,1:00:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的肯尼迪家族\NThose goddamn Kennedys,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.73,1:00:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他们总是得偿所愿\Nthey get what they want!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.17,1:00:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米  吉米  孩子们在呢\NJimmy. Jimmy, the kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.07,1:00:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经让我\NHim and all the bullshit problems
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.93,1:00:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-处处受制  -吉米\N- he put me through already. - Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.79,1:00:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我得走了  别指望我看这个\NI gotta go. You don't expect me to look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.91,1:00:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我不指望\NNo, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.55,1:00:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,对罗素这样的人来说\NFor guys like Russ,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.87,1:00:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那最好不过了\Nit couldn't have been better.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.36,1:00:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}支持肯尼迪当总统
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.57,1:00:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说  罗素\NI mean, Russ,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.48,1:00:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}支持肯尼迪当总统
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.03,1:00:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,肯尼迪当选他也有出力\Noh, yeah, he did his part for getting Kennedy elected,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.78,1:01:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}支持肯尼迪当总统
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.95,1:00:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这点毫无疑问\Nthat's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.17,1:00:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你在做什么  我叫你把它...\NWhat are you doing? I told you to put it...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.43,1:01:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫你贴到所有杆子上\NI told you to put them on every pole.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.23,1:01:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你还在这瞎转\NYou're still walking around.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.33,1:01:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,所以约翰·肯尼迪\NSo what's the first thing
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.29,1:01:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,为了感谢芝加哥的帮助做的第一件事是什么\Nthat Jack Kennedy does to thank Chicago for all their help?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.35,1:01:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他让他的垃圾弟弟上位了\NHe puts his shitass brother in there,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.49,1:01:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那个预科学校混蛋\Nthat little prep school punk,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.82,1:01:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他让他成了司法部长\Nand he winds up making him attorney general.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.38,1:01:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍比上任后做的第一件事是什么\NAnd what's the first thing Bobby does?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.20,1:01:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他不仅对付吉米\NHe goes after not just Jimmy,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.24,1:01:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,从某种程度上讲  你也能理解\Nwhich in a way you could understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.94,1:01:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米无比厌恶肯尼迪家族\NI mean, Jimmy hated the Kennedys so much
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.53,1:01:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,以至于他从工会拿了五十万给尼克松\Nhe gave Nixon $500,000 in Teamster cash.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.66,1:01:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但鲍比还去对付詹卡纳\NBut Bobby also goes after Giancana,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.35,1:01:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,马切洛  特拉菲坎特  以及其他所有\NMarcello, Trafficante, and all the other guys
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.71,1:01:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,当初帮他哥哥入住白宫的人\Nwho put his brother in the White House in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.96,1:01:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那是在干什么\NWhat's that about?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.42,1:01:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克\NFrank.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.94,1:01:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-谢谢  -圣诞快乐\N- Thank you. - Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.17,1:01:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我是漏掉了什么吗\NAm I missing something?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.97,1:01:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你  凯丽\NThank you, Carrie.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.45,1:01:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-太漂亮了  -真美\N- That's gorgeous. - Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.59,1:01:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,戴着它健健康康  我们爱你\NWear it in the best of health. We love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.73,1:01:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这是给佩琪的\NOkay, now this one is for Peggy
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.23,1:02:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素伯伯送的  圣诞快乐  亲爱的\Nfrom Uncle Russell. Merry Christmas, my love.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.79,1:02:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,看呀\NOh, look at those.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.34,1:02:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\NSo nice!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.16,1:02:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说你喜欢滑冰\NI heard you like to skate.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.54,1:02:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你该说什么\NWhat do you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.57,1:02:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.71,1:02:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我和罗素伯伯可以带你去滑冰了\NNow me and Uncle Russell could take you ice skating.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.21,1:02:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我想圣诞老人\NI think Santa Claus left you
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.72,1:02:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,在里面还给你留了点东西\Na little something extra in there too.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.00,1:02:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你该对罗素伯伯说什么\NWhat do you say to Uncle Russell?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.69,1:02:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你该说什么\NWhat do you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.53,1:02:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克  没关系\NFrank, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.63,1:02:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,她已经说了一次谢谢了  这就够了\NShe said thank you once. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.38,1:02:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,因为鲍比是司法部长  他们把我们盯得很紧\NWith Bobby as attorney general, I mean, they were all over us.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.52,1:02:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能在电话里说事\NI mean, we couldn't talk on the phone
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.16,1:02:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们知道有人窃听\Nbecause we knew it was being bugged.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.29,1:02:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么都不能做  哪也不能去\NYou couldn't do nothing. You couldn't go nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.15,1:02:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都做不了\NYou couldn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.48,1:02:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,总之情况特别糟糕\NIt was a bad, bad, bad situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.47,1:02:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,然后吉米  算了\NAnd then Jimmy... Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.94,1:02:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍比  现在作为司法部长  他有权力\NBobby, now as attorney general, he has the power
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.59,1:03:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,送任何人进监狱  毋庸置疑\Nto send anybody to jail, and no question about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.93,1:03:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米在鲍比的打击对象名单上名列前茅\NAnd Jimmy was at the top of Bobby's hit list.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.39,1:03:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他甚至组建了一只专门的"抓捕霍法小队"\NHe even set up a special "Get Hoffa Squad,"
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.01,1:03:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他找来了联调局\Nwhere he had his own guys from the FBI,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.81,1:03:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,还有国税局的人夜以继日地工作\Nthe IRS working 'round the clock.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.73,1:03:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他们唯一的工作就是送吉米·霍法进监狱\NTheir only job was to put Jimmy Hoffa in jail.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.93,1:03:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我是认真的  他们只干了这事\NI'm serious. That's all they did.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.06,1:03:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这房间里全是该死的蠢货\NI am sitting in a room full of fuckin' idiots.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.72,1:03:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,一群傻逼\NYou dumb motherfuckers!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.41,1:03:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你们知道你们做了什么吗\NYou know what you did?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.00,1:03:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你们找来约翰尼·奥鲁克的孩子\NYou take Johnny O'Rourke's kid
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.96,1:03:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你们让他\Nand you put him on
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.68,1:03:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,成为总组织者\Nas general organizer,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.41,1:03:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,支付了他3.6万\Npay him 36 fucking grand,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.83,1:03:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,与此同时\Nat the same time,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.57,1:03:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你们让他卖保险给他爸爸的...\Nyou let him sell insurance to his fucking father's...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.32,1:03:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他爸爸的...\Nto his fucking father's...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.40,1:04:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,卖给他爸爸的地方工会\Nto his fucking father's locals!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.22,1:04:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\NDamn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.74,1:04:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么能犯这种错\NHow do you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.91,1:04:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是有多蠢\NHow stupid can you be?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.38,1:04:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那该死的狗杂种肯尼迪\NThat fucking cocksucker Kennedy
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.02,1:04:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我去哪他都盯着我\Nhas got his nose up my ass everywhere I go!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.63,1:04:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不知道他对我紧追不舍吗\NYou don't know that they're hounding me?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.44,1:04:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他们监视我做的每件事\NThey're looking at everything I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.05,1:04:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你们却让这发生在大庭广众之下\NAnd you let this happen in public!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.43,1:04:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你们成全了他\NYou're giving it to him!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.78,1:04:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去坐牢了  懂吗\NI'm going to jail. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.76,1:04:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,拜你们所赐  我要去坐牢了\NI'm going to prison because of you,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.24,1:04:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,一群蠢货\Nyou dumb motherfuckers.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.31,1:04:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你们想要的  你们想让我进监狱\NThis is what you wanted. You wanted to put me in jail.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.58,1:04:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我  好让我就地杀了你们\NTell me now so I can kill you right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.41,1:04:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,就地\NRight here!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.70,1:04:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你去哪\NWhere're you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.37,1:04:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫"我去哪"\NWhat do you mean, where am I going?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.12,1:04:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我他妈不干了  这就是我要去的地方\NI fucking quit, that's where I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.01,1:04:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不干了\NWhat are you quitting for?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.51,1:04:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫我蠢货\NYou gonna call me a motherfucker?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.25,1:04:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以这么跟他们说话  但跟我不行\NYou can talk to them like that, you can't talk to me like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.77,1:04:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克  不  我没说你  你...\NFrank. No! That didn't apply to you. What are you...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.71,1:04:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-没说我  -是的\N- Didn't apply? - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.22,1:04:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那你要告诉我你没在说我\NThen you gotta let me know it didn't apply to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.98,1:04:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我就站在那\NI'm standing right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.56,1:05:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我根本没看到你站在那\NI didn't even see you standing there!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.19,1:05:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我就站在那  吉米\NI was standing right there, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.65,1:05:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你胡扯什么呢\NWhat are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.65,1:05:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但我没在说你  我还能说什么\NBut it didn't apply to you! What else can I say?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.02,1:05:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你有问题的话  就先把我拉到一边\NYou got a problem, you pull me aside.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.37,1:05:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能辱骂了我然后又说你没在说我\NYou don't insult me and then you say it didn't apply to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.69,1:05:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我要怎么把你拉到一边  我根本没看到你\NHow am I gonna put you aside? I didn't even see you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.24,1:05:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托  弗兰克  你知道我不是那样的人\NOh, come on, Frank, you know me better than that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.86,1:05:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我不是那样的人\NYou just know me better than that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.81,1:05:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\NPlease.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.10,1:05:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧  不会有事的\NCome on. It's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.46,1:05:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不会有事的  来\NIt's gonna be all right. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.34,1:05:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,来  我为什么要对你说那样的话\NCome on, why would I ever say anything like that to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.32,1:05:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你得控制这些人\NYou gotta control these people.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.11,1:05:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都在掌控之中  别担心\NI'm controlling everything. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.31,1:05:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但是当然  当然  我...你懂的\NBut certainly, certainly, I... you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.73,1:05:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,来  各位  出去\NCome on. Okay, guys, get out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.30,1:05:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道吉米是怎么管理工会的\NI mean, I don't know how Jimmy is running the fucking union.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.86,1:05:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍比和联调局总是盯着他\NBetween Bobby and the FBI up his ass all the time,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.48,1:05:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他都快疯了\Nhe's going fucking crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.68,1:05:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉吉米  我为他的麻烦感到遗憾\NTell Jimmy I'm sorry for his troubles.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.30,1:05:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,老一辈认识老肯尼迪  他们会去和他谈\NThe old-timers know the Old Man. They'll talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.75,1:05:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会跟他讲清楚的\NAt some point, they'll straighten it out for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.02,1:05:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但他无法理解\NYeah, but he can't understand,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.20,1:05:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我和你说实话  我也无法理解\Nand I gotta be honest with you, I don't understand either,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.68,1:05:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你们最初怎么就让混蛋肯尼迪兄弟\Nhow youse could help get those two fucking Kennedy pricks
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.83,1:05:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,当选了\Nelected in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.93,1:06:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定没法理解\NIt don't make no sense to him, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.88,1:06:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他不必事事都理解\NHe doesn't have to understand everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.24,1:06:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你明白我的意思  有时这样更好\NYou know what I'm talking about. Sometimes it's better.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.52,1:06:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这个...\NWell...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.97,1:06:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,只是我看到他那样  我没法\NIt's when I see him like that, I don't, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.81,1:06:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我想...我感觉不好受\NI... I'm tryin' to... I feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.71,1:06:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我想怎么也得帮帮他\NI wanna help him in some way.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.60,1:06:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说  他太情绪化了\NListen, he's too emotional.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.33,1:06:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,就像是个到处折腾来\NLike some guy who's always rushing,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.05,1:06:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,折腾去  却看不清大局的人\Nrushing all over the place and they miss the big picture.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.63,1:06:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,比如古巴\NLike Cuba.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.10,1:06:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们重新开赌场\NGetting us back into casinos.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.16,1:06:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们重回哈瓦那\NGetting us back into Havana.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.51,1:06:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,比如除掉那个混球卡斯特罗\NLike getting rid of that fucking Castro prick.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.03,1:06:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,老一辈和老肯尼迪谈过了\NThe old-timers spoke to the Old Man.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.53,1:06:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,老肯尼迪跟他儿子约翰谈过了  告诉了他\NThe Old Man talked to his son Jack, and he told him,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.87,1:06:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了是谁帮他上位的\N"Don't forget who the fuck he owes."
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.52,1:06:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他知道他欠了谁的人情\NHe knows who the fuck he owes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.62,1:06:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我要你\NSo I want you
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.66,1:06:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,去一个叫里程碑运输的地方\Nto go down to a place called Milestone Hauling.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.64,1:06:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,有个叫菲尔的家伙\NThere's a guy named Phil.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.93,1:07:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他会给你一辆卡车\NHe's gonna give you a rig.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.91,1:07:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你把卡车开到巴尔的摩的\NYou drive the rig down to Baltimore
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.52,1:07:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,一家水泥厂去\Nto a concrete plant.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.26,1:07:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,在东方大道上\NIt's on Eastern Avenue.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.66,1:07:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,整条街上只有它  不会找不到的\NIt's the only one on the street. You can't miss it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.81,1:07:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那里会有人等着你\NA guy's gonna meet you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.87,1:07:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,一个叫费瑞的娘炮\NA fairy named Ferrie.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.85,1:07:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,向前开  然后倒车进来\NJust pull it forward and then back it in.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.28,1:07:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,该干活了\NLet's go, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.61,1:07:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你要在那取点东西\NYou'll pick up some things.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.18,1:07:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他会给你一些文件  以防你被拦下来\NHe'll give you some paperwork in case you get stopped.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.50,1:08:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你把卡车开到佛州\NYou drive the truck down to Florida.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.46,1:08:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}佛州海岸灰狗巴士车道
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.39,1:08:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克逊维尔外面的一条灰狗巴士车道上\NA dog track outside Jacksonville.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.59,1:08:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,把车留在那里\NYou leave it there.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.71,1:08:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,一个叫亨特的大耳朵家伙会在那里等你\NA guy with big ears named Hunt will meet you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.96,1:08:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他会给你一辆车  让你开回费城\NHe's gonna give you a car to drive back to Philly.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.72,1:08:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你看什么呢\NWhat are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.27,1:08:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你在看我的耳朵吗\NYou looking at my ears?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.42,1:08:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\NSorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.58,1:08:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我的耳朵\NMy ears.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.99,1:08:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-你在看我的耳朵吗  -你的耳朵\N- Are you looking at my ears? - Your ears?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.14,1:08:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.40,1:08:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我做了手术  所以谁都不需要\NI had an operation, so there's no need for anyone
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.10,1:08:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,再看我的耳朵了\Nlooking at my ears anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.81,1:08:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  我也没看你的耳朵\NYeah, well, I ain't looking at your ears.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.03,1:08:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,行吧\NRight.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.62,1:09:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你走吧  赶紧的\NGet out of here. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.03,1:09:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,...在猪湾空降\N...unfolded in the Bay of Pigs.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.31,1:09:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,行动极不顺利\NNothing went as planned.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.87,1:09:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,伞兵们无法\NParatroopers were unable
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.11,1:09:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,炸毁通往海岸地区的道路\Nto blow up roadways leading to the beach area.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.70,1:09:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,卡斯特罗的军队奔赴前线\NCastro raced toward the scene.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.61,1:09:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,地下潜伏人员本能够\NThe underground might
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.43,1:09:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,将路炸毁  但他们一无所知\Nhave blown up the roads but it knew nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.30,1:09:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,很快  卡斯特罗的军队就将炮火对准了滩头阵地\NSoon, Castro had artillery firing on the beachhead.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.99,1:09:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他的飞机摧毁了入侵舰队\NHis planes destroyed invading ships
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.78,1:09:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,其中包含一个旅的兵力和重要军火\Ncarrying a brigade of men and vital ammunition.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.37,1:09:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,滩头阵地无法扩大\NThe beachhead could not be enlarged
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.13,1:09:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,伞兵们很快便试图杀回\Nand paratroopers were soon trying to fight their way back
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.54,1:09:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,岸边的小块区域\Nto the small section of the shore
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.04,1:09:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的入侵者已经被压制\Nwhere the invaders were pinned down.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.85,1:09:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,1500人被留在岸边  没有空中掩护\N1,500 men had been dumped on a shore without air cover
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.76,1:09:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有舰炮掩护\Nor protective fire from ships.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.57,1:09:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,卡斯特罗只需等到他们弹尽粮绝\NCastro had to wait only until they ran out of ammunition
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.14,1:09:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,就可将他们一举歼灭\Nbefore mopping them up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.74,1:10:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,稍后  卡斯特罗在入侵区域高调面对记者\NLater, Castro was to strut around the invasion area with newsmen,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.02,1:10:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,并阐述了犯下的错误\Nand expound on the errors that had been made.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.40,1:10:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他的资料充足\NHe had ample material.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.43,1:10:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,已经备受侮辱的美国\NThe United States, already humiliated,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.95,1:10:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,仍然受到世界大多数国家的谴责\Nstood condemned by most of the countries of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.96,1:10:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\NShit!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.26,1:10:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不出我所料  他们搞完了古巴\NJust as I predicted. They fuck up Cuba,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.84,1:10:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这个呆子就要冲我和工会来了\NBoobie starts coming after me and the union.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.80,1:10:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他在寻求廉价的宣传手段\NHe's looking for some cheap publicity.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.84,1:10:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样  他就是这么做的\NThat's all it is. That's what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.61,1:10:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  都会平息的  吉米\NOkay. Well, it's all gonna blow over, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.22,1:10:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不  不会平息的  怎么平息\NNo, it's not gonna blow over. How's it gonna blow over?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.06,1:10:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们永远都不会忘记\NThey're never gonna forget
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.95,1:10:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-我资助过尼克松  -冷静点  吉米  拜托\N- that I gave money to Nixon! - Calm down. Jimmy, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.19,1:10:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会处理好的\NWe're gonna handle this.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.38,1:10:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,老一辈的\NCouple of the old-timers,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.28,1:10:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会去找老肯尼迪\Nthey're gonna get to Old Man Kennedy now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.66,1:10:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗  他们会去找他的  他是病了  但...\NOkay? They're gonna get to him. He's a little sick, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.35,1:10:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-病了  -是  但是...\N- Sick? - Yeah. But...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.49,1:10:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他那是中风了  不是病了\NHe had a fucking stroke. That's not sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.17,1:10:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那是...那是将死之人了  好吧\NThat's you're... you're close to the grave, is what.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.80,1:10:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他马上就毫无价值了\NHe's turning into a fucking eggplant.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.75,1:10:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  这也不能怪谁啊  这...\NOkay. Well, you can't blame anybody for that. That's...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.80,1:10:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我又没打算怪谁\NI'm not looking to blame anybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.28,1:10:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但真要怪谁的话  得怪肯尼迪小子们\NBut if there's any blame going around, it's the Kennedys.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.84,1:10:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你  是他的儿子害死了他\NHis kids killed him. Let me tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.73,1:10:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他还没死  但他快死了  快死了\NHe's not dead, but he's going. He's going.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.44,1:11:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们害死了他  他们能让任何人犯心脏病\NThey killed him. They'd give anybody a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.48,1:11:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}久病后于1969年去世\N老约瑟夫·P·肯尼迪
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.26,1:11:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪\NWhere are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.30,1:11:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我去工作\NI'm going to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.52,1:11:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,回去睡觉吧\NGo back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.69,1:12:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}杜维尔
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.09,1:12:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我能说的是  我们不会罢休\NAll I can say is that, we will not stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.11,1:12:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们已经坚持了五十年\NBecause we've been doing that for 50 years!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.03,1:12:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么好处\NWhat good does it do?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.01,1:12:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,让律师去开开卡车\NLet the lawyers... Let the lawyers drive a truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.79,1:12:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们需要纸笔  需要印台\NThey need their pencils and papers and their ink pads.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.46,1:12:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那完全是另一回事了\NThat's... That's a whole other story.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.86,1:12:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们会挺过去的\NBut we're gonna get through this.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.01,1:12:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他们用什么法律狗屁打压我们\NWe're gonna get through this legal bullshit
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.26,1:12:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会挺过去的\Nand garbage they're throwing at us.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.46,1:12:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会挺过去的\NWe're gonna get through it because
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.80,1:12:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}新泽西卡车司机
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.42,1:13:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,因为呆子肯尼迪想要什么  并不意味着\N"Boobie" Kennedy wants something, that doesn't mean
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.71,1:13:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这个纨绔子弟就能得手\Nthe rich boy is gonna get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.69,1:13:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你们明白我的意思吧\NYou understand what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.93,1:13:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在乎他要什么  反正他得不到\NI don't care what he wants. He's not gonna get it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.49,1:13:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他得不到  因为\NHe's not gonna get it because
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.70,1:13:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是这个国家\Nwe are the biggest and best,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.68,1:13:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,最庞大  最优秀\Nand most honest union
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.14,1:13:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,最诚实的工会\Nin this country!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.40,1:13:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,对  没错\NYeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.28,1:13:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我就等着这个\NI waited for that!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.75,1:13:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你们知道我今天要讲的关键词是什么\NAnd you know the operative word I'm talking about here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.04,1:13:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-团结  -对\N- Solidarity. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.89,1:13:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,团结有效  对我们所有人都有效\NAnd it works. It works for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.17,1:13:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,对我们的朋友弗兰克·菲茨西蒙斯有效\NAnd it works for our friend here, Frank Fitzsimmons!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.22,1:13:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这位是弗兰克·菲茨西蒙斯\NFrank Fitzsimmons here,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.40,1:13:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我的执行副主席\Nmy executive vice president.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.98,1:13:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有谁能胜任这份工作  那就是他\NIf there's anyone that can do this job, it's this man here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.34,1:13:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,有他为我保驾护航\NAnd with him at my back,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.87,1:13:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定会蒸蒸日上\Nwhere are we gonna go but up!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.94,1:13:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗  菲茨\NIs that right, Fitz?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.86,1:14:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,完全正确  吉米\NAll the way, Jimmy!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.87,1:14:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,霍法  霍法  霍法\NHoffa! Hoffa! Hoffa!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.87,1:14:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一个工会人\NA union man!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.04,1:14:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得他们喜欢菲茨\NYou know, I felt they liked Fitz.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.00,1:14:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,毋庸置疑\NNo two ways about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.06,1:14:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是  你提拔了菲茨\NYeah, you gave Fitz some buildup.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.57,1:14:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,希望他不会辜负你\NI mean, I hope he deserves it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.14,1:14:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说  菲茨有什么不妥吗\NWhy? What's wrong with Fitz?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.49,1:14:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我说不好  我不想批评他\NI don't know. I don't want to knock the guy,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.57,1:14:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但我也说不好\Nbut I... I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.75,1:14:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用批评他  告诉我\NWell, you're not knocking him. Just tell me...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.20,1:14:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我你的感受\NTell me what you feel.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.46,1:14:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他很忠诚  这我可以确定\NI mean, he's a loyal guy, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.15,1:14:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个好人\NHe's a nice guy,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.54,1:14:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但他不够敏锐  不够聪明\Nbut he ain't that sharp. He ain't that smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.91,1:14:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他还...\NAnd he's also like a...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.17,1:14:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他总打高尔夫球\NHe plays a lot of fucking golf, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.47,1:14:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他打高尔夫球\NHe plays golf?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.12,1:14:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那又如何  二把手就需要这样的\NSo what? That's what you want from a number two.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.66,1:14:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不需要太聪明的人\NYou don't want somebody too smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.78,1:14:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,需要一个好人  大家喜欢他\NYou want a nice guy. People like him, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.58,1:15:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不傻  但是个\NNot dumb, but somebody,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.65,1:15:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,可以放心让他走在身后\Nyou know you can have walking behind you
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.93,1:15:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,而不怕被捅刀子的人\Nwithout getting knifed.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.30,1:15:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-希望你是对的  -我总是对的\N- Well, I hope you're right. - I'm always right.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.23,1:15:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以对菲茨可以放一百个心\NI can sleep like a babe with Fitz.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.34,1:15:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我担心的是矮子\NIt's the Little Guy I have to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.93,1:15:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我说的是谁\NYou know what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.25,1:15:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-是  -是\N- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.33,1:15:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,矮子\NThe Little Guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.54,1:15:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-我担心的是他  -嗯\N- That's my worry. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.44,1:15:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那个王八蛋\NThat son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.56,1:15:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\NWhat's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.44,1:15:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,没事  没事  你是对的\NNothing. Nothing. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.76,1:15:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我是对的  是的\NI'm right. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.05,1:15:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-你不会觉得困惑吧  -完全不会\N- You're not perplexed, are you? - Not at all. Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.01,1:15:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我和你说了我对菲茨的感受  至于普罗  你懂的\NI mean, I told you how I felt about Fitz. Pro. You know.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.55,1:15:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好  那就好  因为有时我觉得\NYeah. Good, because sometimes I feel
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.47,1:15:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我一个人看穿了那个狗杂种\NI'm the only one who sees right through that cocksucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.52,1:15:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? 让我们举杯... ?\N? So let's raise a glass... ?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.22,1:15:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-他是个坏人  -他是个坏人\N- He's a bad guy. - He's a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.47,1:15:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? 敬最伟大的人 ?\N? To the greatest guy ?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.05,1:15:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? 能有他是560号地方工会之幸 ?\N? 560 is lucky enough to ever have ?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.30,1:15:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? 你是我们的兄弟 ?\N? You're our boy ?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.14,1:16:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? 托尼·普罗 ?\N? Tony Pro ?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.35,1:16:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? 我们都是你的兄弟 ?\N? We're all yours ?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.90,1:16:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,矮子就是托尼·普罗文扎诺\NThe Little Guy was Tony Provenzano.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.89,1:16:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,人称托尼·普罗\NThey called him Tony Pro.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.22,1:16:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他是新泽西一个大帮派的首领\NHe was a capo in a big Jersey crew
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.72,1:16:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,并且是新泽西联合市\Nand the president of the Local 560
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.43,1:16:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,560号地方工会的主席\Nin Union City, New Jersey.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.90,1:16:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? 他是最伟大的人 ?\N? He's the greatest guy ?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.47,1:16:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? 能有他是560号地方工会之幸 ?\N? 560 is lucky enough to ever have ?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.80,1:16:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼  托尼  托尼\NTony! Tony! Tony!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.72,1:16:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼  托尼  托尼\NTony! Tony! Tony!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.97,1:16:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,普罗和吉米  他们一起发迹\NPro and Jimmy, they came up together
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.05,1:16:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他们曾经很亲近\Nand they were close... for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.93,1:16:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你们没日没夜地工作\NYou turl, you work,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.85,1:16:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,而大企业的老板们\Nwhile the corporation kings
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.43,1:16:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,行业的骄子们\Nand princes of industry,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.55,1:16:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们坐拥巨额报销账单\Nwith their vast expense accounts
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.60,1:17:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,高昂薪水  以及豪华游艇\Nand salary and luxurous yachts,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.26,1:17:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,却致力于毁灭我们\Nhave dedicated themselves to our destruction.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.76,1:17:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,打倒他们\NDown on them!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.89,1:17:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我用不着谁来跟我说托尼·普罗的故事\NI didn't need nobody to tell me about Tony Pro.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.89,1:17:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我还需要知道些什么  我知道的够多了\NOh, no. What did I need to know? I knew enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.22,1:17:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙让萨利·巴格斯\NThis is a man who had Sally Bugs strangle
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.30,1:17:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,勒死了"三指"托尼·卡斯特里图\NTony "Three Fingers" Castellito
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.14,1:17:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就因为三指在工会里的地位越来越高\Njust because Three Fingers was coming up big in the union.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.85,1:17:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那还是他自己人  那可是他自己人\NAnd it was his own guy. It was his own guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.72,1:17:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}萨尔瓦多·布里古里欧  绰号"小虫萨利"\N1979年脸中三枪身亡
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.80,1:17:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼·普罗太担心\NTony Pro was so fucking worried
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.68,1:17:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙会击败他\Nthat this guy was gonna beat him out
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.22,1:17:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,以至于在让小虫萨利勒死他之后\Nthat after he had Sally Bugs strangle the guy,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.93,1:17:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,还让萨利把他塞进了碎树机\Nhe had Sally stick him in a fucking tree shredder.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.89,1:18:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就再也没有竞争了\NThat way there'd be no competition,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.68,1:18:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟他已经粉身碎骨了\Nnot even from the grave.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.89,1:18:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经失控了\NHe's out of control.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.97,1:18:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,拿这种人该怎么办\NWhat are you gonna do with a person like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.55,1:18:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他想从每个人那都分杯羹\NHe's got a hand in everybody's pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.60,1:18:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,勒索货运公司\NShaking down the trucking companies.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.22,1:18:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你能想象吗\NCan you imagine that?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.51,1:18:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,四处威胁人\NThreatening people.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.93,1:18:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,偶尔威胁威胁人\NI mean, you know, threatening people once in a while,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.47,1:18:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题  我能理解\Nokay, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.97,1:18:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但一直威胁人呢\NBut all the time?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.85,1:18:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,会让人注意到我们  你明白吗\NIt's drawing attention to us, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.10,1:18:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的家伙会毁了工会的声誉\NGuys like that give the unions a bad name.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.43,1:18:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,得做点什么了\NSomething's got to be done.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.60,1:18:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我说真的  得做点什么了\NI mean it. Something's gotta be done.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.76,1:18:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼毕竟是托尼...\NTony being Tony, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.60,1:18:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不好...不好弄  我们不能...\Nthat ain't... that ain't easy. We can't...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.85,1:18:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是那个意思  我不是\NI don't mean that. I don't...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.51,1:18:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不是那个意思\NNot... Not that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.97,1:18:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是\NYeah, I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.60,1:18:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想让劳工阶层\NI'm just saying get working guys
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.43,1:18:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那些熟悉工会的  卡车司机工会的正式成员\Nwho know the unions, card-carrying Teamsters,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.05,1:18:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,就像你我这样的\Nlike you and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.85,1:18:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,开始竞选\NStart running,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.22,1:18:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,接管几个地方工会\Ntake over some of the locals.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.68,1:18:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\NWhat do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.35,1:18:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-他不会喜欢的  -谁\N- He ain't gonna like that. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.97,1:18:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,去他的  他算什么东西\NFuck him. Who the fuck is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.97,1:18:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,地痞流氓罢了\NHe's a gangster.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.47,1:19:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我领导着工会  我是主席\NI run the union, I'm the president.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.60,1:19:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是\NSo, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.14,1:19:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我所需要的是一些懂事的家伙\NAll I need is some guys who know their ways around.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.14,1:19:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,知道怎么把控自己\NKnow how to handle themselves, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.22,1:19:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,仅此而已\NThat's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.01,1:19:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我想让你去竞选\NThat's why I want you to run for president
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.47,1:19:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,326号地方工会的主席\Nof Local 326.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.93,1:19:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是我的家人  弗兰克\NYou're like family to me, Frank. You know.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.64,1:19:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你  艾琳\NYou, Irene,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.51,1:19:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们\Nthe girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.72,1:19:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱的佩琪\NThe lovely Peggy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.72,1:19:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但这并不是我这么做的原因\NBut that's not why I'm doing this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.01,1:19:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你的一切都是你自己赢得的\NI'm not giving you anything you didn't earn,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.18,1:19:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,都是你应得的\Nyou didn't deserve.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.01,1:19:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\NWhat do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.76,1:19:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道该说什么了  吉米\NI...I don't know what to say, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.05,1:19:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-我是说...  -只管说你愿意就好\N- I mean, um... - Well, just say you'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.14,1:19:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你只需要说愿意\NThat's all you got to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.18,1:19:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,而且  我能保证你会赢\NPlus, I can guarantee you're gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.55,1:19:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你只要竞选326号地方工会的主席\NHa! When you run for president
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.14,1:19:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你就一定会赢\Nof 326, you're gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.93,1:19:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证\NI guarantee it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.80,1:19:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好  没问题  我愿意\NYeah, okay, I'll do it. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.89,1:20:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,认真的吗\NYou mean it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.80,1:20:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,当然  我很荣幸\NYeah, yeah. I'm... I'm honored.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.26,1:20:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你  我真的爱你  抱一个\NI love you. I just love you, you know. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.14,1:20:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你  伙计\NI love you, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.76,1:20:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,爱到难以言表\NI can't tell ya.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.97,1:20:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,天\NOh, gee.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.18,1:20:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\NThis is so good, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.35,1:20:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我终于能喘口气了\NI feel like I can breathe again.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.26,1:20:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,太有意思了\NIt's so funny. I...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.93,1:20:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不知怎么地  我...\NSomehow I...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.26,1:20:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道  我以为你会拒绝\NI don't know. I thought you would've said no.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.30,1:20:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我很高兴你答应了\NI'm glad you said yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.60,1:20:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我想说\NI mean...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.43,1:20:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克\NFrank...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.43,1:20:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你从来不显露情绪  很难判断\NYou never reveal how you feel, you know. It's hard to tell.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.01,1:20:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我很荣幸  吉米  我不知道\NI'm honored, Jimmy. I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.72,1:20:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是不知道该说什么\NIt's just I don't know what to... say,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.64,1:20:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我很荣幸\Nyou know, but I'm honored.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.39,1:20:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那就好\NWell, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.43,1:20:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,让我感觉很好\NThat makes me feel good.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.38,1:20:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我能喘口气了\NI can breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.85,1:20:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\NThat's so great.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.97,1:20:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我\NI...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.30,1:21:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}卡车司机326号地方工会
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.47,1:21:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我还能说什么  我的一切都是吉米给的\NWhat can I say? I mean, I owe it all to Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.60,1:21:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他把我从运肉卡车中解救出来  给了我新的开始\NHe took me out of a meat truck, he gave me my start.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.85,1:21:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他给我了首个职位  他给了我第一个工会\NHe gave me my first charter. He gave me my first union.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.68,1:21:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-你好  -你好\N- How are ya? - Hey, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.26,1:21:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我是弗兰克·希兰  326号地方工会的新任主席\NFrank Sheeran, the new president of Union 326.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.10,1:21:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-我来自我介绍一下  -很高兴认识你\N- I wanted to introduce myself. - Nice to meet ya.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.76,1:21:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-你叫什么  -我叫阿尔\N- What's your name? - My name's Al.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.39,1:21:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔  很高兴认识你\NAl. Nice to meet ya, Al.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.35,1:21:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-一点心意  -不  不用\N- A little something... - No, no. Don't need it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.76,1:21:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-确定吗  -当然\N- Sure? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.85,1:21:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,只是过来问个好  自我介绍一下\NJust came here to say hello, introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.64,1:21:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么需要  只管联系我  好吗\NYou need anything, just get in touch with me. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.85,1:21:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-你确定吗  -当然\N- You sure? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.89,1:21:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.80,1:21:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}弗兰克·希兰  326号地方工会主席
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.85,1:21:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,所以  我们假设  如果他们能证明\NSo, hypothetically, if they can prove
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.76,1:21:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你从他们那偷了东西\Nthat you stole from them,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.76,1:21:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会想要你供出同伙的名字\Nwhat they're gonna want are names, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.43,1:22:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意交代几个名字  免去牢狱之灾吗\NWould you be willing to give up names to keep from going to jail?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.47,1:22:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.60,1:22:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就没什么好担心的了\NOkay. So you got nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.85,1:22:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-律师会帮你摆平的  -谢谢  希兰先生\N- The lawyers will take care of it. - Thank you, Mr. Sheeran.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.51,1:22:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,沿80号州际公路西段开过宾州\NThe Interstate 80 West through the rest of Pennsylvania,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.05,1:22:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们横穿俄亥俄州到托莱多\Nand then we'd go across Ohio all the way to Toledo,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.18,1:22:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,接着我们沿着75号公路北上底特律\Nand then we'd go 75 North to Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.01,1:22:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,依然能够准时到达\NAnd we'd still get there on time.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.10,1:22:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,法官阁下  法律顾问已经告诉我的委托人\NYour Honor, my client had been advised by counsel
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.47,1:22:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,她妻子作为货运公司所有者之一\Nthat it was perfectly legal for his wife
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.68,1:22:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是完全合法的\Nto be part owner of a trucking business.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.01,1:22:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,而在麦克莱伦委员会质询其合法性时\NStill, when the McClellan Committee challenged its legality,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.01,1:22:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an3\pos(380,235)}美国参议院针对工人\N及管理层不当行为特别委员会
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.14,1:22:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,她第一时间退出了公司\Nshe withdrew from the company immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.55,1:22:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,事情到此就该告一段落\NThat should be the end of the matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.35,1:22:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,在十三次大陪审团调查中\NThere had been not one indictment served
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.55,1:22:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我的委托人没有一次被判有罪\Nagainst my client in 13 grand jury investigations.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.72,1:23:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,法官阁下  这是典型的\NYour Honor, this is an example of
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.60,1:23:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,对我的委托人和他的家人的恶意报复\Na personal vendetta against my client,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.89,1:23:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是令人失望的司法部和司法部长罗伯特·肯尼迪\Nagainst his family, by a frustrated Justice Department
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.55,1:23:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,在针对我的委托人\Nand the attorney general, Robert Kennedy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.55,1:23:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他手上有枪\NHe's got a gun!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.72,1:23:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,把枪先抢下来\NGet that gun out of his hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.14,1:23:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,别激动  小伙子\NEasy, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.97,1:23:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是真枪吧\NThat was not a real gun, was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.68,1:23:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,枪是怎么进来的\NHow'd that gun get in?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.18,1:23:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么进来的\NHow'd it get in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.26,1:23:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,又不是我的错\NIt wasn't my fault!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.97,1:23:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道\NI don't know!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.40,1:23:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我的查奇\NMy Chuckie!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.89,1:23:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我儿子\NHey, it's my son!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.80,1:23:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的孩子  我把他养大的\NThat's my kid. I raised this kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.93,1:23:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你们看见了吗  看见他的英勇之举了吗\NYou see him? You see what he did?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.43,1:23:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉你们\NI'll tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.60,1:23:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他冲我开了枪  感觉像是小弹丸似的\NHe shot at me, and it was like a pellet or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.68,1:23:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么感觉  就一点点冲击力\NI didn't feel it, I just felt a little impact,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.80,1:24:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至还比不上被BB枪打了\Nlike I was shot not even with a BB gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.10,1:24:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,比BB枪更弱\NSomething even lighter.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.97,1:24:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但我冲向了他\NBut I charged him.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.22,1:24:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我和查奇都冲向了他  如果你们看见了的话\NI charged him and so did Chuckie, if you noticed.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.26,1:24:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我把他教得很好\NI taught him well.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.51,1:24:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,遇到持枪的永远要冲上去\NYou charge a guy, always charge a guy with a gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.39,1:24:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是持刀的跑就行了\NWith a knife, you run away.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.10,1:24:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,遇到持刀的就跑  持枪的就冲\NRun away from a knife. So you charge with a gun,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.30,1:24:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-持刀的就跑  -没错\N- with a knife, you run. - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.43,1:24:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我还押韵了\NHey! I rhymed!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.51,1:24:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道很难让人相信  但我收到了上头的消息\NI know it sounds crazy, but I got a message from a higher power
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.18,1:24:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}田纳西州纳什维尔警局
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.97,1:24:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,让我杀了吉米·霍法\Ntelling me to shoot Jimmy Hoffa.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.51,1:24:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\NCome with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.26,1:24:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,纳什维尔有很多疯子  弗兰克\NA lot of nuts in Nashville, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.39,1:24:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,快过来  弗兰克\NCome on down, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.22,1:24:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我边上就有一个\NYeah, I got one of them with me now, you see.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.26,1:24:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,快过来  弗兰克\NGet down here, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.43,1:24:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪·帕丁  巴顿鲁日的那家伙\NEddie Partin, you know the guy from Baton Rouge,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.55,1:24:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他也在这里\Nhe's here with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.60,1:24:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好  我马上过去\NYeah. Yeah, I'll get right down.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.93,1:24:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,别挡道  伙计们  让让\NOut of my way, boys. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.05,1:24:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,让让\NCome on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.35,1:24:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,布伦南先生是否先说了\NDid Mr. Brennan first say,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.01,1:24:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,或者你是否记得他首先说了\Nor do you remember him first saying
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.68,1:24:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,像是"我要更改交易条款\Nsomething about, say, "I had to change the deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.68,1:24:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我得让霍法也分一杯羹"这样的话\NI have to cut Hoffa in on the new deal"?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.80,1:24:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这不就是整件事的源头吗\NWasn't that like the chronology of the whole thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.97,1:25:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道他变更了交易条款\NI don't know he changed the deal,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.18,1:25:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但我在电话这头的理解是\Nbut it was my understanding over the telephone that Brennan
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.72,1:25:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,布伦南只代表了他自己\Nwas speaking for himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.97,1:25:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,她看上去很愤怒  这一看就很愤怒\NShe's an angry woman. That's an angry woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.55,1:25:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\NOh. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.14,1:25:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-我想她曾经是个老师  -没错\N- She was a teacher I think. - Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.35,1:25:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在研究的是这个\NWhat we're looking at is this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.01,1:25:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这个可不好搞定\NThis one is not approachable.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.30,1:25:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,她很难攻破\NNo, she'd be a tough nut to crack.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.01,1:25:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有很多家族财产\NThere's a lot of family money there.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.60,1:25:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...将会截停搜查\N...will hail, stop, and search
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.30,1:25:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,所有驶往古巴的船只\Nall ships bound for Cuba.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.14,1:25:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,若船长不停船\NIf the ships' captains do not stop,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.14,1:25:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将采取武力截停\Nforce will be used to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.05,1:25:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,如果船停下...\NIf the ships do stop...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.35,1:25:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得可以选这个\NSee, I think there's an in here...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.60,1:25:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你是否对大陪审团\NDid you make this statement
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.35,1:25:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,做出过如下陈述\Nto the grand jury? I'll read it for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.60,1:25:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"布伦南过来跟我说了些\N"Brennan came to me and said words
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.10,1:25:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,类似于他要继续的话..."\Nto the effect he's gonna go ahead..."
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.80,1:25:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他开了家餐厅\NHe's got a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.10,1:25:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你查过违法行为了吗\NDid you look into violations?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.35,1:25:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,查了  我更愿意选女人\NYeah. I'd rather stick with the women.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.22,1:25:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-她们更好搞定  -吉米  谢谢\N- They're more approachable. - Jimmy, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.43,1:25:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...已在古巴部署可用的中程导弹\N...in Cuba of operational medium-range missiles.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.35,1:25:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他还表示如果导弹发射\NHe added that if one of the missiles is launched,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.85,1:25:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会携带有核弹头\Nit would probably carry a nuclear warhead.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.51,1:25:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,能够打击美国东南部任何地区\NIt could hit any spot in the southeast United States,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.51,1:25:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,以及华盛顿南部\Nsouth of Washington.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.97,1:25:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,而我们无法拦截\NAnd that we would have no way of intercepting it
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.43,1:25:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,也无法提前预警\Nor issuing a warning about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.60,1:26:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这位嫁给了一个叫普莱切特的州警\NThis one's married to a state trooper named Plechette.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.80,1:26:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不错\NThat's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.72,1:26:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,有门路吗\NWe know anyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.68,1:26:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,有  地方工会有个当过警察的\NWell, yeah, we got an ex-cop in the Local.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.14,1:26:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\NThat's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.22,1:26:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的所有部队都提高了警戒级别\NAll our forces have been put on increased alert.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.68,1:26:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,过来跟我聊了几句  大意是\N...came to me and said words to the effect
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.51,1:26:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他打算开家公司出租卡车\Nhe's gonna go ahead and set up a company to lease trucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.47,1:26:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但之后  他又打电话  他的原话是\NBut later, he called me on the phone and said quote,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.35,1:26:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,"我要更改交易条款\N"I gotta change the deal
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.97,1:26:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我要让霍法也分一杯羹"\N'cause I gotta cut Hoffa in on the deal."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.72,1:26:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样吗  先生\NIs that accurate, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.10,1:26:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这是另一个可以下手的对象\NThis one's another possibility.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.10,1:26:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-等等  -她有过情人\N- Wait. - Well, she had a boyfriend,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.93,1:26:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,她婚后还跟别人有一腿\Nshe's seeing somebody else while she's married.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.22,1:26:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,所以可以用这个要挟她\NSo it could be... It could grab her,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.72,1:26:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-抓着她不放  -对  但是...\N- hold on to her. - Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.68,1:26:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但这家伙\NBut this guy,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.80,1:27:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,开建筑公司的  做过一些违反的事情\Nthe construction business. He has a couple of violations,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.35,1:27:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他的房子有留置权\Nthere's a lien on his house.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.68,1:27:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,车还没付钱\NHis car is unpaid.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.85,1:27:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  继续  别在领先的时候放弃\NThat's good. Keep going. Don't quit while you're ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.85,1:27:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢  回见  大艾迪\NThank you. See you, Big Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.26,1:27:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你是否向上帝发誓\NDo you swear to tell the truth,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.35,1:27:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你所说的全是事实\Nthe whole truth and nothing but the truth,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.93,1:27:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-没有任何隐瞒  -我发誓\N- so help you God? - I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.85,1:27:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,金先生  你是\NMr. King, you're a member of
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.47,1:27:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,国际卡车司机工会的成员  对吗  先生\Nthe International Brotherhood of Teamsters, is that correct, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.85,1:27:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,恕我拒绝回答这个问题\NI respectfully decline to answer that under the
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.51,1:27:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我要行使第五修正案赋予我的权利\Nprotection afforded me by the Fifth Amendment.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.35,1:27:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是问你是不是卡车司机工会的  先生\NI just asked if you're a Teamster, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.10,1:27:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,恕我拒绝回答...\NI respectfully decline to answer...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.47,1:27:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好  没问题  行\NOkay. All right. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.85,1:27:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我要给你看张照片  行吗\NI'm gonna show you a photograph, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.76,1:27:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-恕我拒绝回答....  -等等\N- I respectfully decline to answer... - Wait. Wait. Wait. Wait...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.14,1:27:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我要行使...\N...under the protection...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.39,1:28:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}田纳西州警
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.97,1:27:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你还没看这张照片\NYou haven't even seen the photograph yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.64,1:28:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,看着这张照片  好好看看\NLook at the photograph, wait a smidge,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.68,1:28:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-然后你可以...  -根据我的理解\N- and then you can... - I want to avail myself
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.80,1:28:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我想援引宪法赋予我的权利\Nof my right under the constitution, as I understand it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.89,1:28:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}威廉·E·米勒法官阁下
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.85,1:28:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-吉米  让他援引自己的权利  -好吧\N- Jim, let him avail himself. - Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.85,1:28:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}希尔德布兰特糖果冰淇淋店
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.68,1:28:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\NOh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.18,1:28:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,金是最棒的\NThat King's the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.26,1:28:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他是最棒的  他是个好人\NHe's the best. He's a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.64,1:28:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到他是怎样对付那个混蛋的吗\NYou see him stand up to that jerk?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.18,1:28:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了  看到了  我知道  他很棒\NYeah, yeah, I know. He was great.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.14,1:28:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我就喜欢他这么干\NI love what he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.26,1:28:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他们想让他开口  他们尽了全力\NThey tried to get him, they tried their best.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.18,1:28:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们需要更多他这样的人  -天啊\N- We need more like him. - Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.39,1:28:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚刚收到更多详细信息\NMore details just arrived.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.80,1:28:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这些详细信息是最新的\NThese details are not the same as previously.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.51,1:28:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,肯尼迪总统在车队\NPresident Kennedy, shot today,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.10,1:28:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,离开达拉斯市区时遇刺\Njust as his motorcade left downtown Dallas.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.89,1:28:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,肯尼迪夫人上前\NMrs. Kennedy jumped up
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.10,1:28:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,抱住肯尼迪先生  大喊"不"\Nand grabbed Mr. Kennedy. She called, "Oh, no!"
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.14,1:28:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,车队加速驶离\NThe motorcade sped on.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.76,1:28:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,合众社报道称肯尼迪总统受的\NUnited Press says that the wounds of President Kennedy
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.93,1:28:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是致命伤\Nperhaps could be fatal.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.89,1:29:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,正在重播哥伦比亚广播公司新闻发出的简报\NRepeating a bulletin from CBS News.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.93,1:29:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,肯尼迪总统在得克萨斯州的达拉斯市\NPresident Kennedy has been shot
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.14,1:29:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,被一名嫌疑刺客开枪击中\Nby a would-be assassin in Dallas, Texas.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.47,1:29:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,请继续关注哥伦比亚广播公司新闻\NStay tuned to CBS News for
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.57,1:29:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,了解更多详细信息\Nfurther details.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.05,1:29:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.85,1:29:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,要做出一杯真正的咖啡\NIt takes more than an instant
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.93,1:29:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,一瞬间可不够\Nto make a real cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.22,1:29:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,因此雀巢咖啡研制出了一种新产品\NThat's why Nescafé has come up with a new kind of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.05,1:29:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这不只是一种即溶咖啡  而是新的雀巢分钟煮咖啡\NIt's more than an instant. It's new Minute Brew Nescafé.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.76,1:29:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,人人都能做出...\NAnybody can make a...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.85,1:29:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这显然是一则官方简报\NThe flash, apparently official,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.10,1:29:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,肯尼迪总统于中部标准时间下午一点\NPresident Kennedy died at 1:00 p.m. Central standard time,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.76,1:29:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,东部标准时间下午两点去世\Ntwo o'clock, eastern standard time,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.60,1:29:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,大约38分钟前\Nsome 38 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.22,1:29:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,副总统约翰逊已离开位于达拉斯的医院\NVice President Johnson has left the hospital in Dallas,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.55,1:29:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们不知道他将前往哪里\Nbut we do not know, uh, to where he has proceeded.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.35,1:29:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,预计他很快将宣誓就职\NPresumably, he will be taking the oath of office shortly
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.14,1:30:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,成为第36届美国总统\Nand become the 36th President of the United States.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.93,1:30:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}国际卡车司机工会
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.18,1:30:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,霍法先生  你会参加\NMr. Hoffa, will you be attending
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.55,1:30:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,总统的葬礼吗\Nthe President's funeral?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.22,1:30:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有受邀\NI wasn't invited.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.30,1:30:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不一定要受邀  上百万的美国人都会参加\NYou don't have to be invited. A million Americans will be there.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.14,1:30:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那...\NWell...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.55,1:30:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我得查查我的日程\NI guess I'll have to check my schedule.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.30,1:30:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你去参加并被请求发言  你会说什么\NIf you were to go and asked to speak, what would you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.22,1:30:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我会说\NI'd say, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.97,1:30:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍比·肯尼迪现在只是个普通律师了\NBobby Kennedy is just another lawyer now.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.89,1:30:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋\NSon of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.22,1:30:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}国际卡车司机工会
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.30,1:30:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  埃里克  非常感谢\NGood, Eric. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.01,1:31:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米说得对\NJimmy was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.05,1:31:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,几乎是对的\NAlmost.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.80,1:31:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍比的刁难到此为止了\NThat was the end of it with Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.72,1:31:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他卸任司法部长了  事情了结了\NSo much for him being the attorney general. That was done.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.10,1:31:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍比跟我们的宿怨结束了\NBobby's vendetta was over, with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.93,1:31:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,霍法先生\NMr. Hoffa,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.01,1:31:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你因损害了这个国家的灵魂\Nyou stand here convicted of having tampered
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.01,1:31:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,被判有罪\Nwith the very soul of this nation.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.93,1:31:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但纳什维尔那个陪审团的事情还没完\NBut there was still that jury thing in Nashville.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.18,1:31:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,先生  这个国家的灵魂在于\NThe soul of this nation, sir,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.47,1:31:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,它神圣的司法程序\Nlies in its sacred processes of justice.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.72,1:31:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,正义必须得到伸张\NJustice must be done.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.68,1:31:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你因为曾邪恶地企图破坏这套程序\NAnd for your wicked attempts to corrupt these processes,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.26,1:31:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,将会受到法律的制裁\Njustice will be done on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.35,1:31:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们终于抓到他了\NWe got him now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.05,1:31:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们抓到他了\NWe got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.14,1:31:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们  我们做到了\NLadies and gentlemen, we did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.35,1:32:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}囚车不作鸣枪警示
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.64,1:32:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但是吉米把一切都安排妥当了\NBut Jimmy, you know, he had it all set up.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.64,1:32:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然表面看起来是\NAlthough you knew it was supposed to look like Fitz
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.85,1:32:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,菲茨在管事\Nwas the one in charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.76,1:32:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但他通过比尔·巴法利诺和\NHe gave Fitz his orders through
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.30,1:32:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}詹姆斯·R·霍法
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.37,1:32:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,艾伦·多夫曼给菲茨下指令\NBill Bufalino and Allen Dorfman,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.10,1:32:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们还替吉米放贷\Nand they ran Jimmy's loans.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.89,1:32:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,在里面待得还好吗  一切都...\NBut things are good in here? Everything is...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.06,1:32:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都糟透了\NEverything's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.89,1:32:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,夜不能寐  因为担心\NYou don't sleep at night 'cause you're afraid
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.80,1:32:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,有人会拿刀捅你\Nsomeone's gonna knife you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.89,1:32:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但你看上去不错  还不错\N'Cause you look okay. You look okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.30,1:32:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,菲茨在哪  他迟到了\NWhere's Fitz? He's late.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.22,1:32:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们本来要在正门等他的  他...\NYeah. Well, we were gonna meet him in the front. He...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.80,1:32:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,在正门等他吗\NMeet him in the front?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.93,1:32:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他来了  他来了\NHere he is, here he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.89,1:32:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底去哪了  你来这干什么\NWhere the hell have you been? What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.47,1:32:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底来干什么  菲茨\NWhy did you even come at all, Fitz?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.76,1:32:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道自己迟到了吗\NYou know, are you aware you're late?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.01,1:32:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我就想知道这个  你知道自己迟到了吗\NThat's all I want to know. Do you know you're late?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.60,1:32:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起我迟到了  吉米\NI'm sorry I'm late, Jimmy,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.35,1:32:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们有很多事要做\Nbut we got a lot going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.97,1:32:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有很多事要做\NWe got a lot going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.93,1:32:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想听这种话  我想听点具体的\NI don't wanna hear that. I wanna hear something concrete,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.64,1:32:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我想听你直入正题\NI wanna hear something straight on.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.26,1:33:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想请你耐心一点\NI'm just gonna ask you to be a little more patient.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.47,1:33:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们会...\NI think we're gonna have...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.26,1:33:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我在坐牢  不会太耐心\NI'm inside here. I'm not gonna be too patient.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.93,1:33:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管吉米对菲茨很不爽\NAs much as Jimmy was getting pissed off at Fitz,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.18,1:33:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,其他人还是喜欢他  因为\Neverybody else liked him because
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.80,1:33:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可以从他那里得到想要的一切\Nthey could get anything out of him that they wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.18,1:33:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他们不能从吉米那得到的\NThey couldn't do that with Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.51,1:33:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,如果进了监狱  难免会发生这种事情\NThat's what happens when you go away to college.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.60,1:33:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,打得怎么样\NHow's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.72,1:33:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米生菲茨的气\NJimmy's pissed off with Fitz.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.30,1:33:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,菲茨还不错  我们喜欢他\NFitz is okay. We like Fitz.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.30,1:33:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉你问题出在哪\NI'll tell you what the problem is.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.01,1:33:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米让那个难缠的多夫曼\NJimmy's got that ballbusting Dorfman
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.02,1:33:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,拖延菲茨已经同意的贷款\Nholding up loans that Fitz already okayed.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.85,1:33:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌那个多夫曼\NI hate that Dorfman.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.93,1:33:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个令人头疼的犹太人\NHe's such a pain-in-the-ass fucking Jew.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.01,1:33:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我怎么办\NWhat do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.01,1:33:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不  先别那样  先别那样\NNo, not that. Not that.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.68,1:33:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你要做的就是\NWhat you gotta do is, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.93,1:33:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,警告一下多夫曼\Nput a firecracker up Dorfman's ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.10,1:33:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,菲茨会明白的\NFitz'll get the message.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.47,1:33:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他会明白的\NHe'll get the message.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.26,1:33:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能对菲茨下手  因为如果...\NI mean, you can't do it to Fitz because if...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.01,1:34:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你对那个酒鬼下手\Nif you do it to that lush,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.01,1:34:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他会直接去找联调局  搞砸一切\Nhe'll run right to the feds and screw up everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.18,1:34:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,但多夫曼\NBut Dorfman...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.93,1:34:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你要对多夫曼下手\NYou gotta do it to Dorfman.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.89,1:34:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? If your heartaches ?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.89,1:34:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Cry - Johnnie Ray & The Four Lads
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.89,1:34:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? Seem to hang around ?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.47,1:34:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? If your heartaches Seem to hang around ?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.85,1:34:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,菲茨  菲茨明白我们的意思了\NFitz... Fitz got the message.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.39,1:34:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,从此以后  任何人想从养老基金里\NAfter that, anybody who wanted anything
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.47,1:34:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,捞一笔  都能得偿所愿\Nfrom the pension fund, they got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.39,1:35:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,老是翻到这张牌\NThe thing keeps comin' around. Keeps comin' around.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.77,1:35:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\NWhat's goin' on?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.68,1:35:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-搞什么  -这家伙是谁\N- Fuck is this? - Who's this guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.47,1:35:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,谁让你进来的\NWho let you in?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.68,1:35:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,普罗文扎诺先生\NMr. Provenzano.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.23,1:35:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我是联调局的迪格雷奥里奥探员\NI'm Agent DiGregorio of the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.51,1:35:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我有你的逮捕令  请站起来\NI have a warrant for your arrest. Please stand.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.31,1:35:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我能把手里的牌打完吗\NCan I finish my hand?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.32,1:35:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不行  先生  请站起来\NNo, sir. Please stand.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.64,1:35:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,反正我手气烂透了\NI had a bad fucking hand anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.85,1:35:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}安东尼·加卡罗内  人称"托尼·杰克"\N人缘很好  于2001年2月23日寿终正寝
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.72,1:35:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,牌才打到一半\NMiddle of the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.39,1:35:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,让他一起打吧\NJoin the club. Deal him in.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.18,1:35:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,请伸另一只手\NOther arm, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.10,1:35:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-我能拿我的包吗  -不行  先生\N- Can I get my bags? - No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.93,1:35:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我口袋里什么都没有  我穿着短裤呢\NI got nothing in my pocket. I got fucking shorts on here.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.68,1:35:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,看看那边那只企鹅\NLook at this penguin over there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.10,1:35:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼  你能帮我拿下包吗\NHey, Tony, will you get my bags?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.39,1:35:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,行  我会帮你拿包\NYeah, I'll get your bags.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.89,1:35:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这就像在看电视\NThis is like watchin' TV.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.01,1:35:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,普罗因为敲诈被抓  判了七年\NThey got Pro for extortion and gave him seven years.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.80,1:35:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,把他送去了路易斯堡监狱\NAnd they sent him to Lewisburg prison.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.55,1:35:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他和谁落在一起了\NSo who does he end up with?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.68,1:35:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米\NJimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.68,1:35:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这个\NLook at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.22,1:35:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,简直是艺术品\NA work of art.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.35,1:35:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢  皮特\NThank you, Pete.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.76,1:36:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我要跟你谈谈养老金的问题\NI gotta talk to you about a problem I got with my pension.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.01,1:36:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\NI know.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.22,1:36:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道\NYou know?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.30,1:36:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道什么\NWhat do you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.51,1:36:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\NI know
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.01,1:36:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你有120万\Nyou got a million two
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.72,1:36:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,而且出了问题\Nand, uh, there's a problem with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.39,1:36:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那你会帮我查查吗\NSo you'll look into it for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.76,1:36:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我要怎么查  我能查什么\NHow am I going to look into it? What am I gonna look into?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.89,1:36:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么回事\NIt is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.85,1:36:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\NWell, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.55,1:36:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这笔钱没了\NYou lost it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.30,1:36:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你进来时它就被没收了  就是这样\NYou forfeited it when you came in here. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.39,1:36:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你的也被没收了吗\NSo is yours forfeited too?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.30,1:36:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.72,1:36:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们先理清楚  你的钱还在\NOk, let me get this straight. So yours is still there,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.35,1:36:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你的150万什么的\Nyour million five, whatever it is,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.51,1:36:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但我的钱没了\Nbut mine's gone?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.85,1:36:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,对  我的钱还在\NYeah. Mine's still there.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.89,1:37:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但我俩现在都在牢里\NBut we're both sitting here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.64,1:37:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我俩都在牢里  没错\NWe're both sitting here. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.97,1:37:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我俩坐牢的原因不同\NOnly we're sitting here for different things.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.18,1:37:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你是因为敲诈\NYou're sitting here for extortion.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.51,1:37:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我是因为欺诈\NI'm sitting here for fraud.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.22,1:37:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-那又怎样  -怎样  是有差别的\N- So? - So? So there's a difference.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.55,1:37:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,什么差别\NWhat's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.85,1:37:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我没威胁任何人  但你威胁了\NI didn't threaten anybody, you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.72,1:37:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那又怎样  根本说不通\NSo what? That makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.47,1:37:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,当然说得通\NWhat do you mean? It does.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.68,1:37:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我不想跟你辩论\NNo, it doesn't. I don't want a debate.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.55,1:37:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-想想看  -我在想了  吉米\N- Think about it. - I'm thinking about it, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.01,1:37:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,别唬我  吉米\NNo, don't fuck with me, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.55,1:37:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,做点什么\NJust do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.97,1:37:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,"做点什么"是什么意思\NWhat do you mean, "do something about it"?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.85,1:37:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我能做什么\NWhat am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.72,1:37:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托  你总有办法\NCome on, there's always something you can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.26,1:37:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不  联邦法律我没办法\NNo. It's federal law.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.93,1:37:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-我不管  -你不管\N- I don't care. - You don't care?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.47,1:37:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是能做点什么\NNo, you can still do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.05,1:37:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我无能为力  我能做什么\NThere's nothing I can do. What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.89,1:37:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,把我的钱拿回来\NYou can get my fucking money.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.26,1:37:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么拿\NHow?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.97,1:37:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-找个办法  -什么办法\N- Some other way. - What way?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.35,1:37:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么拿回你的钱  你就怎么帮我\NThe same way you got your money.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.89,1:38:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,小点声\NLower your fucking voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.93,1:38:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我小点声\NYou telling me to lower my voice?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.64,1:38:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我让你小点声\NI'm tellin' you to lower your fucking voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.85,1:38:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,鳖孙\NCocksucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.80,1:38:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-别叫我鳖孙  -去你的\N- Don't call me a cocksucker. - Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.39,1:38:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你再骂我试试\NDon't you fucking dare.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.35,1:38:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你是因为欺诈进来的\NLook, you're here for fraud.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.01,1:38:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-你偷钱  -我偷钱\N- You stole money. - I stole money?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.93,1:38:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我也偷钱\NYeah, I stole money.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.60,1:38:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  偷的手段不同  尽管如此\NOkay, fine, in a different way, but still,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.22,1:38:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我要我应得的那份\NI want what I'm fucking owed.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.68,1:38:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这些人\NYou people. You people.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.47,1:38:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-你说什么  -天啊\N- What did you say? - Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.85,1:38:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么\NWhat did you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.51,1:38:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,得了吧  还我说什么\NOh, come on, what I said.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.97,1:38:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我说什么\NWhat the fuck did I say?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.10,1:38:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你说了"你们这些人"\N"You people." You said "You people."
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.72,1:38:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么意思  "你们这些人"\NWhat does that fucking mean, "You people"?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.55,1:38:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想\NI'm done
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.14,1:38:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,再谈这事了\Ntalking about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.64,1:38:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-解释一下"你们这些人"  -我不谈了\N- "You people"? - I'm done!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.14,1:38:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你不谈了  看我不把你脑袋拧下来\NYou're done? I'll rip your fucking head off!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.64,1:38:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你个人渣\NFucking piece of shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.90,1:38:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了你\NI'll fucking kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.43,1:38:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了你  混账\NI'll fucking kill you. Motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.35,1:38:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么\NWhat the fuck...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.76,1:38:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那时候你就知道一切将分崩离析\NRight then, you knew it was all gonna fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.68,1:39:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我不敢相信那个疯狂的王八蛋\NI can't believe that crazy bastard
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.39,1:39:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然觉得自己\Nthought he could do that
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.26,1:39:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,能在哥伦布广场当着五千人的面得逞\Nright there at Columbus Circle, in front of 5,000 people
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.01,1:39:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,还能逃脱\Nand get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.35,1:39:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我不敢相信  那可不对  弗兰克\NI can't believe it. That is not right, Frankie.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.26,1:39:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那可不对\NThat is not right.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.43,1:39:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那人是个彻头彻尾的混蛋\NThat is a total piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.55,1:39:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那人是个混蛋\NThat's a piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.76,1:39:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一个人有胆量\NThere's only one guy who would have the balls,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.72,1:39:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,有勇气那么做\Nthe nerve, the audacity to do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.93,1:40:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,城里叫他金发乔伊\NHe was known Downtown as "Joey the Blond,"
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.14,1:40:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但所有人  尤其是报纸\Nbut everybody, especially the newspapers,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.18,1:40:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,都叫他疯子乔\Ncalled him "Crazy Joe."
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.85,1:40:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,...向上帝发誓\N...shall be the truth,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.97,1:40:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你所说的全是事实  没有任何隐瞒\Nthe whole truth and nothing but the truth, so help you God?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.93,1:40:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-我发誓  -请坐\N- I do. - Be seated.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.89,1:40:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,加洛先生  你要做开庭陈述吗\NMr. Gallo, do you have an opening statement?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.43,1:40:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,要\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.35,1:40:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这地毯特别适合玩掷骰子\NThis carpet would be great for a crap game.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.02,1:40:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素说得对\NRuss was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.15,1:40:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,还有谁会像他那样和娱乐圈的人鬼混\NI mean, who the hell else runs around with show business people like that,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.50,1:40:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,成天到晚让报纸记者给他拍照\Ngetting his picture taken in the papers all the time,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.96,1:40:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}卡巴纳宫酒店
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.96,1:40:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,想方设法吸引大家的注意力  搞什么\Ndrawing attention to himself and everybody. What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.66,1:40:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他以为自己是谁  明星埃罗尔·弗林吗\NWho does he think he is, Errol Flynn?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.46,1:40:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他跟所有人和事对着干\NHe went against everything and everybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.37,1:40:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都不在乎\NJust didn't give a shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.94,1:40:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,年轻的时候  他绑架了自己的老大\NAnd, growing up, he kidnapped his own bosses.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.63,1:40:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道他是怎么逃脱的\NI don't know how he got away with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.35,1:40:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,一般人没法逃脱  绑架老大就是死路一条\NYou don't get away with that. You do that, you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.61,1:40:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么简单\NThat simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.72,1:40:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他坐牢的时候\NWhen he went away to the can,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.19,1:41:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,招募了黑人而不是白人\Nhe recruited black guys instead of his own kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.11,1:41:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,等他出狱  没人知道他在做什么\NAnd when he got out, nobody knew what he was doing,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.13,1:41:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,跟谁一起做\Nor who he was doing with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.38,1:41:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不知道是什么情况  没人知道\NWe didn't know what the hell was going on. Nobody did.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.40,1:41:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不喜欢他的做法\NAnd if you don't like what he's doing,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.16,1:41:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你出声抱怨\Nand you say something,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.46,1:41:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你就等着看会发生什么吧\Nthen you see what happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.79,1:41:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}意大利裔美国人人权联盟
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.56,1:41:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,谁会做那种事  谁会那么办事\NWho does something like that? Who does things like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.57,1:41:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉你\NI'll tell you. I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.29,1:41:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这个无赖\NThis disgraziato.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.85,1:41:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他和奥斯瓦尔德是一类的\NHim and Oswald. Two of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.21,1:41:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,至少在达拉斯  那些孩子不在\NAt least in Dallas, the kids weren't there.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.67,1:41:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,只有杰姬\NIt was just Jackie.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.04,1:41:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,乔伊  你的医生打来电话  你一小时之前死了\NJoey, your doctor called. You died an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.49,1:41:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你是犹太人吗\NYou a Jewish fellow?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.02,1:42:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你想当犹太人吗\NWould you like to be?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.19,1:42:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心割礼  现在不会那么做了\NDon't worry about the operation. We don't do that no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.72,1:42:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,现在会先打麻药\NWe freeze it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.42,1:42:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你就站着什么都不用做\NAnd you stand there and don't do anything
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.99,1:42:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,一个墨西哥婆娘拿着块湿石头走过来\Nand a Mexican broad comes over with a wet rock.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.11,1:42:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,啪\NThwack!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.71,1:42:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,大笑没问题  我开所有人的玩笑\NSee, it's okay to laugh. I make fun of everybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.07,1:42:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝带我们来到世上就是为了让我们笑\NThat's why God put us on this earth, to laugh.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.03,1:42:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都是我的讽刺对象\NI work everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.26,1:42:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我开黑人玩笑  我开犹太人玩笑\NI make fun of blacks, I make fun of Jews.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.51,1:42:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,吉普赛人  意大利人\NI work Gypsies, I work Italians.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.87,1:42:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那些意大利人可不行\NWell, not those Italians.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.28,1:42:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不\NNo, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.80,1:42:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的  乔伊  我有钱  别开枪\NIt's okay, Joey. I got the money. Don't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.03,1:42:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他们今天告诉我\NI was told today,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.37,1:42:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,"说话千万小心"\N"Be very careful about what you say."
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.85,1:42:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但抛开那些玩笑  生日快乐  乔伊\NBut, uh, all kidding aside, happy birthday, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.28,1:42:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素\NRuss.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.26,1:42:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你戴那个干什么\NWhat are you doing with that?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.58,1:42:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}意大利裔美国人人权联盟
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.26,1:42:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你真相信那个狗屁联盟\NYou really believe in that bullshit league?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.76,1:43:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不是因为那个\NWell, it's not that.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.66,1:43:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是意大利裔\NIt's Italian.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.62,1:43:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,乔伊  乔伊\NJoey. Joey.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.54,1:43:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-我说什么了  -不不不\N- What did I say? - Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.98,1:43:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-我说什么了  -乔伊  乔伊\N- What did I say? - Joey, Joey. Joey. Joey.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.62,1:43:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\NNow, listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.82,1:43:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能在这儿说那种话  明白吗  不行\NYou can't say that stuff like that here. Okay? You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.32,1:43:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么  只有瑞克斯能开玩笑吗\NWhy not? Rickles is the only one who can make jokes?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.27,1:43:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他是老大\NThe man's a boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.47,1:43:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是老大  他是老大\NSo I'm a boss. He's a boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.03,1:43:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们应该是兄弟  对吧\NWe're all supposed to be brothers, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.13,1:43:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你是老大\NI know you're a boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.01,1:43:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道  但我们现在不想吵  对吧\NI know, but we don't wanna have a beef now. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.92,1:43:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们是兄弟  对吧  -没错  兄弟\N- We're brothers, right? - That's right, brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.96,1:43:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们是兄弟吧  -你们是兄弟\N- We're brothers? - You're brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.82,1:43:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们是兄弟  -我不跟你争\N- We're brothers. - I'm not arguing with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.42,1:43:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都是兄弟\NEverybody's a brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.43,1:43:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  你是兄弟  你是他兄弟\NThat's right, you're a brother. You're his brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.47,1:43:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是  但你们是\NI'm not, but you guys are.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.75,1:43:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,所以如果你能给点面子就好了\NSo that's why I would like it if you just...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.08,1:43:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-好  -好吗\N- All right. - Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.00,1:43:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们是兄弟  -对\N- We're brothers? - You're brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.21,1:43:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,对  今天我过生日\NYeah. It's my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.44,1:43:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,生日快乐\NHappy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.28,1:43:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,生日快乐\NHappy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.06,1:43:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧滚吧\NGet the fuck out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.61,1:44:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,要做这种活儿\NNow, for something like this,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.47,1:44:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要两把枪\Nyou're gonna need two guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.24,1:44:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,一把是用的  一把是后备\NThe one you're gonna use and a backup.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.93,1:44:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,要比点22口径的更有威慑力\NYou want something with more stopping power than a .22.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.82,1:44:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不用消音器\NYou definitely don't want a silencer.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.89,1:44:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,要弄出很大响声  吓得目击者逃走\NYou want to make a lot of noise to make the witnesses run away
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.79,1:44:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这样他们就不会看你了\Nso they ain't gonna be looking at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.60,1:44:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但点45口径的响声可不行\NBut not the noise a .45 makes
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.61,1:44:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那样动静就太大了\N'cause that makes too much noise,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.16,1:44:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,几个街区外的巡逻警车都能听到\Nand a patrol car can hear it a few blocks away at least.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.93,1:44:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,警察管点32口径的叫女士枪  因为它比较好控制\NThe cops call a .32 a woman's gun because it's easier to handle
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.77,1:44:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,没有点38口径的破坏力\Nand don't do the damage a .38 does,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.84,1:44:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但是足够了\Nbut, you know, it does enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.98,1:45:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}安贝特蛤蜊餐厅
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.78,1:45:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候是深夜  爱达荷州的游客不会在那儿\NIt would be late, so the tourists from Idaho
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.14,1:45:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他们已经睡觉了\Nwouldn't be there. They'd be in bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.23,1:45:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他在小意大利区\NAnd him being down there in Little Italy,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.45,1:45:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,也许会更自在  更放松\Nmaybe he'd be more comfortable, more relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.73,1:45:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那天是他生日  所以他会带着老婆孩子一起去\NIt was his birthday so he'd be there with his wife
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.79,1:45:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这样正好\Nand his kid which, in this case,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.19,1:45:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这正是我们的目的\Nthat's good because that's the point.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.51,1:45:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,应该让他们亲眼见识\NThey should have to see what it's like.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.38,1:45:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经喝了不少酒\NHe'd already been drinking,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.35,1:45:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这样他会迟缓很多\Nwhich would have slowed him down a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.54,1:45:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他的保镖会跟着他\NHis bodyguard would be with him
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.81,1:45:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,乔伊自己也应该是带着枪的\Nand Joey himself could be carrying, too,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.78,1:45:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但他的枪可能在他老婆的包里\Nbut then the piece would be in his wife's purse probably.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.19,1:45:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,从来不会事先对你透露多少\NYou never got a lot of advance notice.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.54,1:45:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你只知道你到时候要做什么\NAll you knew was your part of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.71,1:45:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,红发约翰只知道\NJohn the Redhead knew only one thing:
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.76,1:45:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他要开车送我过去\Nhe was gonna drop me off,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.70,1:45:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,绕着街区转  然后再接我\Ncircle the block and pick me up.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.42,1:46:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}安贝特蛤蜊餐厅
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.85,1:46:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你得先解决掉保镖\NYou wanna take out the bodyguard first.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.40,1:46:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不是杀他  别杀他  让他失去行动能力就好\NNot kill him. Don't kill him, just disable him.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.97,1:46:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟他无冤无仇\NYou got no argument with him,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.41,1:46:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,所以别照着脸或者胸膛来一枪\Nso, not in the face or the chest.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.49,1:46:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,有时  干这种活儿\NSometimes, with something like this,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.23,1:46:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能想先去趟厕所\Nyou might want to go to the bathroom first.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.38,1:46:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好确定没人跟踪你进来\NIt gives you a chance to make sure nobody followed you in.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.39,1:46:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,也能让你确定\NIt also gives you a chance to make sure
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.80,1:46:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,无需担心厕所里的人\Nnobody is in the bathroom you have to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.00,1:46:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,也给你机会上趟厕所\NIt also gives you a chance to go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.32,1:46:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,干活的时候你不想不舒服\NYou don't want to be uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.76,1:46:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但我之前去过  深夜在这么个小餐厅\NBut I went before, and in a place this small, this late,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.08,1:46:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,直接干活就行了\Nyou might as well just get to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.21,1:46:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,再来点红酒\NWe need more wine, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.87,1:46:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,汤米  再来点红酒\NTommy, some more wine.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.85,1:46:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,之后呢\NSo how about after?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.74,1:46:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-蛋糕  蛋糕  蛋糕  -现在还不行\N- Cake, cake, cake! - Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.99,1:46:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你还没吃完饭呢\NYou're not even done eating the meal yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.37,1:46:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你要蛋糕  得了吧  不能这样\NYou want the cake? Come on, you can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.96,1:46:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,靠\NShit!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.04,1:46:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,操  操\NFuck! Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.48,1:47:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,此事发生在纽约的小意大利区\NIt happened in New York's Little Italy,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.49,1:47:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,传言这里是黑帮的中立地带\Nan area rumored to be neutral territory among mobsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.80,1:47:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}安贝特蛤蜊餐厅
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.81,1:47:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,凶杀之后\NAfter the killing,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.56,1:47:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,警方找到了几把枪以及一些指纹\Npolice found several guns and some fingerprints
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.29,1:47:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,今日正在追查\Nwhich they were tracing today.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.19,1:47:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,"疯子乔"乔瑟夫·加洛\NJoseph "Crazy Joe" Gallo
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.57,1:47:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,晚间来到这家温馨的海鲜餐厅\Nhad come to the intimate seafood restaurant to cap an evening of celebration
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.94,1:47:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,与他结婚不满一个月的妻子\Nwith his new bride of less than a month,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.70,1:47:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,以及与前妻所生的十一岁女儿一起庆祝\Nand his 11-year-old daughter by a previous marriage.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.54,1:47:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在庆祝乔的47岁生日\NThey were, uh, celebrating Joe's 47th birthday.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.57,1:47:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那晚他们先去了一家夜店\NThey had been to a nightclub early in the evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.45,1:48:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他们坐在餐厅后面的一桌  总共六个人\NThey were sitting at a rear table, this group of six people,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.14,1:48:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,然后\Nwhen a, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.28,1:48:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,一个男人从后门进来\Na man walked in from the back door,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.83,1:48:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,直接走到\Nand he walked up, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.33,1:48:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,走到桌子边上  开了三枪\Nto the side of the table. He fired three shots.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.71,1:48:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他打了乔两枪\NHe hit Joe twice
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.39,1:48:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-还打了他的保镖  -佩琪  走吧\N- and he hit his bodyguard... - Peggy, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.39,1:48:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,希腊人皮特一枪\N...Pete the Greek, one time.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.60,1:48:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,一共开了十四枪\NThere was a total of 14 shots fired.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.21,1:48:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,佩琪  走吧\NPeggy, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.85,1:48:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,乔伊·加洛的地盘总统街上\NIt's quiet here on President Street,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.88,1:48:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,非常安静\NJoey Gallo's turf.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.08,1:48:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至有些太安静了\NIn fact, it's too quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.09,1:48:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,在布鲁克林\NOut here in Brooklyn,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.20,1:48:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,乔伊·加洛是个英雄\NJoey Gallo was a hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.65,1:48:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,据猜测  他的死亡或将引发一场帮派战争\NSpeculation has it that his death may start a gang war,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.43,1:48:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,可能已经悄然开始\Nif it hasn't already begun.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.91,1:48:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}普通汽油
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.79,1:48:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}电话亭
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.37,1:49:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-你好好的  吉米  -你也是  麦奇\N- Take it easy, Jimmy. - You too, Mikey.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.67,1:49:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,保重了  吉米\NTake good care, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.28,1:49:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,以防再也不见  问个好\NIf I don't see you again, hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.70,1:49:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,四年后  花了五十万美元\NFour years later and $500,000 under the table
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.15,1:49:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,贿赂尼克松的连任委员会\Nto Nixon's re-election committee,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.11,1:49:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米终于得偿所愿\NJimmy finally got what he wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.17,1:49:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  不过我不会再回来了\NSorry, but I won't be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.76,1:49:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,总统特赦以及假释\NA presidential pardon and his parole.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.87,1:49:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米\NJimmy!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.82,1:49:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在打算做什么  吉米\NWhat are you gonna do now, Jimmy?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.31,1:49:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我要做的第一件事就是\NWell, the first thing I'm gonna do is register
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.33,1:49:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,去联邦缓刑办公室登记\Nwith the Federal Probation Office,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.12,1:49:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,然后就和我妻子一起去佛州晒太阳\Nand then I'm going down to Florida with my wife to get some sun.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.44,1:49:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那之后有什么计划吗\NAny plans after that?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.71,1:49:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我要夺回我工会的控制权\NYeah, I'm gonna take back control of my union.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.46,1:49:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你要怎么做  吉米\NHow're you gonna do that, Jimmy?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.47,1:49:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,菲茨也要竞选  你感觉怎么样\NHow do you like Fitz running against you?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.30,1:49:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不好\NI don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.93,1:49:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米  被关这么久是什么感觉\NJimmy, what was it like being locked up all that time?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.19,1:49:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,非常好  我很开心\NIt was wonderful. Had a great time.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.57,1:49:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}卢姆餐厅
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.44,1:49:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我做的第一件事就是\NThe first thing I did was,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.65,1:50:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,去卢姆餐厅买了几个辣味热狗\NI picked up some chili dogs from Lum's,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.63,1:50:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米爱热狗就像爱冰激淋\Nwhich Jimmy loved almost as much as ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.01,1:50:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,理查德·尼克松总统\NA consultant to President
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.33,1:50:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,连任竞选委员会的一名顾问\NRichard Nixon's re-election campaign committee...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.28,1:50:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的秘诀就是用啤酒蒸香肠\NThe secret is they steam them in beer.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.60,1:50:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这是全美最好吃的热狗\NThere ain't a better hot dog in America.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.70,1:50:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,警方称麦考德和他的同谋\NPolice say McCord and his accomplices
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.85,1:50:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,随身带了电子监听设备\Nbrought electronic listening devices with them
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.27,1:50:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,还卸下了两块天花板\Nand had removed two ceiling panels...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.89,1:50:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}卢姆餐厅
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.05,1:50:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,以便在民主党全国委员会\N...while installing eavesdropping equipment
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.27,1:50:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,安装窃听设备\Nat the Democratic National Committee.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.41,1:50:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}卡车司机工会
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.00,1:50:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你看看  他还真有胆子竞选工会主席\NLook at this. He's got the balls to run for President of the Teamsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.03,1:50:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你看看  托尼·普罗还给他颁奖了\NLook at this. And Tony Pro giving him an award.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.73,1:50:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这混蛋  你信吗\NThis fuck... Do you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.43,1:50:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}卡车司机工会
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.33,1:50:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,菲茨很受特定人群的欢迎\NLook, Fitz is very popular with certain people.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.11,1:50:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}卡车司机工会
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.26,1:50:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他当然受欢迎  能不受欢迎吗\NOf course he's popular. Who wouldn't be popular?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.10,1:50:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个弟兄问他借钱他都给\NHe loans money to every goombah who asks.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.81,1:50:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,所以托尼支持他  他把选票都给菲茨了\NThat's why Tony's behind him. He's given Fitz all his votes.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.95,1:50:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你受工会大多数人的支持\NYou got great support from most of the union.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.16,1:50:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你只需要托尼·普罗\NAll you need is Tony Pro's
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.61,1:50:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,在东北部的选民  你就能赢\Nvoters in the Northeast, and you can win.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.46,1:50:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-你真不要吃一个吗  -不了  谢谢\N- You sure you don't want one of these? - No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.58,1:50:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是不敢相信我要去找托尼·普罗要选票\NI just can't believe I gotta go to Tony Pro to get votes.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.65,1:50:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这都什么跟什么\NWhat is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.73,1:50:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼牢牢控制着菲茨  吉米\NTony has Fitz in his pocket, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.01,1:51:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,工会不受黑帮控制\NWise guys don't run the union.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.57,1:51:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,有菲茨就行\NWith Fitz, they do.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.00,1:51:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米  等你重新当上主席\NJimmy, listen, as soon as you're back as president,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.47,1:51:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你想做什么就做什么\Nyou can do anything you want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.59,1:51:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你想解雇谁就解雇谁\NYou can fire anybody you want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.44,1:51:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你把托尼·普罗解雇了都行\NYou can even fire Tony Pro.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.15,1:51:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以盯着他  让他清空桌子\NYou could stand over him, watch him clear out his desk.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.79,1:51:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,还可以让他脱光  搜他的身\NYou could strip-search the guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.39,1:51:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,确保他走的时候连个回形针都带不走\NMake sure he doesn't walk off with a paper clip.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.77,1:51:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,对  听见没  你听见没\NYes. See that? Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.26,1:51:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都以为乔是白脸\NSee, everybody thinks Jo's the nice one
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.03,1:51:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我是黑脸\Nand I'm the bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.60,1:51:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但其实是反过来\NBut it's opposite.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.78,1:51:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,她是大灰狼  我是小绵羊\NShe's the killer and I'm the sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.88,1:51:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我要去和狗杂种讲和了\NNow I gotta make peace with the cocksucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.66,1:51:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我想和你重归于好\NI want to make up with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.79,1:51:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你支持我  拜托了  托尼\NI need you to endorse me. Please, Tony.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.91,1:51:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了\NPlease.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.29,1:51:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\NFucking...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.59,1:51:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这事我做不来\NI'm not gonna get through this.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.77,1:51:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟他谈谈就可以了\NYou gotta talk to him, that's all. Just...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.16,1:51:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你得处理好\NYou gotta deal with it, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.05,1:51:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}顺其自然吧\NLet the chips fall where they may.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.19,1:51:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不过他真是个狗杂种\NHe is a cocksucker, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.08,1:51:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我坐下和他谈  你一起来吗\NIf I sat down with him, would you come along?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.20,1:51:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么呢  当然了\NWhat are you talking about? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.81,1:51:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么会不跟你去\NHow am I not gonna go with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.75,1:52:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的  走吧\NFuck it. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.79,1:52:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米  吉米  给个机会\NJimmy, Jimmy. Give it a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.68,1:52:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,给个机会  再等几分钟\NGive it a chance. Give it a few more minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.78,1:52:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-就  -这样不行\N- Just... - This isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.11,1:52:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不行  怎么能这样\NThis isn't right. You don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.21,1:52:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么能让人干等\NYou don't keep a man waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.23,1:52:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道  我知道\NI know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.70,1:52:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真要让人等\NThe only time you do
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.69,1:52:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,就代表你有话要说\Nis when you want to say something.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.00,1:52:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-我知道  -你想说"去死"\N- I know. - When you want to say "Fuck you."
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.57,1:52:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,只有这种解释\NThat's the only time.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.24,1:52:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,来了\NHere they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.91,1:52:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你能相信这天气吗  弗兰克\NCan you believe this weather, Frank? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.28,1:52:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,外面快三十度了  真好\NIt's 85 degrees outside. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.74,1:52:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我是托尼·杰克\NTony Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.49,1:52:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我是吉米\NJimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.23,1:52:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,纽约的人都要冻死了  看看我们\NPeople freezing to death in New York and look at us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.96,1:52:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我就想知道  我们干嘛不一直住在这里\NWhy we don't live here all year round is what I wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.88,1:52:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了\NBeautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.31,1:52:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-这是夏天  -什么\N- It's summer. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.12,1:52:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这是夏天\NIt's summer.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.33,1:53:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,纽约的人没要冻死\NPeople aren't freezing to death in New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.77,1:53:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是夏天\NIt's summer.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.56,1:53:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,在我心里  纽约一直零下十三度\NIn my mind, it's always eight degrees in New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.54,1:53:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我就想表个态\NI'm making a point.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.34,1:53:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你想表个态\NYou're making a point.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.16,1:53:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,穿成这样表态\NMaking a point dressing like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.51,1:53:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你开会就穿成这样吗\NIs that how you dress for a meeting?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.56,1:53:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你在佛州就穿成这样吗  穿西装\NThis is how you dress in Florida? In a suit?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.96,1:53:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,去开会吗\NFor a meeting?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.00,1:53:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,别说佛州  不管在什么鬼地方\NAnywhere. Florida, Timbuktu, I dress in a suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.60,1:53:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我开会都穿西装\NFor a meetin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.59,1:53:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-而且你迟到了  -什么\N- And you're late. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.33,1:53:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你迟到了\NYou're late.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.50,1:53:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  路上堵车\NYeah, there was traffic.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.85,1:53:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  堵车\NYes, traffic.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.81,1:53:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是堵车了\NWasn't there traffic?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.69,1:53:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-来堵车这一套  -的确堵车\N- You give me traffic? - There was traffic.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.33,1:53:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要我们怎么办\NWhat do you want from us?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.84,1:53:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,保险杠都抵着保险杠了\NIt was bumper to fuckin' bumper.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.69,1:53:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  堵车确实严重\NYeah, yeah. No, it's bad, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.77,1:53:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,堵车\NTraffic.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.67,1:53:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我这辈子从来没有\NI never waited for anyone who was late
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.36,1:53:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,等人超过十分钟\Nmore than ten minutes in my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.35,1:53:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,十五分钟吧  比较合适\NI'd say fifteen. Fifteen's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.35,1:53:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不  十分钟\NNo, ten.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.69,1:53:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得不行  十分钟不够\NI don't think so, ten's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.60,1:54:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你得算上堵车的时间\NYou have to take traffic into account.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.12,1:54:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我算了  堵车的时间算进去了\NThat's what I'm doing. I'm taking traffic into account.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.94,1:54:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,所以给了十分钟\NThat's why it's ten.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.11,1:54:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-我还是坚持十五分钟  -十分钟\N- I still say 15. - No, ten.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.07,1:54:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,行吧  这点我们保留意见\NFine. We disagree on that.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.20,1:54:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,要不就十二分半\NHow about twelve and a half minutes?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.08,1:54:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了  十二分半\NThere we go, 12.5.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.29,1:54:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,中间值  正中间  太好了\NThe middle. Right in the middle. Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.81,1:54:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,超过十分钟\NMore than ten...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.23,1:54:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是有话要说了\Nyou're saying something.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.76,1:54:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-你有话要对我说吗  -我来了\N- You saying something to me? - I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.10,1:54:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,就这个意思\NIt says what it says.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.92,1:54:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那就这样吧\NSo there it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.14,1:54:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来怎么谈\NWhere do we go from here?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.15,1:54:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我能为你做什么\NWell, what can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.91,1:54:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你\NI want you...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.34,1:54:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我\NI...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.55,1:54:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你支持我\NI want you to endorse me...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.25,1:54:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,支持什么你也清楚\Nfor you know what.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.99,1:54:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,在我们谈那个之前  先把另一件事讲清楚\NBefore we get to that, let's straighten that other thing up.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.83,1:54:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不  另一件事与我无关\NNo. The other thing is none of my business.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.06,1:54:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你的养老金我做不了主\NI can't do anything about your pension.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.46,1:55:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不行  菲茨在就不行  菲茨是主席\NI can't. Not with Fitz in there. Fitz is in there, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.04,1:55:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-你去找菲茨  -找了\N- You go to Fitz. - I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.43,1:55:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-他会帮你  -我找了\N- He'll help you out. - I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.56,1:55:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他说会帮我解决  没问题\NHe said he'll take care of it, no questions asked.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.05,1:55:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你不愿意  但是他愿意\NYou wouldn't do that but he will.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.71,1:55:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说另一件事\NI meant the other thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.15,1:55:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,哪件事\NWhat other thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.52,1:55:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你很清楚\NYou know.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.65,1:55:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我不清楚\NI don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.08,1:55:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你要道歉\NYour apology.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:20.51,1:55:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我要道歉\NMy apology?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:23.29,1:55:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我道什么歉\NMy apology for what?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.67,1:55:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那时你像个国王一样\NFor what you said when you were sitting there
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.34,1:55:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,吃着冰激淋说出的话\Neating your ice cream like some fucking king.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.81,1:55:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那可是种族污蔑  "你们这些人"\NThat was an ethnic slur. "You people."
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.07,1:55:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-你知道他说了什么吗  -不  我听说\N- Did you know what he said? - Nah, I mean, I heard...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.10,1:55:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说你们在牢里吵了一架  但我不清楚\NI heard you had an altercation in the can, but I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.49,1:55:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,对  "你们这些人"\NYeah, "You people."
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.43,1:55:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你就这么说的  对吧  吉米\NThat's what you said. Right, Jim?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.76,1:55:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,"你们这些人"  我是不如你吗\N"You people." Am I beneath you?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.04,1:55:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,一点没错\NDefinitely.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.41,1:55:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-吉米  别这样  -吉米  你干嘛\N- Jimmy, come on. - Jimmy, what're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.02,1:55:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了  你今天的地位全靠"我们这些人"\NDon't forget, "You people" got you where you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.54,1:55:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别  别跟我说这种话  你个狗东...\NDon't...don't tell me that, you fucking...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.79,1:55:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是你的问题所在  吉米\NThat's your problem, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.59,1:55:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你的问题在于你是个人渣\NYour problem is you're a piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.79,1:55:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米  拜托\NJimmy, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.74,1:56:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-吉米  你在干什么  -天呐  吉米  别这样\N- Jimmy, what are you doin'? - Jesus, Jimmy, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.84,1:56:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫你支持我  你却跟我说这么多废话\NI asked for your endorsement and you're giving me all this crap.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.99,1:56:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫你向我道歉\NI asked for your apology.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.32,1:56:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈算老几  我为什么要向你道歉\NWho the fuck are you to apologize to?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.18,1:56:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米\NJimmy...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.87,1:56:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈算老几啊\NWho the fuck are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.82,1:56:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,和气点\NBe gentle.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.32,1:56:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-我不需要跟你谈  -坐下吧  托尼\N- I don't need this. - Let's just sit down. Tony.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.23,1:56:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我就需要吗  难道我需要你\NI need this? I need you?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.29,1:56:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-没错  你需要我  -得了吧\N- Yeah, you need me. - Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.80,1:56:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米  拜托  你对他有所求\NJimmy, come on. You're asking him for something.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.69,1:56:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙让我紧张  他总是说些让我生气的话\NThe guy gets me nervous. He talks about things that get me upset.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.79,1:56:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-冷静点  -既然大家都来了\N- Take it easy. - Everybody's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.48,1:56:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就赶紧开会吧  来吧\NLet's have the fucking meeting. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.19,1:56:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们好好谈谈  -仅此而已\N- Let's talk. - That's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.93,1:56:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他人来了\NHe's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.46,1:56:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在牢里吵的就是这个吗\NWas this the altercation youse had in the can?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.51,1:56:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  跟这差不多吧\NYeah, it was something like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.66,1:56:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们  我们最后打了起来\NWe... We got to arm wrestling.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.73,1:56:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他输了\NHe lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.77,1:56:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,有脸说我输了  你该瞧瞧他的肋骨\NI lost. You should see his ribs.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.38,1:56:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你们还是谈正事吧  别扯其他的\NWhy don't you just talk about what you need to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.33,1:56:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-没错  -就是啊\N- That's right. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.22,1:56:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你希望我怎么做\NWhat do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.18,1:56:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我的确说了"你们这些人"\NI said, "You people."
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.06,1:56:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你希望我怎么做  为此道歉吗\NWhat do you want me to do, apologize for it?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.97,1:56:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那正是我想要的  吉米  一句道歉\NThat's exactly what I want, Jimmy. An apology.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.68,1:56:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就为此道歉\NI'll apologize for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.64,1:56:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我也别无他求\NThat's all I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.41,1:57:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,前提是你先为这次迟到道歉\NAfter you apologize for being late,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.67,1:57:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你个狗娘养的外国佬\Nyou motherfucking wop cocksucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.34,1:57:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米  你他妈是疯了吗\NJimmy, are you out of your fucking mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.18,1:57:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以为迟到道歉\NI'll apologize for being late
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.28,1:57:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但我会先绑架你孙女  把她的内脏挖出来\Nafter I kidnap your granddaughter, rip her guts out,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.93,1:57:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,然后装在信封里寄给你\Nand send them to you in a fucking envelope!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.89,1:57:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,把他拉开  快\NGet him off! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.11,1:57:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了他\NI'll fucking kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.73,1:57:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-别打了  托尼  -天呐\N- Come on, Tony! - Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.05,1:57:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得罗素...\NYou think Russ would...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.79,1:57:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,会不会解决掉那家伙\Nwould do something about this guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.68,1:57:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那很复杂\NThat's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.16,1:57:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  的确很复杂\NYeah. It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.48,1:57:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒是想亲手宰了那个狗东西\NI'd like to clip the motherfucker myself, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.80,1:57:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-获得他们的同意  但是...  -我懂\N- Get the okay from them. But... - I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.42,1:57:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,必须除掉这家伙\NThis guy's gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.44,1:57:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,必须除掉他  弗兰克\NHe's gotta go, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:46.16,1:57:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不可能同意我这么做的\NI'm not gonna get the okay to do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.62,1:57:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克  跟那家伙谈谈\NFrank, just talk to the guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.96,1:57:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗  找他好好谈谈\NOkay? Just talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.26,1:57:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}纽约  东哈莱姆区\N第115大街
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.24,1:58:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,泽西的那些家伙不停给我打电话\NThese guys from Jersey keep fucking calling me
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.31,1:58:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我说这两人之间的矛盾\Nabout this bullshit between these two guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.38,1:58:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我把我对他们说的话再跟你们说一遍\NI'm gonna tell you the same thing I told them.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.27,1:58:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我不认同普罗针对吉米说的那些话\NI don't approve of what Pro said about Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.59,1:58:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.22,1:58:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,谁会那样去威胁别人的孙辈啊\NI mean, who talks like that about a person's grandchildren?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.37,1:58:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-那是不对的  -是啊\N- It's not fucking right. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.13,1:58:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}托尼·萨雷诺  绰号"胖子托尼"\N被判一百年徒刑\N1992年死于狱中  享年80岁
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.27,1:58:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但普罗也不是无名小卒\NBut Pro isn't nobody.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.87,1:58:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米应该明白这点的\NJimmy should know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.65,1:58:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我能怎么办\NWhat am I gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.60,1:58:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我又没办法告诫那家伙能说什么  不能说什么\NI'm not gonna tell this guy what he can or can't fucking say,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.41,1:58:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,把他当小孩管教\Nlike he's a child.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.86,1:58:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\NWell, listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:33.04,1:58:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米其实没什么恶意  他只是很生气\NJimmy don't mean nothing. He just gets upset.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:35.15,1:58:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素  拜托  我们都知道他暴躁易怒\NRuss, come on, we all know he's a fucking hothead.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.10,1:58:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都曾有过暴躁易怒的时候\NWe're all hotheads once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.45,1:58:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是没错  但吉米有时会说些不该说的话\NYeah, but Jimmy says things he shouldn't say sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.62,1:58:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是  我们有时也都会那样\NYeah. We all do that too.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.30,1:58:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,该有人让他冷静下来\NWell, somebody should just calm him down.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.10,1:58:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  我会...\NYeah, well, that... I'm gonna...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.68,1:58:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让他冷静下来的  他很不好搞  但...\NI'm gonna calm him down. He's difficult, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.92,1:58:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,或许这能帮他冷静下来\NMaybe this could help him calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.62,1:58:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以告诉他  我向来都很喜欢他\NYou could tell him that I always liked him.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.66,1:59:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,并且我不会阻拦他夺回他的职位\NAnd I won't stand in his way of him trying to get his job back.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.89,1:59:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我会的  我会告诉他这点的  托尼\NI will. I will tell him that, Tony.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.92,1:59:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-好吗  -好的\N- Okay? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:04.35,1:59:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那可无法让我冷静下来\NThat's not making me calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.62,1:59:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,站我这边\NStanding by me.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:08.50,1:59:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那他妈是什么意思\NWhat the fuck does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.54,1:59:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,站我这边跟采取措施\NStanding by me ain't the same thing as doing something
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.07,1:59:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,处理一个失控的疯子  可不是一回事\Nabout some out-of-control fucking psycho!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.15,1:59:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米  矮子可不是无名小卒\NJimmy, the Little Guy ain't a nobody.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.16,1:59:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须明白这点\NYou gotta understand that.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.36,1:59:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-他可不是无名小卒  -他是个龟孙\N- He ain't a nobody. - He's a cocksucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.89,1:59:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,菲茨也是个龟孙\NFitz is a cocksucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.62,1:59:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把这些龟孙全都解决掉\NI'm gonna deal with both these cocksuckers...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.10,1:59:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲自动手\Nmyself!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:30.08,1:59:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这里以前是我的办公室\NThis used to be my office.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.25,1:59:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,进去找弗兰克·菲茨西蒙斯吧  你们是找不到他的\NGo look for Frank Fitzsimmons there. You're not gonna find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.72,1:59:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}国际卡车司机工会
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.62,1:59:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他在全国各地旅游\NThat's because he travels all over the country
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.17,1:59:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,寻找好的高尔夫球场  他就只会干这个\Nlooking for goddamn golf courses because that's what he does.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.51,1:59:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他喜欢打高尔夫\NHe plays golf.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.84,1:59:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他算老几  能跟在尼克松身边\NWho is he to run around with Nixon,
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.74,1:59:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,跟在司法部长身边\Nrun around with the attorney general?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.57,1:59:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他整天就知道打高尔夫  还能领全额薪水\NHe does this and collects full-time salary while he's doing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.98,1:59:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那是怎么做到的\NNow, how do you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.30,1:59:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这份工作  一天24小时都不够忙活的\NThere's not enough hours in a day to do this job.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.34,1:59:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我因为欺诈罪被判刑入狱\NI was sent to prison for fraud.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.35,1:59:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他的所为  才叫欺诈呢\NThis is fraud, what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.91,2:00:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那么菲茨对吉米的回应是怎样的呢\NSo what's Fitz's answer to Jimmy?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.27,2:00:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他给吉米的老朋友\NHe does it by sending a message
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.89,2:00:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,戴夫·约翰逊传达了一条信息\Nto Jimmy's old friend, Dave Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.48,2:00:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,戴夫·约翰逊  他是299号地方工会的主席\NNow, Dave Johnson, he ran Local 299.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.46,2:00:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,信息是这样的\NThis was the message.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.36,2:00:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,菲茨就是以这种方式表明\NSo this is how Fitz says
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.77,2:00:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他希望我的老朋友戴夫·约翰逊退位\Nhe wants my old pal Dave Johnson to step down
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.08,2:00:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好让他的儿子接管299号地方工会\Nso he can have his son take over Local 299.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.13,2:00:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我打算用接下来的方式拒绝他儿子小菲茨\NThis is how I'm gonna say no to his son, little fucking Fitz.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.69,2:00:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,她长得很像你妈\NShe looked a lot like your mother.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.94,2:00:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,体型都差不多\NAbout the same size.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.96,2:00:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,爸  拜托  你都说了上千遍了\NPops, come on, you told me like a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:37.81,2:00:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,长得漂亮  她长得很漂亮\NGood-looking girl. She was a good-looking girl.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.24,2:00:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但我当时真不知道那不是你妈\NBut I had no idea that it wasn't your mother.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.97,2:00:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,当时那里很暗...\NIt was dark and...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.97,2:00:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}霍法
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.25,2:00:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}约·霍法\N运输部  女助理
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.86,2:00:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来菲茨用这种方式表明他不喜欢\NThis is how Fitz says he doesn't like
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.36,2:00:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我选定的299号工会负责人\Nwho I say runs the 299.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.43,2:00:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他开除了我老婆\NBy firing my wife
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.67,2:01:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,让她失去了年薪4.8万美元的工会工作\Nfrom her forty-eight-fucking-thousand- dollar-a-year union job!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.67,2:01:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}卡车司机299号地方工会
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.54,2:01:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,狗娘养的  他去死吧\NSon of a bitch. Fuck him!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.13,2:01:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他事先在水门大厦\NHe had previously taped the locks
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.59,2:01:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,大门的锁上贴了个胶带\Non the entry door of the basement of the Watergate...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:54.39,2:01:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-你在看什么  -就...\N- What are you looking at? - Uh, it's...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.08,2:01:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是大耳朵\NIt's Big Ears.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.61,2:02:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}小埃弗雷特·霍华德·亨特\N前中情局探员
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.68,2:02:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他注意到那个胶带被人撕掉了\NHe had noticed that the tape had been removed,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.47,2:02:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,于是他又重新贴了胶带\Nand he re-taped the door.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.68,2:02:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,大耳朵\NBig Ears?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.12,2:02:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那是...\NThat's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.26,2:02:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我很多年前认识的一个人\NSomebody I met a long time ago. Just...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.54,2:02:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他的耳朵也没那么大啊\NHis ears ain't so big.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.65,2:02:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那个时候  我就说  "收工吧"\N...at that point, I said "Let us junk it,"
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.82,2:02:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是放弃行动\Nmeaning let us scrap the operation.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.85,2:02:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,利迪先生和麦考德先生私下谈了谈\NMr. Liddy and Mr. McCord talked between themselves
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.74,2:02:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就做出了决定  继续行动\Nand the decision was made to go.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.80,2:02:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时觉得这很鲁莽...\NI thought it was very foolhardy...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.18,2:02:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那么  在你看来  弗兰克·菲茨西蒙斯\NSo, Frank Fitzsimmons, in your opinion,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.90,2:02:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}媒体见面会  直播
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.96,2:02:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,应该继续担任卡车司机工会的主席吗\Nshould he remain president of the Teamsters?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.45,2:02:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不能\NAbsolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.33,2:02:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}詹姆斯·霍法
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.66,2:02:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克·菲茨西蒙斯已经将他的工会\NFrank Fitzsimmons has sold his union out
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.47,2:02:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,卖给了他的黑社会朋友\Nto his underworld pals.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.45,2:02:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,黑帮控制着他\NThe mob controls him,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.18,2:02:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那意味着他们也控制着我们的养老金\Nwhich means it controls our pension fund.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.67,2:02:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的是上十亿美元的低息或无息贷款\NI'm talking about a billion dollars in low or no-interest loans
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.59,2:02:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,都被他借给了已知的黑帮分子\Nthis man has given to known racketeers
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.34,2:02:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,用到他们非法勾当中\Nfor their illegal enterprises.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.08,2:02:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,再也不可能了\NNot anymore.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.29,2:02:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,船将沉  老鼠该弃船而逃了\NIt's time for the rats to abandon ship.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.80,2:02:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他是认真的吗\NIs he serious?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.41,2:02:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米才不是认真的  这都是宣传手段\NNot Jimmy. This is all publicity.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.58,2:03:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他在竞选公职  只是做做样子罢了\NHe's running for office. He's putting on a show.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.68,2:03:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  都是空口号  没有实质\NYeah, it's all puff. It's got no substance, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.44,2:03:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,或许他就是认真的\NMaybe he means what he says.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.58,2:03:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-托尼  他在竞选  -罗素\N- Tony, he's campaigning. - Russ.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.08,2:03:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他可以信口开河\NHe's liable to say any fucking thing.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:09.76,2:03:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不管他是不是在竞选\NI don't care if he's campaigning.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.55,2:03:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他不能说这种话\NHe can't talk like that.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.02,2:03:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那可不好\NIt's no fucking good.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.39,2:03:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白你的意思\NI understand what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:15.45,2:03:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他该做什么吗  罗素\NYou know what he should do, Russ?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.54,2:03:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他应该将他那一大笔养老金提现\NHe should cash in that big pension of his.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.89,2:03:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,多陪陪他的孙辈们\NSpend more time with his grandchildren.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.86,2:03:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他有幸福美满的家庭  不是吗\NHe got a beautiful family, no?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.36,2:03:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  是啊  没错\NYeah. Yeah, yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:26.63,2:03:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,或许他应该放轻松\NMaybe he should relax.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:30.05,2:03:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,该让人给他传个话\NWord should get back to him.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.27,2:03:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我  我只想说\NI... I just wanna say...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.75,2:03:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我不希望你误会我接下来的话\NI don't want you to take this the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:40.59,2:03:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但我之前跟一些人在一起\NBut there I was with some people
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.86,2:03:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你也知道是哪些人  他们说...\Nand they were saying, and you know who they are...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.80,2:03:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说...\NThey were saying...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:46.49,2:03:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"请转告吉米我们爱他\N"Please tell Jimmy we love the guy.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.48,2:03:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们并不想惹麻烦\NWe don't want any problem.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.10,2:03:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是认为他应该...\NWe just think that he should...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:54.90,2:03:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,享受陪伴孙辈的日子\Nmaybe enjoy his grandchildren,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.83,2:03:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,享受养老金  享受目前的生活"\Nenjoy his pension, enjoy his life as is."
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.29,2:04:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不用再说了  弗兰克\NGo no further, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.92,2:04:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁说的\NWho said it?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.28,2:04:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-是谁说的并不重要  -当然重要\N- It don't matter who said it. - Oh, it matters.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:08.02,2:04:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-是罗素吗  -不是\N- Was it Russell? - No.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.88,2:04:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,当然不是罗素\NOf course it's not Russell.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:11.22,2:04:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是迈阿密那事儿的那个龟孙吗\NIt's that little cocksucker from the Miami fiasco?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.79,2:04:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-不是吗  -不是\N- No? - No.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:15.96,2:04:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不是他吗  真不是吗\NNot him. No?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.80,2:04:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那是谁\NThen who?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.40,2:04:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是告诉你吧\NI'm gonna tell you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.88,2:04:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是托尼\NTony.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:24.60,2:04:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼\NTony?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.79,2:04:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个托尼\NWhich Tony?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.12,2:04:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那么多人叫托尼\NThey're all named Tony.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:29.18,2:04:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,意大利人是怎么回事\NI mean, what's the matter with Italians?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.52,2:04:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他们难道没别的名字取了吗\NThey can only think of one name.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:34.62,2:04:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,另一个托尼\NThe other Tony.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.61,2:04:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个\NWhat Tony?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:41.55,2:04:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,萨雷诺\NSalerno.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.39,2:04:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我能说什么呢\NWell, what can I say?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.02,2:04:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米  我这是在帮你\NJimmy, I'm trying to help you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:56.28,2:04:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-让你明白一些事  -我知道\N- I'm trying to tell you something. - I know you are.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.94,2:05:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克  想都别想\NFrank, don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.83,2:05:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我向来是有话直说\NI don't keep my mouth shut...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.41,2:05:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-我知道  -对谁都是如此\N- I know that. - ...for anyone.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:04.87,2:05:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我知你知  但他们不知道\NI know that, you know that, they don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.10,2:05:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我的为人本性  我也不会做出任何改变\NThat's who I am, that's what I am and that's what I'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.27,2:05:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,可以找人转告他了\NSomebody can tell him that.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.89,2:05:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他这么说了\NHe said that?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.00,2:05:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我只说了个大概  你懂的\NIn so many words, you know.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:20.67,2:05:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那他在口出狂言之前\NWell, before he says something like that,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:22.34,2:05:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,就应该想到乔·加洛\Nhe should remember that Joe Gallo liked to make
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.10,2:05:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,也是老管不住自己的嘴巴\Na lot of fucking noise, too.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.81,2:05:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,找个人转告他吧\NSomebody should tell him that.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.44,2:05:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,又是谁说的\NWho said?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:30.23,2:05:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-托尼  -他说的\N- Tony. - He said that?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.31,2:05:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,行了  我决定了\NThat's it. That does it.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:35.56,2:05:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我到死都不会退休\NI'm never gonna retire now.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.56,2:05:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,找个人转告他吧\NSomebody can tell him that.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:39.77,2:05:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米  我跟他说了  说了不知道多少遍\NJimmy, I did tell him. I told him over and over.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.02,2:05:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那这样  你跟他说别再传来传去了\NAll right, you told him. Let's stop this, then.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:43.93,2:05:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,算了吧  不谈了\NForget it. Enough.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.48,2:05:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,让我好好享用我的冰淇淋\NLet me enjoy my ice cream here.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.81,2:05:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\NWhat's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.44,2:05:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\NNothing.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.10,2:05:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,说啊\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.77,2:05:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-真没事  -怎么可能没事\N- Nothing. - What do you mean, nothing?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.02,2:06:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你想说什么  告诉我\NCome on, you're thinking something. What?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.31,2:06:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是...\NI just...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:04.31,2:06:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了  说啊  别扭扭捏捏的\NWhat? Come on. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:05.69,2:06:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-现在说不太合适  -你什么意思\N- It ain't the right time. - What do you mean it ain't the right time?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.15,2:06:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就很合适  什么时候说都合适\NIt is the right time. What isn't the right time?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.90,2:06:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,快说\NSay it.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.23,2:06:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,地方工会正在筹备一场\NThe Local's putting together
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.02,2:06:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,给我的答谢晚宴\Na testimonial dinner for me and...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:17.27,2:06:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,给你的答谢晚宴  那很好啊\NA testimonial dinner for you, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.40,2:06:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  不过之后有...\NYeah. But later... Later, when...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.27,2:06:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你想说什么\NWhat's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:27.90,2:06:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我打算问你愿不愿意\NI was gonna ask you if you would...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:30.23,2:06:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,为我颁奖\Npresent the award to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:33.35,2:06:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛\NWell...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:35.19,2:06:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,有心了  弗兰克\NThat's nice of you, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:36.85,2:06:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,真的  你能想起我真好\NReally. That's nice of you. And, you know...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:39.65,2:06:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,还有谁会参加\NWho's gonna be there?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.98,2:06:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,都会来\NEverybody.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:43.01,2:06:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是一大群叫托尼的吗\NTony, Tony, Tony, Tony, and Tony, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.15,2:06:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,下城的都会来\NEverybody from Downtown.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.69,2:06:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,算了  还是不太好  到时候所有人都会来\NNah. Nah, it ain't a good idea. Everybody's gonna be there.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:54.06,2:06:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你会不自在的\NPeople... You're gonna be uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.69,2:07:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不管谁去谁不去\NI don't give a fuck who's there.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:00.19,2:07:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,难道那群狗杂种在\NWe gonna let those cocksuckers
Dialogue: 0,2:07:01.48,2:07:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我就不能出席你的重大晚宴了吗  休想\Nkeep me from your big night? There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.02,2:07:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.31,2:07:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我会去的  而且是我荣幸之至\NI'm gonna be there. And I'll be honored to be there.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:09.90,2:07:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你当之无愧\NYou deserve this.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.27,2:07:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-谢谢你  吉米  -没事\N- Thank you, Jimmy. Thank you. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:16.43,2:07:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-看那个内奸迪恩  -是啊\N- That mole Dean. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.43,2:07:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-这婆娘挺漂亮  -确实\N- She's a good-looking broad. - She's nice.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:21.40,2:07:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,直到六月份\NI did not realize
Dialogue: 0,2:07:22.56,2:07:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我才知道霍华德·亨特先生\Nthat Mr. Howard Hunt worked most of the time
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.73,2:07:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,在白宫的大部分时间\Nwhile he was at the White House
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.85,2:07:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}前白宫法律顾问\N约翰·W·迪恩三世
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.98,2:07:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,都是在管工部门工作\Nin the plumbers unit until after June...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:27.98,2:07:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是个叛徒  不过...\NHe's a rat, but that's, you know...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:29.65,2:07:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,确实是  但他是个精明的叛徒\NHe's a rat. But he's a smart rat.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.52,2:07:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}拉丁赌场  剧院  餐厅
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.73,2:07:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚这么多人都是来给弗兰克捧场的吧\NWe've got a great crowd for Frank tonight, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.27,2:07:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}弗兰克·希兰\N答谢晚宴\N1973年10月18日
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.80,2:07:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,给他来点掌声\NCome on. Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:41.94,2:07:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这是因为弗兰克广结好友\NThat's because Frank is a man with a lot of friends.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.48,2:07:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,有在乔治·巴顿将军的带领下\NFrom his war buddies who fought with him in Italy
Dialogue: 0,2:07:51.02,2:07:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,与他在意大利并肩作战的战友\Nunder General George Patton...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.02,2:07:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,还有司机  全国工会组织者\Nto the drivers, national organizers,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:58.15,2:08:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}屋顶工工会主席\N约翰·麦卡洛\N1980年在自家厨房头中六枪身亡
Dialogue: 0,2:07:58.19,2:08:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,代理商  地方工会主席\Nbusiness agents, local presidents,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:01.06,2:08:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,联合委员会主席  以及区域受托人等等\Njoint committee chairmen, and regional trustees,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:04.85,2:08:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚到场的都是弗兰克的好友\Nwe are all friends of Frank's tonight.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.15,2:08:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克的好友\NFriends of Frank.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:12.56,2:08:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,比如全国有色人种协进会主席塞西尔·摩尔\NLike NAACP president Cecil Moore.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:16.73,2:08:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,地方检察官艾米特·菲茨帕特里克\NDistrict Attorney Emmett Fitzpatrick.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.23,2:08:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,费城市长弗兰克·里佐\NPhiladelphia mayor Frank Rizzo.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.60,2:08:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都喜欢你呢  弗兰克\NHey, they like you, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:26.48,2:08:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,当然  还有我们的特邀发言人\NAnd, of course, our featured speaker,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.85,2:08:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·里德尔·霍法\NJames Riddell Hoffa.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:38.02,2:08:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,同时呢  在外面的树上\NAnd meanwhile, outside in the trees,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:40.69,2:08:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,还藏着联调局的人\Nwe got the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.81,2:08:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有谁要去看看吗\NSomebody wanna check on them?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.94,2:08:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我来分享一下我第一次见到弗兰克时的场景吧\NNow, let me tell you about the first time I met Frank.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:49.10,2:08:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他带我去吃牛排晚餐\NHe took me out to a steak dinner,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.23,2:08:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他问我说  "你的牛排要几分熟"\Nand he asked me, he said, "How do you like your steak?"
Dialogue: 0,2:08:53.31,2:08:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我说"我喜欢一分熟"  他说"我也是"\NI said, "I like it rare." He said, "Me too."
Dialogue: 0,2:08:55.06,2:08:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,然后就开始上牛排了  我的是一分熟\NWell, they bring out the steaks. Mine's rare.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.60,2:08:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克的那份正从厨房里走出来\NFrank's was still walking from the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:01.56,2:09:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他转身对我说  "其实吧\NHe turns to me, he said, "Well, you know,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.48,2:09:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢动物  我不想杀生"\NI'm an animal lover. I don't wanna hurt it."
Dialogue: 0,2:09:07.65,2:09:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他居然喜欢动物\NHe's an animal lover.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:33.06,2:09:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙连主席都没当上\NThis guy is not even the goddamn president
Dialogue: 0,2:09:35.15,2:09:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就在拖延别人的贷款了\Nand he's holding up people's loans.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.98,2:09:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-你确定吗  -我确定\N- Are you sure? - I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.35,2:09:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他是怎么办到的\NAnd how's he supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:41.35,2:09:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他的手下拖延了\NBecause his guys are holding 'em back loans
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.94,2:09:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,卡洛斯在新奥尔良建新酒店的钱\Non Carlos's new hotel in New Orleans,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:44.98,2:09:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在凯撒酒店扩建的钱\Nthe add-on that we're doing at Caesars.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:51.65,2:09:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-菲茨都在做些什么  -菲茨吗\N- And what's Fitz doing all this time? - Fitz?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:53.98,2:09:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  这事应该他管的\NYeah, he's supposed to help with this shit.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:55.94,2:09:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,钱是养老基金的受托人出的\NThe money comes from the Pension Fund trustees.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:58.31,2:09:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他们应该要签字同意\NThey gotta sign off on it.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.65,2:10:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他们本应该听菲茨的安排开绿灯\NThey're supposed to be rubber-stamping what Fitz says.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:01.90,2:10:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-没错  -只是吉米\N- Right, right. Yeah. - Except Jimmy
Dialogue: 0,2:10:04.19,2:10:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,让其中几位拒绝开绿灯了\Nhas a couple of them to stop rubber-stamping.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:08.65,2:10:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这个王八蛋\NThe son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:10.73,2:10:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为已经处理好了\NI thought we took care of that.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:13.52,2:10:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他怎么跟人说的吗\NYou know what he told somebody?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:14.85,2:10:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他说一旦菲茨下位  他成功上台\NHe goes, once Fitz is out and he's in,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:16.85,2:10:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他就要收回以前的债款\Nhe's gonna call in the old loans.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:19.23,2:10:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,酒店  赌场  房地产之类的\NHotels, casinos, real estate, no matter what it is.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.77,2:10:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你要是没有马上连本带利还钱给他\NAnd if you don't have his money and interest in two seconds,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.19,2:10:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他就要全部接管\Nhe's taking 'em over.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:27.02,2:10:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不能让他得逞\NWe can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:30.69,2:10:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-这是他说的  -是他说的\N- He said that? - He said that.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:32.77,2:10:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定这是他的原话吗  托尼\NYou sure he said that, Tony?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:34.35,2:10:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是他的原话\NHe said that.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:35.81,2:10:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你说的这些全都是他的原话\NEverything I'm telling you, yeah, he said.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.90,2:10:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他以为他是谁啊  卡斯特罗吗\NI mean, who does he think he is? Castro?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:43.52,2:10:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,? 就是现在 ?\N? The time is now ?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:45.90,2:10:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,? 一同起立欢呼 ?\N? The time to stand and cheer ?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.31,2:10:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,? 因为留下的都是美好时光 ?\N? 'Cause better times are here to stay ?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:52.27,2:10:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,? 昨日已远去 ?\N? Oh, yesterday is over ?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:54.98,2:10:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,? 明日要到来 ?\N? Tomorrow's on its way ?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.19,2:11:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,? 但快来看看今天有什么在等待着你 ?\N? But look what's new and made for you today ?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:02.23,2:11:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,? 今天 ?\N? Today ?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.35,2:11:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你要的不是钱吧\NYou don't need money, do you?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:06.77,2:11:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,与钱无关\NIt's not about money.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:08.77,2:11:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不是为了钱\NIf it's not about money,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:09.81,2:11:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就真的有点搞不懂了\Nthen I'm really having trouble understanding,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:11.77,2:11:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们谈了那么久到底是为了什么\Nbecause I don't know what all the talk is about.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:14.48,2:11:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的工会\NIt's my union.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:16.90,2:11:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-这很难理解吗  -不是\N- Is that hard to understand? - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:18.85,2:11:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的工会  没问题  永远都是你的工会\NIt's your union, that's right. It'll always be your union.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:21.40,2:11:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你完全可以下台在幕后管理\NYou could step down and still run it.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:22.98,2:11:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-我才不会下台  -你这话什么意思\N- No, you don't step down. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:25.19,2:11:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素  下台是管不了工会的\NRuss, you don't step down to run a union.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.23,2:11:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,下台是直接进坟墓\NYou step down to go to your grave.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:29.27,2:11:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,听好了\NWell, listen.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:31.40,2:11:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是在想...不好意思\NI still think... I can't help but think, I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:34.15,2:11:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么迫切是出于什么其他理由吗\Nbut is there another reason or something?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:36.48,2:11:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的工会  "其他理由"又是什么意思\NThis is my union! What do you mean, "another reason"?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:40.65,2:11:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的工会\NThis is my union.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:42.23,2:11:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗  你先明确好这一点\NAll right? Let's start with that
Dialogue: 0,2:11:43.94,2:11:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,再去弄清楚别的事情\Nand then try to understand things.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:45.85,2:11:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说  有人\NListen, some people,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:48.35,2:11:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我  但有人\Nnot me, but some people,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:51.85,2:11:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他们有点顾虑\Nthey're a little concerned.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:54.02,2:11:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有人  不是我  他们觉得你可能...\NSome people, not me, they think that you might...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:57.81,2:11:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能什么\NI might...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:58.77,2:12:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能没有表达出应有的感激之举\NYou might be demonstrating a failure to show appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:05.44,2:12:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有表现出感激\NI'm not showing appreciation?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:07.81,2:12:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,有人是这么说的\NAccording to, you know, some people.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:09.90,2:12:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我蹲了五年牢房\NI went to school for five fucking years.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:12.98,2:12:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-我知道  -整整五年\N- Yes, you did. - Five fucking years.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:16.94,2:12:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有供出任何一个人\NI didn't name one fucking name.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:18.85,2:12:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-你做得对  -我做得对\N- You did the right thing. - I did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:20.65,2:12:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你做得很对\NYou did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:21.73,2:12:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我每天都要跟那个\NI sat there every day with that
Dialogue: 0,2:12:23.65,2:12:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,爱发牢骚的新泽西狗杂种坐在一起\Nwhining cocksucker from New Jersey,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:27.10,2:12:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,听他说有他多么不幸  有多困难\Ntalking to me about his woes, his problems,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:31.31,2:12:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,而我只是想安安静静地吃个冰淇淋\Nand all I wanted to do was finish my ice cream in peace.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:35.52,2:12:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这个狗杂种开会迟到了十五分钟\NThis cocksucker shows up at a meeting 15 minutes late,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:40.77,2:12:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,还穿着他妈的短裤\Nwearing fucking shorts!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:43.48,2:12:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-谁会穿短裤去开会  -谁都不会\N- Who wears shorts to a meeting? - Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:46.02,2:12:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-没错  -没人会这么做\N- That's right. - Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:48.44,2:12:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,还说我没有表示感激\NI'm not showing appreciation?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:50.19,2:12:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我说的\NIt's not me.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:51.73,2:12:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是有人这么说\NAccording to some people...
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.81,2:12:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道不是你  是另有他人\NNo, I know it's not you. Some people...
Dialogue: 0,2:12:55.60,2:12:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,另有他人说我没有表示感激\NSome people say I'm not showing appreciation?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:58.02,2:12:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那就去他们的吧\NWell, then fuck them.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:00.23,2:13:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我这是在帮你  吉米\NI'm trying to help you, Jim.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:01.77,2:13:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\NI know you are.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:03.56,2:13:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但是谁都别想威胁霍法\NBut nobody threatens Hoffa.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:05.35,2:13:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,? 就是现在 ?\N? The time is now ?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.69,2:13:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,? 就是当下 ?\N? The time is now ?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:10.06,2:13:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,? 就是此刻 ?\N? The time is now ?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:27.65,2:13:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他当过司机\NHe has done it as a driver,
Dialogue: 0,2:13:29.65,2:13:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,当过工会组织者\Nhe has done it as an organizer,
Dialogue: 0,2:13:32.10,2:13:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,还有可能在场的大多数来宾都不知道\Nand I don't think many of you here know this,
Dialogue: 0,2:13:34.94,2:13:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克手握一项记录\Nbut Frank holds a record.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:38.40,2:13:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,在罢工纠察线上被逮捕次数最多的人\NIt's most arrests on the picket line.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:43.69,2:13:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,一天内26次\NTwenty-six times in 24 hours,
Dialogue: 0,2:13:48.14,2:13:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,打破了我的记录\Nbeating my record.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:52.35,2:13:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  女士们先生们  我没有夸大其词\NThere it is, ladies and gentlemen. There's no exaggeration.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:56.98,2:14:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他是彻头彻尾的工会人\NHe is a union man to his bones.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:01.56,2:14:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你们选择站在哪一边\NWhich side are you on?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:03.35,2:14:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你这边\NYour side!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:04.73,2:14:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,哪一边\NWhose side?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:05.81,2:14:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你这边\NYour side!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:07.02,2:14:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我这边\NMy side.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:07.85,2:14:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你这边\NYour side.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:08.98,2:14:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-他那边  -没错\N- His side. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:11.10,2:14:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样\NThere it is.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:12.77,2:14:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,所以今晚我很荣幸在这里\NAnd so, it is an honor for me to be here tonight
Dialogue: 0,2:14:16.77,2:14:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,将这份奖\Nto present this award
Dialogue: 0,2:14:18.44,2:14:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,颁给我亲爱的朋友  弗兰克·希兰先生\Nto my dear friend, Mr. Frank Sheeran!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:32.23,2:14:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你  吉米  非常感谢\NThank you, Jimmy, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:35.40,2:14:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,也谢谢我亲爱的妻子琳妮\NAnd thank you to my lovely wife Reenie
Dialogue: 0,2:14:38.40,2:14:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,陪我来这里\Nfor being here with me.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:40.69,2:14:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢我甜美可爱的女儿们\NMy lovely, sweet, adorable daughters,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:43.31,2:14:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,玛丽安  多洛莉丝  康妮  佩琪\NMaryanne, Dolores, Connie, Peggy,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:47.52,2:14:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这么多年一直容忍我\Nfor putting up with me for all these years.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:51.90,2:14:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,还有吉米  我无法表达你给我颁发这份荣誉\NAnd, Jimmy, I can't tell you what this means to me
Dialogue: 0,2:14:54.60,2:14:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,对我意义多么重大\Nto get this honor from you.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:57.02,2:15:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我人生最重要的时刻  非常非常感谢你\NIt's the highlight of my life. Thank you very, very much.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:00.56,2:15:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人  詹姆斯·里德尔·霍法\NAnd this man, James Riddell Hoffa,
Dialogue: 0,2:15:04.19,2:15:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是最能成事的人\Nis the guy that gets the job done.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:09.10,2:15:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我就在你身后  吉米\NI'm behind you, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:10.77,2:15:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,一路随行\NAll the way.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:13.81,2:15:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,总之\NIn any case,
Dialogue: 0,2:15:14.85,2:15:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我衷心感谢你们所有人\Nfrom the deepest part of my heart, I thank you all.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:17.40,2:15:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我并不该获得这一切\N'Cause I don't really deserve all this.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:20.27,2:15:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,但我得了滑囊炎  我也不该得那个\NBut I have bursitis and I don't deserve that either.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:24.77,2:15:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚感谢你们所有人  感谢前来\NThank you all tonight and thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:27.44,2:15:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安\NGood night.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:39.65,2:15:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么不喊"说茄子"\NWhat happened to "Say cheese"?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:41.98,2:15:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,茄子\NCheese!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:47.40,2:15:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,? 让我的爱盈满你的心 ?\N? Bringing you all the love your heart can hold ?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:56.27,2:16:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,? 请说"我愿意" ?\N? Please say "sí, sí" ?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:05.31,2:16:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,? 说你及你那西班牙眼眸会为我等待 ?\N? Say you and your Spanish eyes will wait for me ?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:15.77,2:16:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,? 蓝色的西班牙眼眸 ?\N? Blue Spanish eyes ?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:25.35,2:16:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,? 墨西哥最美的双眼 ?\N? Prettiest eyes in all of Mexico ?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:34.90,2:16:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,? 真诚的西班牙眼眸 ?\N? True Spanish eyes ?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:44.40,2:16:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,? 请在我离开前再为我展开笑颜 ?\N? Please smile for me once more before I go... ?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:58.56,2:17:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,世上只有三个人有这个\NOnly three people in the world have one of these.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:01.48,2:17:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,其中只有一人是爱尔兰人\NAnd only one of them is Irish.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:03.90,2:17:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一枚\NI have one.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:05.31,2:17:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,安吉洛有一枚\NAngelo has one.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:09.27,2:17:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你也有了\NNow you have one.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:15.19,2:17:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,真漂亮\NThis is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:20.40,2:17:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道该说什么  罗素  这...\NI... I don't... I don't know what to say, Russ. It's...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:24.10,2:17:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快戴上  看看怎么样\NSlip it on. See how it looks.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:30.35,2:17:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-感觉好吗  -好\N- Feel good? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:33.98,2:17:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我让你变得多强吗  知道多强吗\NYou know how strong I made you? You know how strong?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:38.65,2:17:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的小子\NYou're my kid.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:40.98,2:17:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,没人...没人能搞你\NNobody... Nobody can fuck with you.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:43.52,2:17:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,没人\NNobody.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:10.77,2:18:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  弗兰克\NListen, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:12.81,2:18:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的朋友又失控了\NThings have gotten out of hand with our friend again.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:16.85,2:18:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,有些人对他意见很大\NAnd some people are having serious problems with him.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:20.94,2:18:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,到现在这个地步\NAnd it's at a point where
Dialogue: 0,2:18:23.90,2:18:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须找他谈谈  告诉他\Nyou're gonna have to talk to him and tell him
Dialogue: 0,2:18:27.31,2:18:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,到此为止了\Nit's what it is.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:31.48,2:18:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,到此为止\NWhat it is?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:32.69,2:18:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  这是他们的意愿\NYes. It's what they want.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:35.19,2:18:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,已经到这步了\NIt's where it's gotten.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:38.19,2:18:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你和他亲近  或许他会听你的\NYou're close to him. Maybe he'll listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:40.90,2:18:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我和他谈过\NYou know I talked to him.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:42.31,2:18:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他这人很固执  你了解他的\NHe's a tough guy to talk to. You know him.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:44.31,2:18:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他没得选\NHe has no choice.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:46.15,2:18:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他没得选\NHe has no choice.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:48.35,2:18:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这些是大人物\NThese are the higher-ups.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:51.81,2:18:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他也是个大人物  不是吗\NWell, he's a higher-up too. I mean... No?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:55.15,2:18:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,和他们不同  你知道的\NNot like this. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:57.40,2:18:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托  弗兰克\NCome on now, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:01.77,2:19:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他们能干掉一个总统\NIf they can whack a president,
Dialogue: 0,2:19:03.90,2:19:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就能干掉一个工会主席\Nthey can whack a president of the union.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:07.77,2:19:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道  我也知道\NYou know it and I know it.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:20.65,2:19:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我和他谈过一次又一次\NI talk to this guy, I talk to him, I talk to him,
Dialogue: 0,2:19:22.56,2:19:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是不听\NI talk to him, he don't listen.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:23.94,2:19:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但他现在必须听  我得让他听进去\NBut he's gotta listen now. I gotta make him listen.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:28.77,2:19:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不对  他就是个傻瓜\NThat ain't right. He's... he's a fucking knucklehead.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:43.06,2:19:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米  我和罗素谈了\NJimmy. I talked to Russ.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:45.77,2:19:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他和托尼谈过\NHe talked to Tony.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:47.06,2:19:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他说的话是认真的\NHe means what he's saying.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:49.27,2:19:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-谁  罗素吗  -不  托尼\N- Who? Russ? - No, Tony.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:51.48,2:19:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-托尼  -是的\N- Tony? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:53.27,2:19:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的话也是认真的\NWell, I mean what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:55.69,2:19:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他那该死的西西里肥脑袋似乎就是不明白\NHe can't seem to get that through his fat, fucking Sicilian head.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:59.52,2:20:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,对不对  别担心\NCan he? Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:01.48,2:20:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么了\NWhat's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:02.73,2:20:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来...\NYou... you look...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:03.94,2:20:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-我很担心  -我知道\N- I'm concerned. - Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:05.10,2:20:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来就在担心  你担心什么\NYou look concerned. What are you concerned about?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:07.65,2:20:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我...\NI'm... I'm...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:08.27,2:20:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,该担心的是他们\NThey should be concerned.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:09.85,2:20:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-他们确实担心  -那就让他们担心去\N- They are. They are. - Well, let them be.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:11.19,2:20:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不止有一点点担心\NThey're more than a little concerned.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:12.77,2:20:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他们担心颇多\NThere's widespread concern.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:14.19,2:20:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个大问题\NIt's a big problem.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:17.23,2:20:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼让老爷子叫我告诉你...\NTony told the old man to tell me to tell you...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:21.60,2:20:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,"到此为止了"\N"It's what it is."
Dialogue: 0,2:20:27.06,2:20:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,到此为止\NWhat it is?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:27.94,2:20:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,到此为止了\NIt's what it is.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:33.15,2:20:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托  听我说\NPlease, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:36.60,2:20:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不敢\NThey wouldn't dare.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:38.52,2:20:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-别...  -他们不敢\N- Don't... - They wouldn't dare.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:40.35,2:20:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-吉米  -得了吧  弗兰克\N- Jimmy... - Please, Frank, come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:42.19,2:20:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-别说他们不敢  -不\N- Don't say they wouldn't dare. - No.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:43.98,2:20:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟我说这种话...都是胡扯\NDon't... don't tell me that kinda... That's fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:47.02,2:20:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,别说他们不敢\NNo, don't say they wouldn't dare.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:49.60,2:20:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我出了什么事\NIf something funny happens to me...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:54.19,2:20:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就完了\Nthey're done.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:55.06,2:20:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你明白吗  他们也清楚这点\NYou understand that? And they know it.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:57.19,2:20:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我有文件  我有证据\NBecause I got files. I got proof.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:59.90,2:21:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我有记录  我有录音带\NI got records. I got tapes.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:01.65,2:21:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我想  他们随时会完蛋\NAny time I want, they'll be gone.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:04.10,2:21:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这些几内亚混蛋\NThese Guinea motherfuckers
Dialogue: 0,2:21:05.73,2:21:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,余生都会在监狱度过\Nwill spend the rest of their lives in jail,
Dialogue: 0,2:21:07.90,2:21:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他们清楚\Nand they know it.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:10.35,2:21:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他们清楚\NThey know it.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:10.94,2:21:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但你现在说的正是他们担心的\NBut what you're saying is what they're concerned about.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:13.31,2:21:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我在说的是我知道他们的事\NWhat I'm saying is I know things.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:15.02,2:21:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他们不知道我知道的事\NI know things they don't know I know.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:18.81,2:21:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-拜托  -你真的要冒那个险吗\N- Please... - Are you gonna take that chance?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:21.10,2:21:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我冒什么...我为什么要冒险\NWhat chance am I... Why should I be taking a chance?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:23.10,2:21:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说到此为止了\NThey're saying this is it.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:25.44,2:21:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说到此为止  那就到此为止吗\NThey're saying this is it, and then it's it?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:27.44,2:21:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-胡说  胡说  弗兰克  -别这样\N- Bullshit. Bullshit, Frank. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:29.56,2:21:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米  我是想告诉你\NJimmy, I'm trying to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:31.10,2:21:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你是  你在告诉我他们威胁我\NI know you are. You're telling me that they're threatening me
Dialogue: 0,2:21:33.35,2:21:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须照他们说的做\Nand I gotta do what they say.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:34.98,2:21:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那不只是威胁  那是底线\NIt's more than a threat. It's the bottom line.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:37.81,2:21:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,底线\NThe bottom line.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:39.65,2:21:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,到此为止了\NIt's what it is.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:41.02,2:21:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他们搞我  我就搞他们\NThey do something to me, I do something to them.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:44.56,2:21:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道这个  别的我不知道  你知道吗\NThat's all I know. I don't know anything else. Do you?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:49.44,2:21:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那我要怎么做  我该怎么跟麦基说\NSo what am I gonna do? What am I gonna tell McGee?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:52.44,2:21:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,说你不肯听吗\NThat you're not gonna listen?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:54.15,2:21:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他不习惯有人不听他的\NHe ain't used to people not listening to him.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:55.48,2:21:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\NWell, neither am I.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:57.98,2:21:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么  -我也是\N- What? - Neither am I.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:00.85,2:22:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那我不知道该怎么办了\NThen I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:01.77,2:22:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,或许你该找些保镖\NI mean, maybe you should get some bodies around you
Dialogue: 0,2:22:03.52,2:22:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-保护你  -得了吧\N- for protection. - Come on. Please.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:05.44,2:22:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会选那条路\NI'm not gonna go that route.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:07.15,2:22:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,别这么对我  弗兰克\NDon't do this to me, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:08.81,2:22:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你说"找些保镖"是什么意思  我不需要\NWhat do you mean, "bodies around me"? I don't need...
Dialogue: 0,2:22:11.23,2:22:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你找保镖  他们就会找上你的家人\NYou put bodies around you, then they go after your family.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:13.81,2:22:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-这不重要  你担心吗  -我担心\N- It doesn't matter. You worried? - I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:16.06,2:22:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你去找些保镖吧  我告诉你为什么\NGet some bodies around you. I'll tell you why.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:19.65,2:22:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这事可能落到你身上\NThis could happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:21.23,2:22:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可能找上你\NThey could come after you
Dialogue: 0,2:22:23.52,2:22:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你支持我\Nsince you're with me.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:25.35,2:22:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗\NNo?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:28.73,2:22:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我很担心\NI'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:30.06,2:22:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉罗素我对他只有尊重\NTell Russ I got nothing but respect for him.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:32.77,2:22:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我和他有点小摩擦\NI got a little trouble with him.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:35.31,2:22:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们之前谈的时候  我有点失控\NWe were talking before and I just got a little crazy.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:37.60,2:22:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-你知道我什么样  有时会发脾气  -是的\N- You know how I am. I just blow. Sometimes. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:40.69,2:22:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,气得扭头就走\NI just walked away like that.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:42.10,2:22:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但我就是这样的人\NBut I get that way. I get abrupt.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:44.10,2:22:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,或许你能告诉他我多么尊重他\NMaybe you could tell him how much I respect him.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:47.52,2:22:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我对他只有尊重\NI have nothing but respect for this guy.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:49.98,2:22:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我永远不会伤害他\NI would never hurt him,
Dialogue: 0,2:22:51.69,2:22:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不管我手上有什么文件  不管我做什么\Nno matter what I do with files, or whatever I do with anything.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:54.94,2:22:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该亲自告诉他\NBut you should tell him. Yourself.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:57.06,2:22:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我不要亲自告诉他\NNo, I'm not gonna tell him myself.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:58.31,2:22:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-拜托  -算了吧\N- Please. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:59.35,2:23:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-亲口说更有意义  -他是你的导师\N- It would go a long way. - He's your rabbi.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:02.31,2:23:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你有今天全靠他\NBecause of him, you're here.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:04.23,2:23:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉他\NYou tell him.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:06.10,2:23:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\NListen to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:07.02,2:23:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,最终只有一件事是真的\NAt the end, there's only one thing that's real.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:10.65,2:23:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的工会\NThis is my union.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:14.35,2:23:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的工会  弗兰克\NThis is my union, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:19.60,2:23:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,明确这一点  其他就简单了\NVery simple when you say it that way.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:27.06,2:23:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,佩琪\NPeggy!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:28.27,2:23:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们跳舞吧\NShall we dance?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:30.19,2:23:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,失陪\NExcuse us.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:03.10,2:24:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,距离底特律几小时车程\NA couple of hours outside Detroit,
Dialogue: 0,2:24:05.31,2:24:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们决定住一晚\Nwe figured we'd spend the night,
Dialogue: 0,2:24:07.77,2:24:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,早上再赶路\Ndrive up in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:09.69,2:24:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去参加婚礼\NI mean, the wedding, that was the thing.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:12.15,2:24:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔·巴法利诺要把女儿嫁给一个好男人\NBill Bufalino, you know, was giving his daughter away to a hell of a guy.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:16.15,2:24:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,比之前那个无赖好\NBetter than the bum she was with before.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:18.65,2:24:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这是件好事\NAnd that was all well and good.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:21.06,2:24:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但婚礼实际是求和任务\NBut the wedding was really a peace mission.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:25.48,2:24:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那才是我们参加的目的\NAnd that's what we were there for.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:25.77,2:24:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}哥伦布\N代顿\N底特律
Dialogue: 0,2:24:26.69,2:24:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,大家差不多都知道\NAnd everybody kinda knew that,
Dialogue: 0,2:24:28.69,2:24:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是去理清这件事的\Nand we were there to straighten it all out.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:31.23,2:24:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-吉米  -是我\N- Jimmy? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:32.60,2:24:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我和老爷子在一起  我们开车过去\NI'm with the old man, we're driving up.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:34.40,2:24:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他希望我们能把整件事理清楚\NHe hopes we can straighten this whole thing out.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:37.02,2:24:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他说了什么\NWhat did he say?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:37.98,2:24:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他说希望我们能理清这事\NHe said he hopes we can straighten it out.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:39.44,2:24:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,婚礼之后  我们坐下谈谈\NAfter the wedding, we sit down, we talk,
Dialogue: 0,2:24:41.31,2:24:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,理清这事\Nwe straighten it out.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:42.27,2:24:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,婚礼啊\NRight, the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:43.23,2:24:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我不准备参加婚礼\NI'm not going to the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:44.81,2:24:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,太多我不喜欢的人会到场\NToo many people I don't like are gonna be there,
Dialogue: 0,2:24:46.60,2:24:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我不准备去\Nso I'm not going to the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:48.52,2:24:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你不去参加婚礼吗\NYou're not going to the wedding?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:49.90,2:24:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会去\NI'm not gonna be there.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:53.48,2:24:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们可以...\NWell, then we could...
Dialogue: 0,2:24:54.98,2:24:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米  你想在哪里谈都可以\NJimmy, then we could do it anywhere you want.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:56.40,2:24:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,可以在你家\NWe can do it at your house.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:58.44,2:24:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你想在哪里都行\NWe can do it anywhere you want.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:59.90,2:25:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,地点任你选择\NWherever you're comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:02.23,2:25:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,湖边怎么样\NThe lake?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:03.31,2:25:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好  湖边  你想在那里谈吗\NYeah, the lake. You wanna do it at the lake?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:06.69,2:25:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我一开始就想把这事谈妥\NFrom day one, I wanted to work this out.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:09.44,2:25:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-我知道  我知道  -从他妈的一开始\N- I know. I know. - From day fucking one.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:12.65,2:25:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白  我比任何人都清楚  我知道\NI know. Nobody knows better than me. I know that.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:15.44,2:25:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好  就你们俩来吧\NAll right, uh... Just you two, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:18.60,2:25:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,别带上那个矮子\NI mean, not the Little Guy.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:20.56,2:25:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-不  他当然得去  -不行\N- No, of course, the Little Guy. - No.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:22.65,2:25:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要跟他谈\NI'm not doing it with him.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:24.19,2:25:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米  只有我们三个人谈没有用\NJimmy, there's no point just the three of us.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:25.85,2:25:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不  不  不\NNo, no. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:26.98,2:25:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就我们三个人谈  就这样...\NJust the three of us. That's the way it's...
Dialogue: 0,2:25:29.31,2:25:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我们三个人谈没有用\NThere's no point just the three of us.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:30.81,2:25:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,矮子必须得在场\NIt's gotta be the Little Guy with us.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:32.10,2:25:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我不要再跟那个小龟孙谈了\NNo, I'm not sitting down with that little cocksucker again!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:34.73,2:25:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你明白吗  我做不到  弗兰克\NDo you understand? I can't do it, Frank!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:37.27,2:25:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须跟他谈\NYou have to.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:37.81,2:25:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不  吉米  你得跟他谈谈\NNo, Jimmy, you gotta sit down with him.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:39.31,2:25:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么都不必做  -大家都说...\N- We don't gotta do anything. - Everybody says...
Dialogue: 0,2:25:40.56,2:25:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我这是出于对他们的礼貌\NThis is a courtesy with these people.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:42.77,2:25:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,完全是给他们面子\NA complete courtesy.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:43.98,2:25:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-你懂的  -我明白\N- You know that. - I understand.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:45.23,2:25:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,但你得试着让这事过去\NBut you gotta try and move past that.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:47.06,2:25:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经让这事过去了\NGet past it? I am past it!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:48.69,2:25:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我再也不会见那个混蛋了\NI'm never seeing that motherfucker again.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:50.97,2:25:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-这就是...  -吉米  你得坐下来好好谈\N- You see that's... - Jimmy, you gotta sit down.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:52.27,2:25:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都这么说\NEverybody says so.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:53.31,2:25:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但这没有意义  只有一点\NBut there's no point. There's only one point,
Dialogue: 0,2:25:55.77,2:25:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想这么做  我也不会这么做\NI don't wanna do it and I'm not gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:57.90,2:25:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克  我要挂你电话了\NFrank, I'm gonna hang up on you now.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:59.56,2:26:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托  理解一下  好吗\NPlease. Understand this. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:15.35,2:26:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-他怎么说  -他在考虑\N- What did he say? - Uh, he's thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:18.56,2:26:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-考虑  -对\N- Thinking about it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:20.77,2:26:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}豪生冰餐厅  冰淇淋  鸡尾酒
Dialogue: 0,2:26:24.81,2:26:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}豪生汽车旅馆\N客人登记及收据\N弗兰克·希兰
Dialogue: 0,2:26:27.65,2:26:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,给你的\NThat's for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:36.73,2:26:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  好的\NWell, that's good. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:51.48,2:26:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,几点了  弗兰克\NWhat time you got, Frank?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:54.15,2:26:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大概五点\NAbout five.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:55.31,2:26:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,五点吗\NFive, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:58.94,2:27:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你该给吉米打个电话\NMaybe you should give Jimmy a call.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:00.60,2:27:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他说他会考虑的  对吗\NI mean, he said he was gonna think about it, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:27:09.02,2:27:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:21.19,2:27:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你们什么时候来\NSo when are you getting in?
Dialogue: 0,2:27:22.73,2:27:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,明天早上\NTomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:24.06,2:27:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那挺好  挺好  因为...\NThat's good. That's good, 'cause, uh...
Dialogue: 0,2:27:26.40,2:27:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,另外那件事我改变主意了\NI changed my mind about the other thing.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:30.35,2:27:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-是吗  -嗯\N- You did? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:32.10,2:27:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我明天下午会跟矮子见面\NYeah, I'm gonna meet, uh, with the Little Guy tomorrow afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:36.44,2:27:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,跟矮...\NWith the lit...
Dialogue: 0,2:27:37.65,2:27:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-跟矮子见面吗  -嗯\N- With the Little Guy? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:39.52,2:27:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼·杰克安排好了  我喜欢杰克\NTony Jack set it up. I like Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:41.85,2:27:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他很不错\NJack's good.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:42.45,2:27:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,迈阿密那事儿之后  我见过他几次\NI met with him a few times after that, you know, Miami fiasco.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:46.15,2:27:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里和矮子见面\NWith the Little Guy. Where?
Dialogue: 0,2:27:48.65,2:27:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,老地方  你知道在哪里\NSame place as before. You know where it is.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:52.06,2:27:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,在公共场合\NIn public.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:54.77,2:27:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道托尼·杰克是普罗的表亲吧\NYou know Tony Jack is Pro's cousin?
Dialogue: 0,2:27:57.35,2:27:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  那又怎样\NYeah. So?
Dialogue: 0,2:27:58.77,2:28:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他们全都是亲戚  你能怎么办\NThey're all fucking cousins. What're you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:01.31,2:28:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米  我觉得我应该过去\NJimmy, I think I should be there.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:03.35,2:28:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好  我想让你在场\NYeah, I want you there.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:04.60,2:28:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我问了你什么时候过来\NThat's why I asked when you're coming in.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:06.73,2:28:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你们几点见面\NWhat time's the meeting?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:08.31,2:28:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,两点半\NTwo-thirty.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:09.23,2:28:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那个龟孙可千万别迟到\NAnd he better not be late, that cocksucker,
Dialogue: 0,2:28:11.81,2:28:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,或是穿着该死的短裤\Nor wearing those fucking shorts.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:14.02,2:28:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我两点到那里\NListen, I'm gonna get there at 2:00,
Dialogue: 0,2:28:15.40,2:28:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你也应该两点到\Nso you should get there at 2:00.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:17.35,2:28:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-好吗  -我会两点到\N- Okay? - I'll be there at 2:00.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:18.69,2:28:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好  很好  好的\NOh, good. Good. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:20.98,2:28:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,两点见\NI'll see you at 2:00.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:22.27,2:28:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-谢谢  弗兰克  -好  吉米\N- Thanks, Frank. - Okay, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:25.31,2:28:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,两点见\NSee you at 2:00.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:32.85,2:28:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他怎么说\NWhat did he say?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:34.40,2:28:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他会跟普罗见面\NHe's gonna meet with Pro.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:38.02,2:28:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼·杰克安排好了\NTony Jack set it up.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:40.19,2:28:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\NVery good.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:55.69,2:28:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-你们好  -你们好  晚上好\N- Hello. - Hello. Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:59.23,2:29:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们饿死了  -快走  快走\N- We're starving. - Oh, let's go, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:08.06,2:29:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,跟安吉洛的人要来这瓶红酒醋\NIt was the best move we made,
Dialogue: 0,2:29:09.10,2:29:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是我们做过最明智的事\Ngetting this red wine vinegar from Angelo's guy.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:14.02,2:29:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,跟另一个混混要来的意大利橄榄油也不错\NGreat Italian olive oil we got from that other mooch was not bad either.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:19.85,2:29:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,卡塔尼亚的橄榄油最棒了\NCatania olives, what better.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:22.35,2:29:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,顶级的\NThe best.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:28.15,2:29:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,计划有变\NThere's been a change.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:30.44,2:29:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,明天早上别那么早出发\NInstead of, uh, going up early,
Dialogue: 0,2:29:34.18,2:29:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们先待一会儿  然后再开车过去\Nwe're gonna hang around tomorrow morning and then go drive up.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:37.98,2:29:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,但我跟吉米说了  我们一早就出发\NBut... But I told Jimmy that we were gonna be up in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:43.31,2:29:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟吉米说了...\NI told Jimmy...
Dialogue: 0,2:29:44.31,2:29:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟吉米说了我们一早就出发\NI told Jimmy we're gonna be up in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:46.44,2:29:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道  我知道\NI know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:50.19,2:29:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我说我会陪他去见普罗\NThat I would be there for that... meeting with Pro.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:54.02,2:29:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么  -我会...\N- What? - That I'd be...
Dialogue: 0,2:29:55.31,2:29:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,陪他去见普罗\Nbe there for that meeting with Pro.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:57.44,2:29:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  我知道  我知道\NOh, yeah. I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:03.10,2:30:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那我要怎么做\NBut what I... What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,2:30:06.40,2:30:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得过去  我得过去\NWe gotta go there. I mean, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:09.23,2:30:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟他说了我会去\NI told him I'd be there.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:14.48,2:30:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克\NFrank...
Dialogue: 0,2:30:16.35,2:30:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们对他仁至义尽了\Nwe did all we could for the man.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:30.03,2:30:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,别打给他\NDon't call him.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:08.19,2:31:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-早上好  -早上好\N- Hey. Good morning. - Hey. Morning.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:12.82,2:31:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,要咖啡吗\NWant some coffee?
Dialogue: 0,2:31:14.46,2:31:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不用  我有了\NNo, I got it here.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:17.38,2:31:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-睡得怎么样  -挺好  你呢\N- How'd ya sleep? - Good. You?
Dialogue: 0,2:31:21.31,2:31:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,还行吧\NAll right.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:26.35,2:31:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,要全麦片还是玉米片\NWant some Total or Corn Flakes?
Dialogue: 0,2:31:28.98,2:31:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,全麦片吧\NMaybe Total.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:38.58,2:31:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,够了  谢谢\NThat's good, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:46.75,2:31:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们今天要去一趟克林顿港\NWe're gonna take a ride up to Port Clinton today.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:54.87,2:31:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我们要待在这里\NI thought we were staying here.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:57.57,2:31:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不  夫人们待在这里\NNo, the girls are gonna stay here.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:00.17,2:32:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们俩去\NYou and me, we're going up and, uh...
Dialogue: 0,2:32:03.60,2:32:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,最多三个小时就会回来\Nwe'll be back three hours tops.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:09.18,2:32:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,去克林顿港干什么\NBut... But what's in Port Clinton?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:12.32,2:32:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,坐飞机\NA plane.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:16.96,2:32:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,坐飞机  去哪里\NA plane? To where?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:19.26,2:32:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,底特律\NDetroit.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:27.98,2:32:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在要去底特律吗\NWe're going to Detroit now?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:30.15,2:32:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不  你要去底特律\NNo, you're gonna go to Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:35.15,2:32:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你回来之后\NAnd when you come back,
Dialogue: 0,2:32:37.05,2:32:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们带上夫人们\Nme and you, we get together with the girls,
Dialogue: 0,2:32:39.92,2:32:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,优哉游哉地上路\Nwe take a nice slow drive up.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:42.78,2:32:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,时不时停下来抽根烟\NWith cigarette breaks, you know.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:56.15,2:32:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克\NFrank.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:57.95,2:33:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须让你去做这件事\NI had to put you into this thing,
Dialogue: 0,2:33:00.82,2:33:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,否则你绝不会袖手旁观\Nor you would never let it happen.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:03.83,2:33:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你不会\NAnd I know you wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:10.86,2:33:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但事已至此\NBut it's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:14.97,2:33:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎样  都得解决他\NEither way, he's going.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:24.06,2:33:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白你的感受  弗兰克  相信我\NI know how you feel, Frank. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:26.71,2:33:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白你的感受\NI know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:29.96,2:33:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前跟你说过  我们已经尽力帮他了\NI told you before, we tried everything to help him.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:32.68,2:33:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道的\NYou know that.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:33.83,2:33:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你尽力了\NYou tried.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:37.81,2:33:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他自找的\NHe brought this on himself.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:41.72,2:33:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,还牵扯到了我们\NAnd it's landing on us.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:47.45,2:33:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他们同意这样安排\NThe only reason they agreed to this
Dialogue: 0,2:33:50.32,2:33:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是出于对我的尊重\Nwas out of respect to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:54.88,2:33:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你和琳妮不会有事的\NBut you and Reenie will be okay,
Dialogue: 0,2:33:57.46,2:33:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你是我的人\N'cause you're with me.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:03.92,2:34:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的人\NYou're with me.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:44.40,2:34:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的眼镜给我\NGive me your glasses.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:46.16,2:36:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}凯撒路83号
Dialogue: 0,2:37:06.70,2:37:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}红狐餐厅
Dialogue: 0,2:37:50.48,2:37:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}凯撒路83号
Dialogue: 0,2:39:13.13,2:39:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克\NHey, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:15.03,2:39:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,小萨\NHey, Sal.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:18.54,2:39:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,查奇迟到了\NChuckie's late.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:13.76,2:40:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是他吗\NThat him?
Dialogue: 0,2:40:19.51,2:40:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:22.88,2:40:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\NJesus.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:28.62,2:40:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我是萨利\NI'm Sally.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:30.25,2:40:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\NHi.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:33.22,2:40:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-小查  -弗兰克\N- Chuck. - Frank.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:34.92,2:40:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,快走  我不想你爸因为迟到对我大吼大叫\NLet's go. I don't want your father yelling at me for being late.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:36.99,2:40:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克  你坐前面\NFrank, you take the front.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:39.72,2:40:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-这他妈怎么回事  -怎么了\N- What the fuck is this? - What?
Dialogue: 0,2:40:42.14,2:40:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,湿漉漉的\NIt's wet.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:43.58,2:40:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚给朋友送了一条冻鱼\NYeah, I had a frozen fish I had to deliver for a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:48.61,2:40:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,一条鱼\NA fish?
Dialogue: 0,2:40:50.08,2:40:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,座位是被鱼给弄湿了吗\NThe seat is wet from a fish?
Dialogue: 0,2:40:51.17,2:40:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,对  你现在想让我怎么办\NYeah, I know. What do you want me to do about it now?
Dialogue: 0,2:40:52.79,2:40:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-老天啊  -我坐后面吧\N- Jesus Christ. - I'll sit back there.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:54.03,2:40:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不  没关系  你坐前面\NNo, no, no, it's all right. You sit in the front.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:55.36,2:40:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我坐后面\NI'll sit there.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:57.15,2:40:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我坐后面  你坐前面\NI'll sit here, you take the front.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:58.51,2:40:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不  不\NNo, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:59.67,2:41:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我坐后面\NI'll sit there.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:04.10,2:41:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-我不要坐前面  -你怎么就不...\N- I'm not sitting there. - Why don't you...
Dialogue: 0,2:41:05.06,2:41:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我要坐后面\NI'm sitting there.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:08.68,2:41:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好  随你便\NAll right, sit where you want.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:12.27,2:41:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,要给你拿张报纸吗  弗兰克\NYou want me to get you a newspaper, Frank?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:13.99,2:41:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了  走吧  我们得快点\NIt's okay. Let's go. We gotta hurry.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:29.88,2:41:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么鱼\NWhat kind of fish?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:33.24,2:41:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:36.56,2:41:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你送的是什么鱼\NWhat kind of fish?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:39.89,2:41:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道  就是可以吃的鱼\NI don't know. The kind you eat. A fish.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:43.92,2:41:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道是哪种鱼吗\NYou don't know what kind?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:47.22,2:41:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\NNo. I don't.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:49.80,2:41:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你从哪弄来的\NWhere did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:52.12,2:41:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你说呢  卖鱼的地方\NWhat the fuck. At a fish place.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:56.29,2:41:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你就直接过去说"给我条鱼"吗\NWhat, you just go in there and say, "Gimme a fish"?
Dialogue: 0,2:42:00.83,2:42:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多吧\NPretty much. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:03.79,2:42:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你没说你要鲑鱼\NYou didn't say you want a salmon,
Dialogue: 0,2:42:05.36,2:42:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,还是黑线鳕\Nyou want a... haddock,
Dialogue: 0,2:42:07.23,2:42:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,还是鳕鱼吗\Nyou want a... a fucking cod?
Dialogue: 0,2:42:09.54,2:42:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是哪种鱼有什么关系吗\NWhat the fuck does it matter what kind of fish it was?
Dialogue: 0,2:42:13.06,2:42:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么那么关心那条鱼\NWhy are you so concerned about this fish?
Dialogue: 0,2:42:14.55,2:42:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想搞清楚...\NI'm just trying to understand how...
Dialogue: 0,2:42:16.03,2:42:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这...\NDoes it...
Dialogue: 0,2:42:19.33,2:42:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么能买到一条鱼  却不知道是什么鱼\N...how a person can buy a fish and not know what kind it was.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:24.41,2:42:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那条鱼就在那里等着我\NThere was a fish waiting for me there.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:30.07,2:42:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我没问那是什么鱼  抱歉\NI didn't ask what kind of fish it was. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:36.90,2:42:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-就是说你朋友已经把鱼订好了  -对\N- So your friend had already ordered this fish. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:46.04,2:42:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,要是有人问起  我得能解释明白\N'Cause I wanna be able to explain this if somebody asks me.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:53.49,2:42:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}红狐餐厅
Dialogue: 0,2:42:56.18,2:42:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好  没问题\NYeah. Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:10.40,2:43:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,爸\NDad.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:13.11,2:43:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,查奇\NChuckie.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:14.14,2:43:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-抱歉我迟到了  我得去送...  -迟到\N- Yeah, sorry I'm late. I had to drop off... - Late?
Dialogue: 0,2:43:16.77,2:43:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你来这里干什么\NWhat the fuck are you even doing here?
Dialogue: 0,2:43:18.56,2:43:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-谁让你来的  -吉米\N- Who invited you? - Hey, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:23.16,2:43:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\NWho the fuck are you?
Dialogue: 0,2:43:24.87,2:43:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我是普罗的人\NI'm with Pro.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:26.34,2:43:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你是普罗的人\NYou're with Pro?
Dialogue: 0,2:43:27.87,2:43:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你是那个放我鸽子的龟孙的人\NAre you with the cocksucker who just stood me up?
Dialogue: 0,2:43:30.30,2:43:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会等人超过十分钟\NI don't wait for anybody more than ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:32.46,2:43:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他在房子里\NHe's at the house.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:34.40,2:43:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,什么房子\NWhat house?
Dialogue: 0,2:43:35.44,2:43:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,和罗素在一起\NWith Russ.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:37.62,2:43:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-罗素  搞什么  -看看谁在后面\N- Russ? What the fuck is... - Hey, look who's here.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:40.54,2:43:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-弗兰克  -吉米\N- Frank. - Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:42.19,2:43:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事\NWhat the fuck is going on?
Dialogue: 0,2:43:44.61,2:43:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在等你  我两点就到了\NI was waiting for you. I was there at two o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:46.81,2:43:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该到场的  出什么事了\NYou were supposed to show. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,2:43:47.85,2:43:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  但麦基来了  他决定过来\NI'm sorry. But McGee's here, he decided to come.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:50.99,2:43:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但他不喜欢这里  他不想来这里\NBut he ain't comfortable here. He don't wanna come here.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:53.43,2:43:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他在房子里\NHe's at the house.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:54.25,2:43:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-麦基来底特律了  -对  他来了\N- McGee's in Detroit? - Yeah, he's here.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:56.91,2:43:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他决定过来\NHe decided to come.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:00.59,2:44:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他是来帮忙理清这件事的\NYeah, he came to help straighten this all out.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:04.13,2:44:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,房子\NThe house?
Dialogue: 0,2:44:10.98,2:44:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,事后我们会带你来取车的\NWe'll bring you back after to get your car.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:18.91,2:44:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:21.60,2:44:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:27.63,2:44:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-好  -嗯\N- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:34.98,2:44:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}红狐餐厅
Dialogue: 0,2:44:39.17,2:44:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,之前车里放了条鱼\NThere was a fish in here,
Dialogue: 0,2:44:40.07,2:44:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们已经清理干净了\Nbut we cleaned it up.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:42.76,2:44:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,鱼\NA fish?
Dialogue: 0,2:44:45.08,2:44:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,查奇在车里放了条鱼\NChuckie had a fucking fish in here.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:46.88,2:44:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他连是什么鱼都不知道\NDidn't even know what kind.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:47.84,2:44:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在没事了  我擦干净了\NBut it's okay now. I wiped it up.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:49.92,2:44:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-我在座位上垫了块手帕  -我闻出来了\N- I got the handkerchief here. - Yeah, I can smell it.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:53.20,2:44:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,查奇\NHey, Chuckie.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:53.70,2:44:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你在车里放了条鱼吗\NYou had a fish in here in your car?
Dialogue: 0,2:44:55.79,2:44:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,给鲍比·霍姆斯的\NFor Bobby Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:57.38,2:44:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道的  鲍比喜欢吃鱼\NYou know, Bobby likes fish.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:59.21,2:45:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们清理干净了  吉米  没关系\NWe cleaned it up, Jimmy. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:00.95,2:45:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你清理干净了\NYou cleaned it up?
Dialogue: 0,2:45:02.52,2:45:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-你清理干净了  -是的\N- You cleaned it up? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:04.30,2:45:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈了解鱼吗\NWhat the fuck you know about fish?
Dialogue: 0,2:45:06.38,2:45:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你这辈子有抓过鱼吗\NYou ever caught a fucking fish in your life?
Dialogue: 0,2:45:09.38,2:45:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:10.21,2:45:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就不了解  对吧\NWell, then you don't know. See?
Dialogue: 0,2:45:12.59,2:45:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,小查\NChuck.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:13.15,2:45:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说  永远不要在车里放鱼\NListen to me. Never put a fish in your car.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:16.12,2:45:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,味道是散不掉的\NYou never get the smell out.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:17.84,2:45:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗯...  -除非包装得很好\N- No... - Unless you pack it tight, you know.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:19.66,2:45:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  我知道\NNo, I... I know.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:21.10,2:45:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-你知道吗  记住了  -对\N- You know? Remember that. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:23.08,2:45:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\NI know.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:23.89,2:45:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你会受益匪浅的\NIt'll help you in life.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:30.58,2:45:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克  你就不能两点来找我  告诉我这事吗\NFrank, you couldn't come by at 2:00 and tell me this?
Dialogue: 0,2:45:33.55,2:45:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我傻傻地在那等了你四十分钟\NI was waiting there 40 minutes like a fuckin' moron.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:36.54,2:45:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米  抱歉  我刚到就赶过来了\NJimmy, I'm sorry. I came as soon as I got here.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:39.08,2:45:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-你今天早上到的  -不是\N- You got in this morning. - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:40.99,2:45:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天下午才到的\NI got here this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:42.19,2:45:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素在克林顿港办事  我得等他\NRussell had business in Port Clinton. I had to wait for him.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:45.08,2:45:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他提醒了我  我忘记了\NHe reminded me. I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:46.70,2:45:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们马上赶来  我刚到\NSo, we had to come and as soon as we got here,
Dialogue: 0,2:45:48.85,2:45:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,就直接过来找你了\NI came right here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:50.48,2:45:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,没有对罗素不敬的意思\NAll due respect to Russ, you know,
Dialogue: 0,2:45:53.71,2:45:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但应该让人提前告诉我的\Nbut somebody should have come tell me, you know.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:56.63,2:46:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,最起码应该来告诉我时间推迟了\NJust come tell me it's 2:30, 2:40, at the very least.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:00.05,2:46:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你说得对  我是说...\NYou're not incorrect. I mean...
Dialogue: 0,2:46:01.71,2:46:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,普罗算哪根葱  还派个狗腿子过来\NWho the fuck is Pro? He sends a fucking errand boy here.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:05.83,2:46:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会待太久\NHe ain't stayin'.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:06.96,2:46:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他不会待太久\NI know he ain't staying.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:08.09,2:46:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,关键不在于他待多久\NThat's not the point, he's staying or not staying.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:10.19,2:46:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,关键在于普罗派他过来\NThe point is Pro sent him.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:12.03,2:46:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗\NYou know?
Dialogue: 0,2:46:12.87,2:46:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,关键是他应该亲自来接我\NPoint is, he should've come picked me up himself.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:14.65,2:46:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是问题的关键\NThat's the point I'm makin'.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:19.46,2:46:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你戴着这副眼镜能看得清吗\NCan you even see out of those glasses?
Dialogue: 0,2:46:22.66,2:46:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都看不清\NI can't see a fucking thing.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:24.55,2:46:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  幸好不是你开车\NThat's good. I'm glad you're not driving, then.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:35.71,2:46:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,就在这...这边\NYeah, it's right... It's right up...
Dialogue: 0,2:46:37.79,2:46:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,就在这边  这边\NIt's right up here. Right... Right up...
Dialogue: 0,2:46:39.83,2:46:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有楼梯的那房子\NThat building with the staircase.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:43.32,2:46:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你带家伙了吗\NYou got your friend with you?
Dialogue: 0,2:46:44.97,2:46:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-带了  -很好\N- Right here. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:47.33,2:46:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道这个龟孙会做出什么事\NYou never know with this cocksucker,
Dialogue: 0,2:46:49.28,2:46:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不管罗素在不在场\Nwith or without Russ there.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:30.50,2:47:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,快走  弗兰克  快\NLet's get outta here, Frank. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:55.82,2:49:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? Before the light ?
Dialogue: 0,2:48:55.82,2:49:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}In The Still Of The Night - The Five Satins
Dialogue: 0,2:49:01.93,2:49:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? Hold me again ?
Dialogue: 0,2:49:04.97,2:49:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? With all of your might ?
Dialogue: 0,2:49:07.08,2:49:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? In the still of the night ?
Dialogue: 0,2:49:10.95,2:49:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? In the still of the night ?
Dialogue: 0,2:49:48.27,2:49:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? So before the light ?
Dialogue: 0,2:49:54.73,2:49:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? Hold me again ?
Dialogue: 0,2:49:57.85,2:49:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? With all of your might ?
Dialogue: 0,2:49:59.91,2:50:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? In the still of the night ?
Dialogue: 0,2:50:02.92,2:50:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? In the still of the night ?
Dialogue: 0,2:50:07.96,2:50:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,卡车司机工会前主席詹姆斯·霍法\NJames Hoffa, former president of the Teamsters Union,
Dialogue: 0,2:50:10.56,2:50:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,于周三失踪\Ndisappeared on Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:11.91,2:50:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,截至今晚  尚未发现他的踪迹\NAnd as of tonight, no trace of him has been found.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:15.22,2:50:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,霍法在监狱服刑四年  他坦承\NHoffa spent four years in prison and made no bones
Dialogue: 0,2:50:18.00,2:50:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-自己打算...  -弗兰克\N- about his intention... - Frank.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:19.43,2:50:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,从他的继任弗兰克·菲茨西蒙斯手上\N...to get the presidency back from his successor,
Dialogue: 0,2:50:21.65,2:50:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,夺回主席之位\NFrank Fitzsimmons.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:22.91,2:50:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,菲茨西蒙斯的儿子是副主席...\NFitzsimmons' son is the vice president of...
Dialogue: 0,2:50:24.95,2:50:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,还没消息吗\NStill nothing?
Dialogue: 0,2:50:27.38,2:50:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,小菲茨西蒙斯的车被炸了  他当时不在车内\N...young Fitzsimmons' car was bombed. He was not in it.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:30.39,2:50:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但底特律地方工会内确有不和\NBut there is bad blood in the Detroit Local.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:33.79,2:50:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,霍法于周三下午失踪\NHoffa disappeared Wednesday afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:36.74,2:50:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,目前已过去48个小时  仍然不清楚\NNow, more than 48 hours later, with no word yet
Dialogue: 0,2:50:40.07,2:50:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,霍法出了什么事  警方对此极为关切\Non what happened to Hoffa, police are extremely concerned.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:44.07,2:50:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,当局急于弄清楚\NAuthorities are most anxious to find whom
Dialogue: 0,2:50:46.37,2:50:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,霍法在红狐餐厅外见的是谁\NHoffa was supposed to meet outside the Red Fox restaurant
Dialogue: 0,2:50:49.61,2:50:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那是最后有人看到他的地方\Nwhere he was last seen.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:51.83,2:50:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,警方认为可能是安东尼·加卡罗内\NPolice think it could have been a man named Anthony Giacalone,
Dialogue: 0,2:50:55.43,2:50:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他被称为底特律黑手党的大佬\Ndescribed as a big man in the Detroit Mafia.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:58.09,2:51:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,霍法的儿子詹姆斯今天试图联系加卡罗内\NHoffa's son, James, tried to contact Giacalone today,
Dialogue: 0,2:51:01.47,2:51:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但没能联系上\Nbut didn't succeed.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:02.80,2:51:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,霍法的亲朋好友今天留在\NHoffa's family and friends stayed
Dialogue: 0,2:51:04.94,2:51:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,位于湖口镇的家中\Nin the family home in Lake Orion today...
Dialogue: 0,2:51:06.98,2:51:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该打给约\NI should call Jo.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:10.50,2:51:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你还没有打给约吗\NYou haven't called Jo yet?
Dialogue: 0,2:51:19.22,2:51:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\NWhy?
Dialogue: 0,2:51:20.71,2:51:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,2:51:22.80,2:51:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\NWhy?
Dialogue: 0,2:51:25.35,2:51:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,什么为什么\NWhy what?
Dialogue: 0,2:51:28.42,2:51:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么还没有打给约\NWhy haven't you called Jo?
Dialogue: 0,2:51:30.57,2:51:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,有人索要赎金之类的吗\NHas anybody come forward with a ransom demand or anything like that?
Dialogue: 0,2:51:34.05,2:51:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,目前还没有\NNot as of yet.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:35.33,2:51:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为这起绑架是为了索要赎金吗\NDo you think the abduction was for ransom?
Dialogue: 0,2:51:38.44,2:51:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在打给她\NI'm gonna call her now.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:41.36,2:51:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为这起绑架\NDo you think the abduction
Dialogue: 0,2:51:42.36,2:51:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,和他所在的299号地方工会\Nhad anything to do with the recent conflicts
Dialogue: 0,2:51:45.52,2:51:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,最近的内部冲突有关吗\Nwithin Local 299, his own Local?
Dialogue: 0,2:51:47.48,2:51:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为工会政治\NI think the union politics
Dialogue: 0,2:51:49.95,2:51:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,当然是需要进行调查的\Nis certainly something that has to be investigated.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:51.87,2:51:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,国际卡车司机工会的一位高层人士\NOne high official of the Teamsters International
Dialogue: 0,2:51:54.41,2:51:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,声称他担心发生了最坏的事\Nsays he fears the worst,
Dialogue: 0,2:51:56.20,2:51:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,即霍法可能已经被杀\Nthat Hoffa may have been killed.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:59.04,2:52:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,全国广播公司新闻频道的罗伯特·哈格\NRobert Hager, NBC News,
Dialogue: 0,2:52:00.84,2:52:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,在密歇根州布隆菲尔德为您报道\NBloomfield, Michigan.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:03.79,2:52:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,底特律外的一处卡车休息站\NAt a truck stop outside Detroit,
Dialogue: 0,2:52:05.72,2:52:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,霍法在这升任卡车司机工会主席\Nwhere Hoffa rose to the top in the Teamsters Union,
Dialogue: 0,2:52:08.75,2:52:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,站内的卡车司机们众说纷纭\Ntruck drivers had a variety of theories...
Dialogue: 0,2:52:11.08,2:52:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,她自那天后就没和我说过话\NShe stopped talking to me that day.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:13.87,2:52:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,1975年8月3日\NAugust 3rd, 1975.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:18.37,2:52:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,她现在有份好工作  住在费城外\NShe's got a good job now and lives just outside Philly.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:23.68,2:52:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但我的女儿\NBut my daughter...
Dialogue: 0,2:52:26.17,2:52:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,佩琪\NPeggy...
Dialogue: 0,2:52:28.13,2:52:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,自那天后\Ndisappeared...
Dialogue: 0,2:52:30.68,2:52:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,就从我的生命中消失了\Nfrom my life that day.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:36.24,2:52:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\NHello.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:39.42,2:52:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-喂  -喂\N- Hello. - Hello?
Dialogue: 0,2:52:41.18,2:52:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,约\NJo.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:42.15,2:52:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,约\NJo?
Dialogue: 0,2:52:44.14,2:52:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是关于...\NIt's... It's...
Dialogue: 0,2:52:45.66,2:52:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-弗兰克  是你吗  -是我\N- Frank. Frank? - Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:49.03,2:52:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗯  -我不...\N- Yeah... - I don't...
Dialogue: 0,2:52:51.81,2:52:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-听着  我...  -弗兰克\N- Look, I... - Frank...
Dialogue: 0,2:52:54.74,2:52:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得他还活着吗\NDo you think... Do you think he's alive?
Dialogue: 0,2:52:59.97,2:53:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定还活着\NHe's gotta be.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:02.56,2:53:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你得乐观一点\NYou know, you gotta think positively.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:04.41,2:53:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,还没过很久...\NIt's just, you know, it ain't that long. It's just...
Dialogue: 0,2:53:06.63,2:53:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但你...\NBut do you...
Dialogue: 0,2:53:08.33,2:53:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他现在还好吗\NDo you know he's okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:53:09.79,2:53:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不  你了解我的  我...\NNo, no, no, I mean, you know me, I...
Dialogue: 0,2:53:12.50,2:53:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他可能干了"香蕉乔"那样的事\NHe maybe did something like the Joe Bananas thing,
Dialogue: 0,2:53:12.52,2:53:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an3\pos(380,235)}美国黑手党"第一教父"\N约瑟夫·博南诺的外号
Dialogue: 0,2:53:15.29,2:53:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,把自己绑架了\Nwhere, you know, he had himself kidnapped
Dialogue: 0,2:53:18.57,2:53:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,然后毫发无损地回来了\Nand then came back, but he wasn't hurt, nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:21.79,2:53:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他\NMaybe he...
Dialogue: 0,2:53:23.93,2:53:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他只是想\NMaybe he just felt, you know,
Dialogue: 0,2:53:25.01,2:53:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,清理一下自己的思绪\Nhe wanted to clear his head a bit.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:26.87,2:53:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但你得相信...\NBut you gotta just think that it's gonna be...
Dialogue: 0,2:53:29.81,2:53:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不会有事的\NIt's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:32.04,2:53:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不会有事的\NIt's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:35.24,2:53:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会...\NHe's gonna be...
Dialogue: 0,2:53:38.28,2:53:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么需要的话尽管找我\NIf you need anything, I'm here for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:40.72,2:53:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,任何事都行\NAnything. Anything.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:43.99,2:53:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以...可以再打给我吗\NCan you just... Can you call me again?
Dialogue: 0,2:53:45.90,2:53:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好  我会...会打给你的\NYeah, I'll call... I'll call you.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:49.60,2:53:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好  我会打给你的\NYeah, I'll... I'll call you.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:52.34,2:53:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我明早打给你\NI'll check in with you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:54.32,2:53:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好  明天打给我\NYes, call me tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:56.06,2:53:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好  我明早打给你  好吗\NOkay. I'll call you in the morning, okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:53:58.49,2:53:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你保证吗\NPromise?
Dialogue: 0,2:53:59.51,2:54:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心  坚强点\NDon't worry. Be strong.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:01.42,2:54:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,乐观点  好吗\NBe positive, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:54:03.69,2:54:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  约  好了\NOkay, Jo, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:06.99,2:54:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:08.31,2:54:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-好  -我晚点再打给你  再见\N- Okay. - Talk to ya a little later. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:10.16,2:54:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-再见  -再见  弗兰克\N- Bye. - Goodbye, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:11.19,2:55:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这么简单\NIt was no more complicated than that.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:15.96,2:55:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,希兰先生\NMr. Sheeran,
Dialogue: 0,2:55:17.82,2:55:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道是否有人  是什么人\Ndo you know who, if anyone,
Dialogue: 0,2:55:20.14,2:55:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,绑架了詹姆斯·霍法吗\Nwas behind the disappearance of James Hoffa?
Dialogue: 0,2:55:22.93,2:55:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,跟吉米有关系的人\NEverybody who ever had anything to do with Jimmy
Dialogue: 0,2:55:26.52,2:55:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,都被传唤进行问询\Nwas hauled in and questioned.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:28.40,2:55:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,根据律师的建议\NOn the advice of counsel,
Dialogue: 0,2:55:29.35,2:55:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,恕我拒绝回答这个问题\NI respectfully decline to answer that question
Dialogue: 0,2:55:31.51,2:55:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这可能会使我负罪\Non the grounds that it might tend to incriminate me.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:33.89,2:55:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  我换个问题\NOkay, let me ask you this:
Dialogue: 0,2:55:36.18,2:55:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我的笔是什么颜色\Nwhat color is my pen?
Dialogue: 0,2:55:40.05,2:55:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都行使第五修正案拒绝回答\NAnd everybody took the Fifth.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:41.26,2:55:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,在那种情况下  只能这么做\NI mean, in that situation, that's what you do.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:44.47,2:55:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不然还能怎么做呢\NWhat else are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,2:55:45.85,2:55:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,然而所有人都因某件事被控告和定罪\NStill, everybody got indicted or convicted on one thing or another,
Dialogue: 0,2:55:50.43,2:55:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但不是因为那件事\Nbut not that.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:51.72,2:55:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不是因为吉米\NNot about Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:53.14,2:55:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,如你所知  没有人因为这件事入狱\NNobody, as you know, even went to jail for that.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:56.10,2:55:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有人松口  这不常见\NAnd nobody talked, which is unusual,
Dialogue: 0,2:55:58.18,2:56:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,因为通常来说  三个人守不住秘密\N'cause usually, three people can keep a secret
Dialogue: 0,2:56:00.85,2:56:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,除非另外两人不在人世\Nonly when two of them are dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:04.72,2:56:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁诺·邓赞塔和马尔科·罗西\NBruno Denzetta and Marco Rossi,
Dialogue: 0,2:56:07.30,2:56:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他们因敲诈一家货运公司而分别被判刑二十年\Nthey got 20 years each for shaking down a trucking company.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:11.89,2:56:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,普罗和他们一起被判刑\NPro was convicted with them,
Dialogue: 0,2:56:13.47,2:56:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但他早就因为\Nbut he was already back in school
Dialogue: 0,2:56:15.14,2:56:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前说过的另一件事进了监狱\Nfor that other matter I talked about before.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:17.72,2:56:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得可怜的工会财务\NWell, you remember that poor union treasurer,
Dialogue: 0,2:56:19.55,2:56:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,"三指"托尼吗  就是比普罗获得更多选票的那个\NTony "Three Fingers," who got more votes than Pro?
Dialogue: 0,2:56:22.51,2:56:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他们因此把他做掉了\NThey got him on that.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:24.01,2:56:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,小虫萨利动的手\NSally Bugs, you know, he did that one.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:33.26,2:56:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,有一天  有人看见小虫走进了政府大楼\NOne day, Bugs was seen walking into the Federal building.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:38.10,2:56:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他做的事不是犯罪\NWhat he did itself ain't no crime.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:40.30,2:56:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,很多人都因为做了某事而被传唤\NI mean, a lot of people get called in for things.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:43.35,2:56:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但萨利明白事理\NBut Sally knows better.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:45.51,2:56:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他怎么会什么都没告诉别人呢\NHow come he didn't say anything to anybody?
Dialogue: 0,2:56:49.05,2:56:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他一句话都没跟别人说\NHe didn't tell anybody one word.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:51.51,2:56:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,一句话都没有\NNot one word.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:53.93,2:56:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,可以肯定的是\NAnd one thing for sure,
Dialogue: 0,2:56:56.68,2:56:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他去那里不是为了吃午餐的\Nhe didn't go there for fucking lunch.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:11.93,2:57:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,萨利\NSally.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:13.72,2:57:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-你好吗  -你好啊  爱尔兰人\N- What's good? - Hey, Irish.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:27.93,2:57:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,后来才知道萨利确实跟别人说了\NTurns out Sally did tell somebody
Dialogue: 0,2:57:29.72,2:57:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他要去那里办事\Nhe had to go in there for something.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:31.51,2:57:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,只不过对方忘了告诉别人\NThey just forgot to tell somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:33.10,2:57:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们杀错人了\NSo it was a bad hit.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:38.22,2:57:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米的儿子查奇  他的养子\NJimmy's son, Chuckie, you know, his foster son,
Dialogue: 0,2:57:40.43,2:57:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,也参与了这件事\Nwas in the thing, too,
Dialogue: 0,2:57:41.93,2:57:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但他并不知情\Nbut he didn't know it.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:44.39,2:57:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,查奇只知道他要接\NAll Chuckie knew was he was pickin' up
Dialogue: 0,2:57:46.51,2:57:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我和一个普罗的人\None of Pro's guys and me,
Dialogue: 0,2:57:48.26,2:57:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们要一起到红狐餐厅\Nand we was all gonna pick up his dad
Dialogue: 0,2:57:50.39,2:57:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,接他爸去开会\Nat the Red Fox for a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:53.01,2:57:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他参与了这件事  没错\NWell, I mean, he was in it, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,2:57:54.47,2:57:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可以这么说  但他是糊里糊涂的\Nyou could say that, but stupidly.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:57.47,2:58:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直对查奇心怀愧疚\NI... I always felt sorry for Chuckie in this whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:00.30,2:58:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在仍然很愧疚\NAnd I... I still do.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:02.10,2:58:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,联调局因为一台车的破事\NAnd the Feds gave him ten months
Dialogue: 0,2:58:03.76,2:58:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,让他被判刑十个月  事情大概就是这样\Nfor some bullshit thing about a car, and that's about it.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:06.43,2:58:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道是在搞什么\NWho knows what the fuck...
Dialogue: 0,2:58:09.80,2:58:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,胖子托尼·萨雷诺因为所得税的事情被抓\NFat Tony Salerno, they got on an income tax thing.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:14.01,2:58:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不久之后\NA little while after,
Dialogue: 0,2:58:14.97,2:58:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他被查出患有前列腺癌\Nhe was diagnosed with prostate cancer.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:21.39,2:58:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,北加州有一家\NThere's a... a pork store up in...
Dialogue: 0,2:58:26.60,2:58:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,猪肉店\Nnorthern California.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:29.85,2:58:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就在\NRight around...
Dialogue: 0,2:58:32.30,2:58:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,核桃溪市边上\NWalnut Creek.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:33.22,2:58:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你是从那里来的  对吧\NYou're from up there, ain't you?
Dialogue: 0,2:58:35.18,2:58:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-对  -嗯\N- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:36.72,2:58:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能还认识店主\NAnd you might even know the guy that runs it.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:39.55,2:58:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,其实  我想让你帮个忙\NActually, I'm looking for a little favor...
Dialogue: 0,2:58:42.22,2:58:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,帮他  不是帮我\Nfor him, not for me.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:45.01,2:58:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你能不能帮他弄张机票  比如去澳大利亚的\NBut if you can get him a ticket, like, to Australia...
Dialogue: 0,2:58:50.30,2:58:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂我的意思\NYou know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:54.14,2:58:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:56.72,2:58:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意帮他出国吗\NYou want to help him get down there?
Dialogue: 0,2:59:04.30,2:59:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,愿意\NYe... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:05.51,2:59:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素被抓了\NNow, Russell, he got pinched
Dialogue: 0,2:59:07.30,2:59:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,因为杰克·拿波里从他那赊账\Nfor telling Jimmy the Weasel to strangle Jack Napoli
Dialogue: 0,2:59:09.93,2:59:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,拿走了价值两万五的珠宝却没还钱\Nover some beef about 25 grand of jewelry
Dialogue: 0,2:59:12.72,2:59:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,于是他让黄鼠狼吉米\Nthat Jack took on credit from Russell
Dialogue: 0,2:59:15.26,2:59:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,去把杰克勒死\Nand then he never paid for.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:17.43,2:59:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能对罗素做这样的事\NNow, with Russ, you don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:20.85,2:59:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,问题在于  黄鼠狼叛变了\NSo, only thing is, the Weasel, he flipped.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:24.14,2:59:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他身上带了窃听器\NHe had a wire on him.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:26.01,2:59:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他们声称他"密谋杀害目击者"\NThey called it "conspiracy to kill a witness."
Dialogue: 0,2:59:28.64,2:59:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,显而易见的是\NIt was obvious to everybody else
Dialogue: 0,2:59:29.93,2:59:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,拿波里做得不对\Nthat Napoli was clearly in the wrong.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:31.76,2:59:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这难道不明显吗\NI mean, how could you not see that?
Dialogue: 0,2:59:33.97,2:59:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他陷害了他  这是诱捕\NHe set him up. It was entrapment.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:35.85,2:59:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,难道不是吗\NWhat else could you call it?
Dialogue: 0,2:59:37.43,2:59:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但这件事我现在也不想细说\NBut that's another thing I don't wanna get into now.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:41.72,2:59:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,举起右手\NRaise your right hand.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:42.51,2:59:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他们把我送上法庭  指控我行贿和工会诈骗\NThey brought me up on bribery and labor racketeering charges
Dialogue: 0,2:59:45.89,2:59:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,还有其他一些我不知道的破事\Nand some other bullshit things I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:47.68,2:59:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}谋杀  谋杀未遂  恐吓  挪用公款  纵火
Dialogue: 0,2:59:48.35,2:59:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你是否向上帝发誓  你所说的全是事实\Nthe whole truth and nothing but the truth,
Dialogue: 0,2:59:50.18,2:59:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-没有任何隐瞒  -我发誓\N- so help you God? - I do.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:51.76,2:59:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你是否还告诉他们巴法先生\NDid you also tell them that Mr. Boffa
Dialogue: 0,2:59:53.89,2:59:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,送了你和你妻子豪车\Nhad given you and your wife luxury vehicles?
Dialogue: 0,2:59:56.01,2:59:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,科尔先生  我工作了44年\NMr. Cole, I worked for 44 years,
Dialogue: 0,2:59:59.26,3:00:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我没收过巴法或者别人的任何不法之财\NI never took one dime illegal off Boffa or nobody else.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:03.72,3:00:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么想是你的事  跟我没关系\NYou can think whatever you wanna think. Don't matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:06.18,3:00:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们能落实的罪名  只有我炸了一家吊车公司\NBut all they got me for was blowing up a crane company
Dialogue: 0,3:00:09.26,3:00:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那家公司开除了我的两个工会谈判代表\Nthat fired two of my shop stewards
Dialogue: 0,3:00:11.35,3:00:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,却没有正当的理由\Nfor no good reason.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:15.01,3:00:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,还有我的林肯汽车\NAnd... And my Lincoln.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:17.47,3:00:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我从尤金·巴法手里买下来的\NI mean, I bought that car from Eugene Boffa.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:20.97,3:00:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他向货运公司出租卡车司机\NHe leased truck drivers to freight companies,
Dialogue: 0,3:00:23.55,3:00:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,然后付给他们低于正常标准的工资\Nand then he paid them substandard wages.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:28.35,3:00:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说我买这辆车花的钱\NThey said I paid a lot less for the car
Dialogue: 0,3:00:30.60,3:00:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,远低于其价值\Nthan what it was worth.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:32.68,3:00:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说这辆车是贿赂\NThey said the car was a bribe.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:40.80,3:00:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱这辆车\NI... I... I loved that car.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:43.47,3:00:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但它不值得我为它坐十八年牢\NBut it wasn't worth the 18 years they gave me for it.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:47.47,3:00:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这是肯定的\NThat's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:53.39,3:00:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素中风了\NRussell, he had a stroke.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:55.80,3:00:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,胖托尼尿失禁了\NFat Tony, he couldn't control his urine no more.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:59.39,3:01:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我在安齐奥的散兵坑里得上的关节炎\NAnd my arthritis that started in the foxholes of Anzio
Dialogue: 0,3:01:04.01,3:01:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不断折磨着我的腰\Nwas eatin' away at my lower back now,
Dialogue: 0,3:01:06.64,3:01:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我的脚已经没什么知觉了\Nand I couldn't feel much in my feet no more.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:09.68,3:01:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要拄拐杖\NI needed a cane.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:10.80,3:01:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们不会在牢里给你配拐杖\NBut, you know, they're not gonna give you a cane in the can
Dialogue: 0,3:01:13.76,3:01:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他们怕你把它当作武器\Nbecause they say you're gonna use it as a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:16.68,3:01:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,有一种叫诺立汀的药\NThere was this medicine, Neurontin,
Dialogue: 0,3:01:18.43,3:01:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,对我有点帮助\Nit helped me a little bit,
Dialogue: 0,3:01:19.60,3:01:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但也会使你神经错乱\Nbut it also made you loopy.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:21.72,3:01:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他要打中了\NHe's got it!
Dialogue: 0,3:01:23.30,3:01:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他要打中了\NHe's got it!
Dialogue: 0,3:01:25.89,3:01:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在严寒中\NWe were all falling apart right there
Dialogue: 0,3:01:27.22,3:01:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,都要崩溃了\Nin the freezing fucking cold.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:28.89,3:01:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里就能看到  你现在怕了吗\NI can see it from here. You getting scared now?
Dialogue: 0,3:01:30.76,3:01:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你再练个十年\NYeah, you stay here another fucking ten years,
Dialogue: 0,3:01:32.68,3:01:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,才有可能赢我\Nyou'll beat me.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:43.01,3:01:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这是好喝的葡萄汁吗\NIs this the good grape juice?
Dialogue: 0,3:01:57.64,3:01:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我吃不了这个\NI can't eat it.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:59.51,3:02:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-吃一口  -我没牙  吃不了\N- Take a bite. - I got no teeth. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:01.22,3:02:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,给我一小块\NPut a little piece.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:03.01,3:02:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,一小块就好  谢谢\NJust a little piece, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:04.43,3:02:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,还要吗\NThat's it?
Dialogue: 0,3:02:18.97,3:02:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-好吃吧  -好吃\N- E buono, no? - Buono.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:21.30,3:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好吃\NBuono.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:27.10,3:02:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米是个好人\NJimmy was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:29.30,3:02:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他还有美满的家庭  不是吗\NYou know? He had a nice family too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,3:02:34.68,3:02:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  我知道\NYeah. Yeah. I know.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:38.14,3:02:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没想过要把事情做这么绝\NI never wanted it to go that far.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:49.76,3:02:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我为了我们的利益而放弃了他\NI picked us over him.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:53.43,3:02:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,去他们的\NFuck 'em.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:55.64,3:02:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,去他们的\NFuck 'em.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:58.64,3:02:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,去他们的\NFuck 'em.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:05.60,3:03:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,吃吧  小子  吃吧\NMangia che cresci... figlio mio, mangia.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:24.43,3:03:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素\NHey, Russ.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:25.72,3:03:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克\NHey, Frankie.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:27.01,3:03:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-你要去哪  -什么\N- Where you goin'? - What?
Dialogue: 0,3:03:28.85,3:03:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-你要去哪  -我要去教堂\N- Where you goin'? - I'm going to church.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:31.89,3:03:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,教堂\NChurch?
Dialogue: 0,3:03:33.30,3:03:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,别笑  到时你就知道了\NDon't laugh, you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:35.01,3:03:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,别笑\NDon't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:36.72,3:03:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,到时你就知道了\NYou'll see.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:45.80,3:03:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素去了教堂\NRussell went to church.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:49.72,3:03:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,后来他去了监狱的医院\NThen he went to the prison hospital.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:55.14,3:03:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,再后来他进了坟墓\NAnd... And then he went to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:01.30,3:04:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,主耶稣基督\NLord Jesus Christ...
Dialogue: 0,3:04:04.43,3:04:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我在那年的十月出狱了\NI got out that October.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:06.35,3:04:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,琳妮在十二月去世了\NReenie died in December.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:08.80,3:04:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,准确地说是12月23日\NOn December 23rd, to be exact.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:11.93,3:04:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,肺癌\NLung cancer.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:13.60,3:04:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,一点也不意外\NNo surprise.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:15.76,3:04:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,即使夺去了我们必死的身躯\N...even as it claims our mortal bodies.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:18.93,3:04:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们的姐妹在此安眠\NGrant that our sister may sleep here in peace,
Dialogue: 0,3:04:21.80,3:04:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,直至您用荣光将她唤醒\Nuntil you awaken her to glory.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:24.80,3:04:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,因为您就是复苏和生命\NFor you are the resurrection and the life.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:27.55,3:04:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,然后她将与您面对面\NAnd then she will see you face to face,
Dialogue: 0,3:04:30.18,3:04:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,在您的光明中看见光明\Nand in your light will see light,
Dialogue: 0,3:04:32.68,3:04:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,感受上帝的光辉  直到永远\Nand know the splendor of God for ever and ever.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:37.26,3:04:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,阿门\NAmen.
Dialogue: 0,3:05:11.26,3:05:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这个赛季他的击打率比生涯平均的29.6%\N...six points shy of his career average of .296
Dialogue: 0,3:05:16.26,3:05:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,低了六个百分点\Ncoming into this season.
Dialogue: 0,3:05:17.89,3:05:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,费城队阵容里前四位击球员\NTop four batters in this lineup for Philadelphia
Dialogue: 0,3:05:20.68,3:05:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,都是左右手都能打的\Ntoday are all switch hitters.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:16.76,3:06:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,使一些政策制定者失望的是\NMuch to the frustration of some policy makers,
Dialogue: 0,3:06:19.39,3:06:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,北约军事领导人不会冒险\NNATO military leaders will not risk
Dialogue: 0,3:06:22.22,3:06:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,对科索沃的塞尔维亚军队发动低空袭击\Nlow flying attacks on Serb troops in Kosovo.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:27.05,3:06:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,还需要进行多日的系统轰炸\NIt could take days more of systematic bombing,
Dialogue: 0,3:06:30.35,3:06:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是因为塞尔维亚人\Nespecially since the Serbs
Dialogue: 0,3:06:31.68,3:06:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,将很多防空导弹藏了起来\Nhave hidden so many of their anti-aircraft missiles,
Dialogue: 0,3:06:34.85,3:06:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,想引诱北约军队进行低空空袭\Nin essence, daring NATO to fly low.
Dialogue: 0,3:07:00.72,3:07:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你去吧  去吧\NYou go... you go there. Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,3:07:03.47,3:07:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧\NYeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,3:07:11.05,3:07:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}暂停营业\N请到隔壁柜台
Dialogue: 0,3:07:13.89,3:07:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,佩琪\NPeggy.
Dialogue: 0,3:07:14.97,3:07:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,佩琪  我只是想和你聊聊\NPeggy. I just want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,3:07:39.35,3:07:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是  我...\NI just, you know... I...
Dialogue: 0,3:07:41.30,3:07:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,她走开了\NShe walked away.
Dialogue: 0,3:07:43.85,3:07:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道她生我的气  但我想...\NI know she's mad at me and all, but I... I want...
Dialogue: 0,3:07:46.55,3:07:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,打给她  打给她  我只是想和她聊聊\NCall her. Call her. I just want to talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,3:07:50.76,3:07:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,和她聊什么呢\NTalk to her and tell her what?
Dialogue: 0,3:07:52.93,3:07:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\NWhat...
Dialogue: 0,3:07:54.39,3:07:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想跟她道个歉  仅此而已\NI just want to say I'm sorry. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,3:07:58.05,3:07:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么道歉\NFor?
Dialogue: 0,3:08:01.55,3:08:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\NLook...
Dialogue: 0,3:08:03.76,3:08:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我不是个好父亲  我知道\NI know I wasn't a... a good dad. I know that.
Dialogue: 0,3:08:06.89,3:08:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道  我只是想保护她\NI know that. I was just trying to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,3:08:09.60,3:08:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,保护你们每个人不受伤害\NProtect all of youse.
Dialogue: 0,3:08:10.72,3:08:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是我做的事\NI mean, that's what I was doing. That's...
Dialogue: 0,3:08:14.26,3:08:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,受什么伤害\NFrom what?
Dialogue: 0,3:08:16.51,3:08:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,一切事情\NWell, everything.
Dialogue: 0,3:08:18.10,3:08:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说\NI mean...
Dialogue: 0,3:08:19.47,3:08:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,某种程度上  你们以前过着受保护的生活\NYou... Youse had a sheltered life, in a way,
Dialogue: 0,3:08:23.14,3:08:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你们没见过我所见过的事\Nbecause you didn't see what I see
Dialogue: 0,3:08:25.01,3:08:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,没经历过我所经历的事\Nand what I've been through.
Dialogue: 0,3:08:28.18,3:08:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,外面有很多坏人\NThere's a lot of bad people out there.
Dialogue: 0,3:08:31.14,3:08:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我还能做什么\NWhat else am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,3:08:33.43,3:08:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,爸  你根本不知道我们以前的感受\NDaddy, you have no idea what it was like for us.
Dialogue: 0,3:08:37.60,3:08:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们出了问题没法找你\NI mean, we couldn't go to you with a problem
Dialogue: 0,3:08:39.26,3:08:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,怕你会做不好的事\N'cause of what you would do.
Dialogue: 0,3:08:40.85,3:08:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没法向你寻求保护\NYou know, we couldn't come to you for protection
Dialogue: 0,3:08:43.26,3:08:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你会做可怕的事\Nbecause of the terrible things that you would do.
Dialogue: 0,3:08:48.47,3:08:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是  只是\NI was just... I was...
Dialogue: 0,3:08:49.47,3:08:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不想看你们受到伤害  仅此而已\NI didn't want to see youse get hurt, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,3:08:57.10,3:08:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们读到过  听说过很多我的事情\NI know you read a lot of things about me, heard about me.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:00.18,3:09:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\NI'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:01.76,3:09:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我...\NI...
Dialogue: 0,3:09:04.85,3:09:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在能做些什么来补偿你们吗\NCan I do anything now to make it up to you?
Dialogue: 0,3:09:19.76,3:09:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想要奢华一点的\NIf you're looking for something with a little bit more luxury,
Dialogue: 0,3:09:22.18,3:09:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有这两款\Nwe have these two models over here.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:24.39,3:09:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,它们就像棺材界的凯迪拉克\NThey're like the Cadillacs of caskets.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:27.05,3:09:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你要火化的话\NNow, if we puttin' you in the fuckin' oven,
Dialogue: 0,3:09:28.68,3:09:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,用什么棺材其实都无所谓\Nit really doesn't matter what you go in.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:30.97,3:09:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,越便宜越好\NThe cheapest shit possible.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:32.55,3:09:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,复合板就够了\NParticle board, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:34.51,3:09:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,后事打算怎么办  火葬吗\NWhat are we doin' today? Are we doin' a cremation?
Dialogue: 0,3:09:37.68,3:09:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-土葬  -土葬\N- A burial. - Burial?
Dialogue: 0,3:09:40.35,3:09:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是男人还是女人\NIs it for a man or for a woman?
Dialogue: 0,3:09:42.01,3:09:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是我\NMe.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:44.05,3:09:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,靠\NShit.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:49.55,3:09:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,有喜欢的吗\NYou see anything you like?
Dialogue: 0,3:10:02.26,3:10:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-那个绿色的  -那个很漂亮\N- That green one. - That's a beauty.
Dialogue: 0,3:10:04.39,3:10:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你今天就买的话\NThat one'll set you back about $7,500
Dialogue: 0,3:10:06.64,3:10:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大概要七千五百块\Nif you take it home today.
Dialogue: 0,3:10:08.97,3:10:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\NWhat do you think?
Dialogue: 0,3:10:11.47,3:10:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,能便宜点吗\NCan you do any better?
Dialogue: 0,3:10:13.55,3:10:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计  你想在这棺材里长眠是吧\NI mean, buddy, this is what you want to go home in, no?
Dialogue: 0,3:10:19.85,3:10:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那就算你六千吧  怎么样\NI think we could go six on that for you. How about that?
Dialogue: 0,3:10:23.05,3:10:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-六千现金  行吗  -可以\N- Six flat cash work for you? - That's good.
Dialogue: 0,3:10:26.55,3:10:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,可以\NGood for me.
Dialogue: 0,3:10:47.55,3:10:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,迟早\NSooner or later,
Dialogue: 0,3:10:49.30,3:10:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这世上每一个人都有离开的那天\Neverybody put here has a date when he's gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,3:10:52.39,3:10:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,人生就是如此\NThat's just the way it is.
Dialogue: 0,3:10:55.14,3:10:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为离开的时候肯定会发生什么\NAnd I think there's gotta be something when you go
Dialogue: 0,3:10:59.76,3:11:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不然  这一切到底是怎么开始的\N'cause, I mean, how the hell did this whole thing start?
Dialogue: 0,3:11:08.10,3:11:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,比我聪明的人都没搞清楚\NPeople smarter than me can't figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,3:11:10.60,3:11:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我绝对不会选择火葬\NThat's why I would never go for cremation
Dialogue: 0,3:11:12.43,3:11:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那就真的结束了\Nbecause it's so... it's so final.
Dialogue: 0,3:11:16.68,3:11:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这个\NThis... This one.
Dialogue: 0,3:11:19.60,3:11:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,1948号\N1948.
Dialogue: 0,3:11:22.18,3:11:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,对埋葬你的人来说最难接受的\NThat's the hardest part of anybody when they bury youse,
Dialogue: 0,3:11:25.22,3:11:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,就是入土的时候\Nis when they go into the ground
Dialogue: 0,3:11:27.10,3:11:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那就真的结束了\Nbecause it's... it's so final.
Dialogue: 0,3:11:30.72,3:11:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你要埋在房子里  房子还在\NIf you go into a building, the building's there.
Dialogue: 0,3:11:33.18,3:11:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,墓还在\NThe crypt is there.
Dialogue: 0,3:11:34.68,3:11:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要用金属棺材\NIt has to be a metal casket,
Dialogue: 0,3:11:36.30,3:11:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他们把你放在房间里\Nand they have you in the room.
Dialogue: 0,3:11:38.51,3:11:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,都放好\NAnd all that there.
Dialogue: 0,3:11:39.97,3:11:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,就不算完全结束了\NIt's just not as final.
Dialogue: 0,3:11:41.26,3:11:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你死了  但还没结束\NYou're dead, but it ain't that final.
Dialogue: 0,3:11:47.39,3:11:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  如果你们想谈霍法先生的事\NI'm sorry, but I gotta direct youse to my attorney,
Dialogue: 0,3:11:51.64,3:11:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我就得\NMr. Ragano...
Dialogue: 0,3:11:54.72,3:11:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,请你们去找我的律师\Nif youse want to talk about Mr. Hoffa or...
Dialogue: 0,3:11:57.85,3:11:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,雷加诺先生\Nor any matter, for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,3:11:59.93,3:12:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有别的可说的\NI got noth... nothing new to say.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:02.89,3:12:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他死了\NHe's dead.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:04.89,3:12:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,谁死了\NWho's dead?
Dialogue: 0,3:12:06.55,3:12:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你的律师  雷加诺先生\NYour attorney, Mr. Ragano.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:08.10,3:12:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-他死了  -是的\N- He's dead? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:08.97,3:12:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谁干的\NWho did it?
Dialogue: 0,3:12:11.89,3:12:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,癌症\NCancer.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:15.68,3:12:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都死了  希兰先生\NEverybody's dead, Mr. Sheeran.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:19.39,3:12:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了\NIt's over.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:21.05,3:12:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都死了\NThey're all gone.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:22.47,3:12:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,罗素  安吉洛  萨雷诺\NRussell, Angelo, Salerno,
Dialogue: 0,3:12:24.80,3:12:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,普罗  多夫曼  小虫萨利\NPro, Dorfman, Sally Bugs.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:27.14,3:12:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都死了\NThey're gone.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:29.93,3:12:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你在保护谁\NWho are you protecting?
Dialogue: 0,3:12:33.39,3:12:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道谁没死吗\NYou know who's not gone?
Dialogue: 0,3:12:36.30,3:12:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,霍法先生的家人  他的孩子们\NMr. Hoffa's family. His children.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:39.18,3:12:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他们还活着  他们一辈子都得不到真相\NThey're here. And they gotta live not knowing.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:43.64,3:12:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那很难熬\NThat's hard to do.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:47.76,3:12:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你也有孩子  弗兰克\NI mean, you got kids, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:50.05,3:12:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你能想象吗\NCan you imagine?
Dialogue: 0,3:12:56.80,3:13:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克  是时候了  该说出真相了\NFrank, it's time. It's time you say what happened.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:06.80,3:13:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你们看起来人不错\NYou seem like nice fellas.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:09.68,3:13:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢你们亲自来找我\NI appreciate youse coming to see me.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:12.55,3:13:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但我帮不了你们\NBut I... I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:18.18,3:13:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样吗\NThat's it?
Dialogue: 0,3:13:19.05,3:13:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样\NThat's it.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:26.97,3:13:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,圣母玛利亚\NHoly Mary, Mother of God...
Dialogue: 0,3:13:29.60,3:13:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,圣母玛利亚\NHoly Mary, Mother of God...
Dialogue: 0,3:13:30.93,3:13:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-请为我们这些罪人祈祷  -请为我们这些罪人祈祷\N- Pray for us sinners... - Pray for us sinners...
Dialogue: 0,3:13:33.55,3:13:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-现在和我们临终时  -现在和我们临终时\N- Now and at the hour of our death. - Now and at the hour of our death.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:37.22,3:13:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-阿门  -阿门\N- Amen. - Amen.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:41.64,3:13:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这...\NThat was...
Dialogue: 0,3:13:43.35,3:13:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这还不错\NThat wasn't too bad.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:45.18,3:13:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,很久没祷告过了\NIt's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:47.01,3:13:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很不错\NNot bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:48.10,3:13:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,真心实意的  发自内心\NAnd the intention was there. The intention.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:50.51,3:13:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\NI know.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:52.30,3:13:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你是发自内心的\NI know the intention is there.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:54.26,3:13:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是真的  神父\NIt was there, Father.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:57.30,3:13:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你对自己做过的事\NDo you feel anything for...
Dialogue: 0,3:13:59.43,3:14:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,有任何感觉吗\Nfor what you've done?
Dialogue: 0,3:14:05.18,3:14:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没有  不过也许...\NI, I don't. I mean, maybe that...
Dialogue: 0,3:14:09.55,3:14:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在坐在这里跟你说话\NBecause I'm here now talking to you,
Dialogue: 0,3:14:11.47,3:14:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,也许这本身就是\Nthat in itself is,
Dialogue: 0,3:14:13.51,3:14:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,一种尝试...\Nyou know, an attempt to...
Dialogue: 0,3:14:20.47,3:14:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但你真的一点感觉都没有吗\NBut you don't feel anything at all?
Dialogue: 0,3:14:25.39,3:14:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,3:14:28.97,3:14:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,都是过去的事了\NWater under the dam.
Dialogue: 0,3:14:35.10,3:14:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,对他的家人有没有愧疚呢\NAny... Any remorse for the families?
Dialogue: 0,3:14:39.43,3:14:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我不认识他的家人\NI... I didn't know the families.
Dialogue: 0,3:14:44.85,3:14:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我不认识他们  只认识一个\NI didn't know 'em. Except one I knew.
Dialogue: 0,3:14:52.68,3:14:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为我们可以悔过\NI think we can... we can be sorry...
Dialogue: 0,3:14:55.72,3:14:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以悔过  即使我们不觉得难过\NWe can be sorry even when we don't feel sorry.
Dialogue: 0,3:14:59.30,3:15:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以做出意志上的决定\NWell, for us to say, to make a decision of the will...
Dialogue: 0,3:15:02.30,3:15:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"上帝啊\N"God...
Dialogue: 0,3:15:03.97,3:15:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉  上帝\NI am sorry, God.
Dialogue: 0,3:15:07.35,3:15:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,原谅我"\NForgive me."
Dialogue: 0,3:15:09.51,3:15:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是意志上的决定\NAnd that... that's a decision of the will.
Dialogue: 0,3:15:20.10,3:15:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,什么样的人\NWhat kind of man
Dialogue: 0,3:15:23.30,3:15:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,会打那样一通电话\Nmakes a... a phone call like that?
Dialogue: 0,3:15:31.60,3:15:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思  什么电话\NWhat do you mean? What phone call?
Dialogue: 0,3:15:33.85,3:15:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能告诉你\NWell, I can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,3:15:38.51,3:15:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能  我得...\NI can't. I got...
Dialogue: 0,3:15:40.97,3:15:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系\NThat's okay.
Dialogue: 0,3:15:45.60,3:15:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克  你想再和我祷告一次吗\NFrank, do you wanna pray with me again?
Dialogue: 0,3:15:47.51,3:15:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,3:15:49.43,3:15:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这次我们用自己的话来说  好吗\NThis time, we'll do it in our own words. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,3:15:51.39,3:15:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,3:15:54.55,3:15:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝啊  我们来到您面前\NGod, we come before you
Dialogue: 0,3:15:57.26,3:15:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,罪孽深重  忧伤不已\Nsinful and sorrowful.
Dialogue: 0,3:15:59.85,3:16:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,罪孽深重  忧伤不已\NSinful and sorrowful.
Dialogue: 0,3:16:03.18,3:16:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道您善良仁慈\NWe know you are all good and all merciful.
Dialogue: 0,3:16:07.35,3:16:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道您善良仁慈\NWe know you are all good and all merciful.
Dialogue: 0,3:16:11.85,3:16:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们请求您  -我们请求您\N- We ask you... - We ask you...
Dialogue: 0,3:16:14.93,3:16:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,用您的眼光\Nto help us see ourselves...
Dialogue: 0,3:16:17.14,3:16:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,用您的眼光\Nto help us see ourselves...
Dialogue: 0,3:16:20.14,3:16:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-帮我们看清自己  -帮我们看清自己\N- as you see us. - as you see us.
Dialogue: 0,3:16:25.80,3:16:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我女儿  佩琪\NThat's my daughter, Peggy.
Dialogue: 0,3:16:27.80,3:16:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-是吗  -是的\N- Is it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,3:16:29.35,3:16:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像还没见过她\NI don't think I've met her yet.
Dialogue: 0,3:16:30.93,3:16:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,她不怎么过来\NWell, she... she ain't been around too much.
Dialogue: 0,3:16:34.01,3:16:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,她是你的独生女吗\NIs she your only child?
Dialogue: 0,3:16:35.64,3:16:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不是  我有四个女儿\NNo, I got four daughters.
Dialogue: 0,3:16:37.97,3:16:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你看\NOver there. See?
Dialogue: 0,3:16:39.76,3:16:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,真漂亮\NBeautiful.
Dialogue: 0,3:16:41.47,3:16:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-大忙人  -是啊\N- Busy man. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,3:16:45.05,3:16:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,3:16:47.18,3:16:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,她身旁是谁\NWho's that with her?
Dialogue: 0,3:16:49.93,3:16:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道这是谁\NYou don't know who that is?
Dialogue: 0,3:16:53.39,3:16:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,3:16:55.39,3:16:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米·霍法\NJimmy Hoffa.
Dialogue: 0,3:16:58.72,3:16:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是他啊\NOh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,3:16:59.47,3:17:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,得了吧  "是他啊"\NYeah, right, "Oh, yeah."
Dialogue: 0,3:17:02.97,3:17:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道他是谁\NYou don't know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,3:17:04.55,3:17:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  我不知道\NOkay, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,3:17:07.01,3:17:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  你想不到时间过得有多快\NYeah. Boy, you don't know how fast time goes by
Dialogue: 0,3:17:10.05,3:17:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了已经晚了\Nuntil you get there.
Dialogue: 0,3:17:12.35,3:17:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你不用担心这个\NBut you don't have to worry about that
Dialogue: 0,3:17:14.05,3:17:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你还有大把的好时光\Nbecause you have your whole life ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,3:17:16.85,3:17:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,长得很  时间过得太快...\NForever. It goes fast, time...
Dialogue: 0,3:17:19.68,3:17:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你说\NI'm tellin' ya.
Dialogue: 0,3:17:20.89,3:17:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我在给你量脉搏  希兰先生\NI'm trying to take your pulse, Mr. Sheeran.
Dialogue: 0,3:17:22.64,3:17:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,请不要说话\NPlease, please don't talk.
Dialogue: 0,3:17:26.26,3:17:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,今天很不错\NIt's great today.
Dialogue: 0,3:17:28.14,3:17:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我还活着\NI'm still alive?
Dialogue: 0,3:17:29.35,3:17:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-是的  -真是好消息\N- Yes, you are. - That's good to know.
Dialogue: 0,3:17:32.18,3:17:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,活得好好的\NAlive and well.
Dialogue: 0,3:17:33.60,3:17:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,现在没事了\NAnd you're free
Dialogue: 0,3:17:35.05,3:17:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不过晚些时候还要再给你检查一遍\Ntill later today when we have to put you through all this again.
Dialogue: 0,3:17:37.55,3:17:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪都不去\NI'm here.
Dialogue: 0,3:17:57.68,3:17:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,...教会之奉\N...ministry of the church.
Dialogue: 0,3:17:59.30,3:18:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,愿上帝赐予你宽恕与平静  弗兰克\NMay God grant you pardon and peace, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:02.35,3:18:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我赦免你的罪\NAnd I absolve you from your sins.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:03.55,3:18:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,以圣父  圣子\NIn the name of the Father, and of the Son,
Dialogue: 0,3:18:06.05,3:18:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,圣灵的名义  阿门\Nand of the Holy Spirit, amen.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:09.22,3:18:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢上帝  因为上帝仁慈\NGive thanks to the Lord, for he is good.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:12.05,3:18:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他的慈爱\NHis mercy...
Dialogue: 0,3:18:13.14,3:18:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-他的慈爱永远长存  -永远长存\N- His mercy endures forever. - endures forever.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:15.76,3:18:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  弗兰克  我很快就会再来看你\NAll right, Frank. I'll be back to visit, okay? Very soon.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:18.76,3:18:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,大概圣诞假期后\NProbably after the Christmas holidays.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:22.18,3:18:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:23.10,3:18:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-弗兰克  上帝保佑你  -你也是  谢谢\N- Frank, God bless you. - You too. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:28.14,3:18:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,圣诞节到了\NIt's Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,3:18:30.39,3:18:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,快了\NAlmost.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:32.47,3:18:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪也不去\NWell, I ain't going nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,3:18:36.80,3:18:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-神父  -怎么\N- Father? - Yup?
Dialogue: 0,3:18:39.47,3:18:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我个忙好吗\NDo me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,3:18:41.26,3:18:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,别把门关严  我不喜欢那样\NDon't shut the door all the way. I don't like that. Just...
Dialogue: 0,3:18:44.22,3:18:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-留一条缝  -好\N- leave it open a little bit. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,3:19:22.93,3:19:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}In the Still of the Night - The Five Satins
Dialogue: 0,3:19:22.93,3:19:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? In the still of the night ?
Dialogue: 0,3:19:28.80,3:19:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? I held you ?
Dialogue: 0,3:19:31.97,3:19:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? Held you tight ?
Dialogue: 0,3:19:32.68,3:19:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}爱尔兰人
Dialogue: 0,3:19:35.51,3:19:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? 'Cause I love ?
Dialogue: 0,3:19:37.18,3:19:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}听说你刷房子
Dialogue: 0,3:19:38.35,3:19:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? Love you so ?
Dialogue: 0,3:19:41.68,3:19:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? Promise I'll never ?
Dialogue: 0,3:19:44.93,3:19:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? Let you go ?
Dialogue: 0,3:19:46.80,3:19:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? In the still of the night ?
Dialogue: 0,3:19:54.72,3:19:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? I remember ?
Dialogue: 0,3:19:57.85,3:20:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? That night in May ?
Dialogue: 0,3:20:01.39,3:20:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? The stars were bright above ?
Dialogue: 0,3:20:07.93,3:20:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? I'll hope and I'll pray ?
Dialogue: 0,3:20:14.97,3:20:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? To keep Your precious love ?
Dialogue: 0,3:20:20.93,3:20:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? Well before the light ?
Dialogue: 0,3:20:27.60,3:20:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? Hold me again ?
Dialogue: 0,3:20:30.55,3:20:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? With all of your might ?
Dialogue: 0,3:20:32.72,3:20:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? In the still of the night ?
Dialogue: 0,3:21:13.89,3:21:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? So before the light ?
Dialogue: 0,3:21:20.60,3:21:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? Hold me again ?
Dialogue: 0,3:21:23.76,3:21:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? With all of your might ?
Dialogue: 0,3:21:25.55,3:21:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}? In the still of the night ?
